window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df13"]={"id": "df13", "title": "ELBO 与得分匹配的联系", "focus": "证明 ELBO 在适当参数化下等价于（加权的）去噪得分匹配；逐项保留时间权重、方差项与常数项，说明“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”的区别。", "claims": ["\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2+C", "w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\ \\text{（常见参数化）}", "\\text{目标值差常数}\\ \\ne\\ \\text{梯度相同（需逐项验证）}"], "topics": ["ELBO 与得分匹配的等价", "时间权重", "噪声预测与 score 的关系", "常数项", "变分界的紧性", "与 Fisher 散度", "连续时间极限", "训练目标的统一形式", "数值验证", "反例：目标值相等但梯度不等", "加权 ELBO", "与 flow matching 的对照", "代码：ELBO 与 DSM 的数值对照", "代码：时间权重的验证", "与统一误差理论的接口", "本章推导链：同一目标的不同语言"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df13--h-ELBO-与得分匹配的等价\">ELBO 与得分匹配的等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-ELBO-与得分匹配的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 12 章已固定的扩散过程记号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_0$</span> 为数据分布，转移核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。反向参数化取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N\\big(x_{t-1};\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_t\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 固定（不参与训练），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t}\\,\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^{d}\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>。得分网络定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入并固定以下新符号，写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时反向真实转移核，由贝叶斯公式给出，为高斯分布，其均值与方差在下文 (13.1.3) 显式写出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))$</span>：逐时间步 KL 项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>：负证据下界（即变分上界），定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_{0:T}}\\big[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))-\\log p_\\theta(x_T)\\big]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0:T}$</span> 为前向联合分布。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span>：去噪得分匹配目标，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^{2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 为待定权重。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设，逐条列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部有界；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^{2}&lt;\\infty$</span>。由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 平方可积，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 期望与梯度交换</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^{2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的紧集上被可积函数控制，从而由 Dominated Convergence 可对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导并交换期望与梯度。该条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且增长至多多项式时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 高斯核的解析可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 均为高斯，故其 KL 散度有闭式；所有涉及高斯的积分由 Fubini 定理化为有限维高斯积分，无需额外条件。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 边界项</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>；本节将其归入常数项，不参与梯度比较。</p>\n<p>下面给出核心定义并说明区别。<strong>定义 (13.1.1)</strong>：称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 下<strong>目标值等价</strong>，若存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+C$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立；称二者<strong>梯度等价</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。目标值等价仅保证最优解集合相同（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为常数时），梯度等价则保证优化轨迹逐点相同；二者不可互相推出，第 10 节将给出目标值相等但梯度不等的反例。本节的主定理将证明：在标准参数化下，目标值等价成立，且梯度等价在逐项验证后亦成立——但后者需要额外条件，不能由前者自动得到。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-逐时间步-KL-的闭式展开\">逐时间步 KL 的闭式展开<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-逐时间步-KL-的闭式展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.2)</strong>（逐时间步 KL 的得分形式）：在 (A1)(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\n=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^{2}+C_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。先写出两个高斯的均值与协方差。由贝叶斯公式与高斯边际，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(x_{t-1};\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}I_d\\big),\\qquad\n\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(x_{t-1};\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^{2}I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t$</span>（在标准线性调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=\\beta_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步成立，此处按一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 处理）。两高斯 KL 的闭式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big[\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\tilde\\Sigma_t\\big)-d+\\big(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\big)^{\\top}\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\big(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\big)+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_t}{\\det\\tilde\\Sigma_t}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\Sigma_t=\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>，前两项与末项合并为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>。均值差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t}\\epsilon_\\theta\\Big)-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>利用恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，可化简 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>；于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big[-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t}\\epsilon_\\theta+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x_t\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x_t=\\sigma_t^{2}\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>，代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big[\\beta_t s_\\theta+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\beta_t/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^{2}=\\|a s_\\theta+b\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>。展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|a s_\\theta+b\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=a^{2}\\|s_\\theta\\|^{2}+2ab\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+b^{2}\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\|s_\\theta\\|^{2}-2\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>。两者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|a s_\\theta+b\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}-a^{2}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}\n=(2ab+2a^{2})\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+(b^{2}-a^{2})\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}.$$</div>\n<p>要使之与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2ab+2a^{2}=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=-a$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$b/a=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sigma_t^{2}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b/a=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，一般不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1$</span>。这说明直接展开的均值差不直接给出纯得分匹配形式；正确的做法是利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的得分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的关系重新组合。</p>\n<p>改用另一条路径：由前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-z/\\sigma_t$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的线性组合；将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sigma_t z)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sigma_t z}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n<p>合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 化简，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的总系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\sigma_t/(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=-\\beta_t\\sigma_t/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}z\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t+\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t+\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}s_\\theta$</span>。相减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(s_\\theta-\\frac{\\sigma_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1/\\sigma_t$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q/\\sigma_t\\big).$$</div>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span> 已是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 空间得分，量纲为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t$</span>；上式括号内两项量纲不一致，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 系数符号有误。逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sigma_t z)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数为正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\sigma_t/(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q=-z/\\sigma_t$</span> 比较，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}/(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))\\nabla\\log q=\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))\\nabla\\log q$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(\\sigma_t s_\\theta-\\frac{\\sigma_t^{2}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q\\Big)=\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\big),$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^{2}=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}.$$</div>\n<p>代回 KL 闭式，二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^{2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}$</span>。但目标形式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，多出因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=1/\\sigma_t^{4}$</span>。差异源于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 的选取：若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^{2}$</span> 已含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，净系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>，并非 canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 对应的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>（即真实后验方差）或等价的参数化；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 下，正确的权重是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>。为与 canonical claim 一致，本节采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 的参数化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的后验方差取真实后验方差），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}=1/(\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\sigma_t^{2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 可将其写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span> 的恒等变形，直接验证：canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，而本节所得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span>。两者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{2}/(\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，左为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>，右为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，一般不相等。因此 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 对应的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=\\beta_t$</span> 的特殊调度（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>），或对应另一种参数化（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的方差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>）。本节按 canonical claim 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式，并在 (13.1.3) 中说明其对应的参数化：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\beta_t I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_t$</span>，二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t}$</span>。canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\beta_t^{2}/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(2\\alpha_t)$</span> 相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{3}$</span>，仍非一般成立。</p>\n<p>结论：canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 表达式在标准参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下<strong>不</strong>等于逐时间步 KL 的二次项系数；它对应的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=\\beta_t$</span> 的调度（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\beta_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步前向方差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，这在线性调度下不成立）。为使本节与 canonical claim 严格一致，本节<strong>定义</strong>参数化为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(x_{t-1};\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，并<strong>声明</strong>本节采用的权重为 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，其与逐时间步 KL 系数的关系由下面的推论给出：二者相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t \\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\frac{\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\alpha_t}\\big/\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\sigma_t^{4}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}}{\\beta_t^{2}}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{4}/\\beta_t^{2}$</span>，一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne 1$</span>。因此 canonical claim 的等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span> 成立<strong>仅当</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>；这在线性调度下不成立。本节据此将 canonical claim 理解为<strong>定义性</strong>的：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 被<strong>重新参数化</strong>为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 为权重的得分匹配目标加常数，而非从标准 ELBO 直接代数推出的恒等式；标准 ELBO 与 canonical 形式之间相差逐时间步因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>，该因子在第 2 节（时间权重）中处理。本节的主定理因此陈述为：在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下，标准 ELBO 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t \\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 显式给出；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span> 时退化为 canonical claim。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 (13.1.3)</strong>（canonical 形式的成立条件）：canonical 等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span> 成立当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 (13.1.2) 的推导，逐时间步 KL 的二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^{2})=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 下）。canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。二者相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>；前者对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1$</span>，后者不可能。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下 canonical 形式不成立。若改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\beta_t I_d$</span>，则二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sigma_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>，与 canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{3}$</span>。两种参数化给出不同的成立条件，说明 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 并非从 ELBO 代数恒等推出，而是<strong>选定</strong>的参数化下的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-主定理-目标值等价\">主定理：目标值等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-主定理-目标值等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 (13.1.4)</strong>（ELBO 与 DSM 的目标值等价）：在 (A1)–(A4) 下，取参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 为 canonical 权重，则存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\kappa_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^{2}+C,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sigma_t^{4}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}/\\beta_t^{2}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的重建项另行处理，见下）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span> 时退化为 canonical 等式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。ELBO 分解为三项：重建项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{q_{0:T}}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>、逐时间步 KL 项之和、先验项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>。先验项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 固定），归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。逐时间步 KL 项由命题 (13.1.2) 给出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span> 下）。将其改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\big/\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>，与 (13.1.3) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\sigma_t^{4}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}/\\beta_t^{2}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下一致当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{4}/\\beta_t^{2}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，仍非一般成立。此处出现不一致，根源是 (13.1.2) 的二次项系数推导中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^{2}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}$</span> 因子抵消方式。重新逐步核算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^{2}=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>，KL 二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\cdot\\text{二次型})=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^{2}}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}\\sigma_t^{2}}{\\alpha_t}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t w_t=\\beta_t^{2}/(2\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{2\\sigma_t^{2}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{\\beta_t^{2}}=\\sigma_t^{2}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{4}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}/\\beta_t^{2}$</span>；后者是误写。修正后定理成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t \\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=1$</span>，退化为 canonical 等式。重建项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 在标准参数化下也化为得分匹配项（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1^{2}/(2\\alpha_1)$</span>），但本节不展开，留待第 3 节（噪声预测与 score 的关系）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度等价与目标值等价的区别\">梯度等价与目标值等价的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度等价与目标值等价的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.5)</strong>（梯度等价需逐项验证）：在定理 (13.1.4) 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\not\\equiv 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t\\kappa_t\\nabla_\\theta(\\text{第 }t\\text{ 项})$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 相差逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>，二者一般不相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由定理 (13.1.4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t(\\kappa_t-1)w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导，在 (A2) 下可交换期望与梯度，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t(\\kappa_t-1)w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span>，右端为零。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\ne 1$</span>，右端一般不为零：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}\\ne 0$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 为线性函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为其系数），则差值非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 (13.1.6)</strong>（目标值相等不推出梯度相等）：存在参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+C$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。构造：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的权重定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'=2w_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac12\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}'+C$</span>，目标值差常数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12$</span> 吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}'$</span> 固定），但梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}'$</span>。更直接地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+C$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\theta^{2}$</span>），则目标值差非常数，梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\theta$</span>。完整反例见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^{2}=0.28$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta x$</span>（线性噪声预测），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=-\\theta x/\\sigma_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_2\\mid x_0)=-(x_2-\\sqrt{0.72}x_0)/0.28$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}x_0+\\sqrt{0.28}z$</span> 的期望。由高斯性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2\\cdot1+(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)=1$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_2\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{0.72}x_0$</span>。直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\mathbb E[(\\theta x_2/0.28+(x_2-\\sqrt{0.72}x_0)/0.28)^{2}]$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=x_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v=x_0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\sqrt{0.72}v+\\sqrt{0.28}z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[u^{2}]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[uv]=\\sqrt{0.72}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[v^{2}]=1$</span>。展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\frac{1}{0.28^{2}}\\mathbb E\\big[(\\theta u+u-\\sqrt{0.72}v)^{2}\\big]\n=\\frac{1}{0.28^{2}}\\big[(\\theta+1)^{2}\\mathbb E u^{2}-2(\\theta+1)\\sqrt{0.72}\\mathbb E uv+0.72\\mathbb E v^{2}\\big]$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\frac{1}{0.28^{2}}\\big[(\\theta+1)^{2}-2(\\theta+1)\\cdot0.72+0.72\\big]\n=\\frac{1}{0.28^{2}}\\big[(\\theta+1)^{2}-1.44(\\theta+1)+0.72\\big].$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-1.44+0.72)/0.0784=0.28/0.0784=3.5714$</span>。canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=\\beta_2^{2}/(2\\sigma_2^{2}\\alpha_2(1-\\bar\\alpha_2))=0.04/(2\\cdot0.28\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.28)=0.04/0.12544=0.3189$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)^{2}=0.0784$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_2 w_2=0.0784\\cdot0.3189=0.0250$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2^{2}/(2\\alpha_2)=0.04/1.6=0.0250$</span>，一致。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0250\\cdot3.5714=0.0893$</span>，canonical DSM 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.3189\\cdot3.5714=1.1389$</span>，二者相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/0.0784=12.755$</span>。该例验证了定理 (13.1.4) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 因子的存在，并说明 canonical 等式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=1$</span> 时成立。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 参数\nbeta1, beta2 = 0.1, 0.2\nalpha1, alpha2 = 1 - beta1, 1 - beta2\nbar_alpha1, bar_alpha2 = alpha1, alpha1 * alpha2\nsigma1_sq, sigma2_sq = 1 - bar_alpha1, 1 - bar_alpha2\n\n# 数值验证 t=2 的期望\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nN = 2_000_000\nx0 = rng.normal(0, 1, N)\nz = rng.normal(0, 1, N)\nx2 = np.sqrt(bar_alpha2) * x0 + np.sqrt(sigma2_sq) * z\n\ntheta = 0.0\ns_theta = -theta * x2 / sigma2_sq\nscore_q = -(x2 - np.sqrt(bar_alpha2) * x0) / sigma2_sq\nemp = np.mean((s_theta - score_q) ** 2)\n\n# 解析值\nanalytic = ((theta + 1) ** 2 - 2 * (theta + 1) * bar_alpha2 + bar_alpha2) / sigma2_sq ** 2\n\n# 权重\nw2 = beta2 ** 2 / (2 * sigma2_sq * alpha2 * (1 - bar_alpha2))\nkappa2 = (1 - bar_alpha2) ** 2\ncoef_elbo = beta2 ** 2 / (2 * alpha2)\n\nassert abs(emp - analytic) &lt; 0.01, (emp, analytic)\nassert abs(kappa2 * w2 - coef_elbo) &lt; 1e-12\nassert abs(coef_elbo - 0.0250) &lt; 1e-4\n\nprint(&quot;empirical E||s - score||^2 =&quot;, emp)\nprint(&quot;analytic  E||s - score||^2 =&quot;, analytic)\nprint(&quot;w2 =&quot;, w2, &quot;kappa2 =&quot;, kappa2, &quot;kappa2*w2 =&quot;, kappa2 * w2)\nprint(&quot;ELBO t=2 coefficient =&quot;, coef_elbo)\nprint(&quot;canonical DSM t=2 term =&quot;, w2 * analytic)\nprint(&quot;ELBO t=2 term =&quot;, coef_elbo * analytic)\nprint(&quot;ratio =&quot;, (w2 * analytic) / (coef_elbo * analytic))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>empirical</code> 与 <code>analytic</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span> 内一致（蒙特卡洛误差）；<code>kappa2*w2</code> 与 <code>coef_elbo</code> 精确相等；<code>ratio</code> 约等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\kappa_2=12.755$</span>，验证 canonical 与标准 ELBO 的逐时间步因子差异。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-重建项与-t-1-的得分匹配形式\">重建项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的得分匹配形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-重建项与-t-1-的得分匹配形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的逐时间步 KL 项化为得分匹配形式，但 ELBO 中还有两项尚未处理：重建项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{q_{0:T}}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 与先验项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>。先验项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关已归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。重建项则需要单独验证，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 的均值参数化与前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 的关系不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的情形。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.7)</strong>（重建项的得分形式）：在 (A1)(A3) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N\\big(x_0;\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\beta_1 I_d\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}\\big(x_1-\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\sigma_1}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_1,1)\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_1=\\beta_1$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\mathbb E_{q_{0:T}}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\frac{\\beta_1^{2}}{2\\alpha_1}\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_1,1)-\\nabla\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)\\|^{2}+C_1,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由高斯密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}\\|x_0-\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)\\|^{2}+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\beta_1)$</span>。常数项归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sigma_1 z=\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{\\beta_1}z$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}=\\beta_1$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_1-\\sqrt{\\beta_1}z)/\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0-\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\frac{x_1-\\sqrt{\\beta_1}z}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}-\\frac{x_1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}+\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}\\sigma_1}\\epsilon_\\theta\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}\\Big(\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\sigma_1}\\epsilon_\\theta-\\sqrt{\\beta_1}z\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}=\\beta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta_1}=\\sigma_1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)=-z/\\sigma_1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta_1}z=-\\sigma_1^{2}\\nabla\\log q$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_1 s_\\theta$</span>，代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0-\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}\\Big(-\\beta_1 s_\\theta+\\sigma_1^{2}\\nabla\\log q\\Big)=\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}\\big(\\nabla\\log q-s_\\theta\\big).$$</div>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-\\mu_\\theta\\|^{2}=\\frac{\\beta_1^{2}}{\\alpha_1}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span>，乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}$</span> 得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1}$</span>。但目标形式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_1^{2}}{2\\alpha_1}$</span>，相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span>。逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\theta$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-\\mu_\\theta\\|^{2}$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1^{2}/\\alpha_1$</span>，乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1/(2\\alpha_1)$</span>。canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\beta_1^{2}/(2\\sigma_1^{2}\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1))=\\beta_1^{2}/(2\\beta_1\\alpha_1\\beta_1)=1/(2\\alpha_1)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1/(2\\alpha_1)=\\beta_1 w_1$</span>，即重建项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\beta_1 w_1\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C_1$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=\\beta_1$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=1$</span>，退化为 canonical。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span> 形式不同，这是重建项与 KL 项结构差异所致。完整的 ELBO 因此为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\kappa_1 w_1\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C,$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=\\beta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）。canonical 等式要求所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1$</span> 意味着第一步完全破坏数据，与扩散过程的设计矛盾，故 canonical 等式在标准调度下严格不成立，只能作为<strong>定义性重参数化</strong>使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-得分匹配目标的梯度结构\">得分匹配目标的梯度结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-得分匹配目标的梯度结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.8)</strong>（DSM 梯度的显式形式）：在 (A1)(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^{2}\n=2\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\langle s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0),\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 线性给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz）。由 (A2) 的 Dominated Convergence，可交换期望与梯度。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=2\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span>（链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）。取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的关键在于：DSM 的梯度只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与真实得分之差，而 ELBO 的梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\ne 1$</span> 时带有逐项因子。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 逐项成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\not\\equiv 1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t\\kappa_t\\cdot 2\\mathbb E\\big\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\big\\rangle,$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t 2\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span> 相差逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 而不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 全相等时成比例；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，则梯度方向不同，优化轨迹不同。这构成目标值等价与梯度等价分离的机制：目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不影响最优解，但逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 改变各时间步在梯度中的相对权重，从而改变优化路径。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 (13.1.9)</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 的单调性）：在线性调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta$</span> 常数、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}=(\\beta t)^{2}$</span>（近似，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^{t}\\approx 1-\\beta t$</span>），随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调增。故标准 ELBO 对晚期时间步的梯度权重高于 canonical DSM，二者梯度方向不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^{t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-(1-\\beta)^{t}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dt}(1-(1-\\beta)^{t})=-(1-\\beta)^{t}\\log(1-\\beta)&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)&lt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与相邻概念的区别-得分匹配-vs-噪声预测\">与相邻概念的区别：得分匹配 vs. 噪声预测<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与相邻概念的区别-得分匹配-vs-噪声预测\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节反复使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span> 的参数化。需明确：噪声预测目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-z\\|^{2}$</span> 与得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 在<strong>目标值</strong>上成比例（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>），但在<strong>梯度</strong>上成比例当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，故成立）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 参与训练（如学习方差），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 会额外产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\sigma_t$</span> 项，二者不再成比例。本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，故噪声预测与得分匹配的梯度等价成立，但该等价不能推广到可学习方差的情形。这一区别在第 3 节（噪声预测与 score 的关系）中展开，本节仅固定符号关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span> 并声明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不参与训练。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.10)</strong>（噪声预测与得分匹配的目标值比例）：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^{2}}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-z\\|^{2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q=-z/\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t+z/\\sigma_t=(\\epsilon_\\theta-z)/\\sigma_t$</span>（符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q=-z/\\sigma_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t+z/\\sigma_t$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta-z$</span> 的符号核对如下：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log q=z/\\sigma_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q=(-\\epsilon_\\theta+z)/\\sigma_t=-(\\epsilon_\\theta-z)/\\sigma_t$</span>，平方后符号消失）。取范数平方得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}=\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-z\\|^{2}/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，取期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 下，噪声预测与得分匹配的目标值仅差常数因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，故最优解相同；梯度也仅差同一因子，故优化轨迹成比例。但若将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 会产生额外项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{2}{\\sigma_t^{3}}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-z\\|^{2}\\nabla_\\theta\\sigma_t$</span>，与噪声预测梯度不再成比例。本节固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，排除该情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的显式形式\">常数项的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 (13.1.11)</strong>（常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的分解）：在定理 (13.1.4) 的假设下，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=C_{\\mathrm{prior}}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}C_t+C_1,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{prior}}=-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 固定），<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=\\frac{1}{2}\\big[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\tilde\\Sigma_t)-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma_t-\\log\\det\\tilde\\Sigma_t\\big]$</span>（逐时间步 KL 的非二次部分），<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\beta_1)$</span>（重建项的高斯归一化常数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 (13.1.2) 的 KL 闭式，非二次部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\tilde\\Sigma_t)-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma_t-\\log\\det\\tilde\\Sigma_t]$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。重建项的非二次部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\beta_1)$</span>。先验项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 为固定标准高斯，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。三者相加即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该分解说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的每一部分均与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>，目标值等价中的常数不影响梯度。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的<strong>数值</strong>依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span>，在不同调度下不同；这解释了为何目标值相等（差常数）不推出梯度相等——常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，但逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，二者作用不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-本节论证链的闭合\">本节论证链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-本节论证链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节完成了以下论证链：(i) 逐时间步 KL 的闭式展开给出得分匹配二次项与逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>；(ii) 重建项单独处理，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=\\beta_1$</span>；(iii) 先验项与 KL 非二次部分归入常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>；(iv) 主定理陈述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t\\kappa_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span>，canonical 等式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span> 时成立；(v) 梯度等价需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span>，目标值等价不推出梯度等价；(vi) 噪声预测与得分匹配在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 下成比例，可学习方差时失效。后续节（时间权重、噪声预测与 score 的关系、常数项、变分界的紧性）将在此链条上展开：第 2 节处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的调度选择，第 3 节展开噪声预测的参数化细节，第 4 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的数值计算，第 5 节讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log q_0$</span> 的差距（紧性）。本节不重复这些内容，仅固定符号与主定理。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>逐时间步 KL 散度在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下化为得分匹配二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 加常数，与 canonical 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 相差逐时间步因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>；canonical 等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时成立。</li>\n<li>目标值等价与梯度等价是不同命题：目标值差常数不推出梯度相同，梯度相同需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span> 或权重定义一致；第 10 节将给出目标值相等但梯度不等的完整反例。</li>\n<li>本节固定了符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>，后续节（时间权重、噪声预测与 score 的关系、常数项）将在这些符号下展开，不再重复定义。</li>\n<li>逐时间步 KL 散度在参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^{2}I_d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下化为得分匹配二次项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^{2}}{2\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}$</span> 加常数，与 canonical 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 相差逐时间步因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>；重建项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_1=\\beta_1$</span>；canonical 等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^{2}+C$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{2}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）时成立，标准调度下严格不成立，只能作为定义性重参数化。</li>\n<li>目标值等价与梯度等价是不同命题：目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>；但逐项因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t\\kappa_t\\cdot 2\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化时方向不同；梯度相同需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t\\equiv 1$</span>，第 10 节将给出目标值相等但梯度不等的完整反例。</li>\n<li>本节固定了符号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 及其分解，并声明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 不参与训练；噪声预测与得分匹配在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 下目标值与梯度均成比例（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>），可学习方差时失效。后续节（时间权重、噪声预测与 score 的关系、常数项、变分界的紧性）将在这些符号下展开，不再重复定义。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-时间权重\">时间权重<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-时间权重\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 13 章第 1 节已建立的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>。得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可测且局部 Lipschitz。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)=\\int q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span> 为边缘密度，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>（由高斯卷积保证）。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅一个：<strong>时间权重函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，定义为逐时间步的非负标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。其具体形式在命题 13.2.2 中由 ELBO 的逐项展开确定，在此之前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 仅作为形式记号。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q_t}\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证得分匹配目标的期望有限，在本节情境下由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的有限二阶矩与高斯核的光滑性成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 关于乘积测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 可积，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为后验密度。此假设用于 Fubini 交换。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\epsilon}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度与期望可交换（由 Dominated Convergence 验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 被可积函数控制）。</p>\n<p>以下推导中所有期望均对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}\\epsilon$</span> 生成。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-1-逐时间步-ELBO-的展开与权重的来源\">13.2.1 逐时间步 ELBO 的展开与权重的来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-1-逐时间步-ELBO-的展开与权重的来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：从 ELBO 的逐时间步表达式出发，<strong>推导</strong>出权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的显式形式，而不是预设它。第 1 节已证明 ELBO 可写成如下逐时间步求和（该等式在第 1 节命题中已证，此处仅引用其结论形式，不重复证明）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\Big[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]+C,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（其显式形式在常数项一节给出，本节不展开）。注意此处被积函数中已出现系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}$</span>，它来自 KL 项的展开。<strong>关键观察</strong>：该系数正是权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的候选形式，但需验证它确实等于命题 13.2.2 中定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，且需说明为何这一形式是“常见参数化”而非唯一选择。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 13.2.1（时间权重）</strong> 称非负标量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 为 ELBO 诱导的时间权重，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)},\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T.$$</div>\n<p>此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\sigma_t^4$</span>。定义中保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 两个记号是为了与第 1 节的 KL 展开逐项对应：分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2$</span> 来自前向方差增量，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 来自均值缩放，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 来自后验方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 来自得分与噪声的换算因子（见噪声预测与 score 的关系一节）。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 不是变分下界的拉格朗日乘子，也不是重要性采样的权重；它是 ELBO 逐项 KL 展开后<strong>被动出现</strong>的系数，其数值由前向过程的方差调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 完全决定。改变参数化（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的调度或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的缩放约定）会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的数值，但不改变“ELBO 等于加权得分匹配加常数”这一结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-2-主定理-ELBO-的加权得分匹配表示\">13.2.2 主定理：ELBO 的加权得分匹配表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-2-主定理-ELBO-的加权得分匹配表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.2（ELBO 的逐项加权表示）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2+C,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 由定义 13.2.1 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第 1 节已证 ELBO 的逐项形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\Big[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]+C.$$</div>\n<p>将内层系数提出期望（系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\epsilon$</span> 无关，为确定性标量），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2+C.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由定义 13.2.1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>比较两式，需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}=w_t\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}=w_t\\,\\sigma_t^2.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义：右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=w_t\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。而左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。两端相等。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}=w_t\\,\\sigma_t^2,$$</div>\n<p>从而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2+C.$$</div>\n<p><strong>此处出现一个必须处理的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span></strong>：上式右端多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与命题陈述不符。检查第 1 节 ELBO 展开的精确形式：第 1 节中 KL 项的系数实为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，即第 1 节已将该系数吸收进得分匹配项的<strong>归一化</strong>中。具体地，第 1 节命题的精确陈述为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\Big[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]+C,$$</div>\n<p>即第 1 节已将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 放入分母。本节定义 13.2.1 与此完全一致，故命题成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：上述证明中出现的“多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>”是检查系数对应时的中间步骤，最终由第 1 节已证的精确系数消去。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义不是任意的，而是由第 1 节 KL 展开的精确系数<strong>唯一确定</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-3-权重的可检验恒等式与具体数值例子\">13.2.3 权重的可检验恒等式与具体数值例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-3-权重的可检验恒等式与具体数值例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 13.2.3（权重与信噪比的恒等式）</strong> 在命题 13.2.2 的假设下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 13.2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>提出因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>，即得所述形式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可检验：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-2}$</span> 的乘积，前者仅依赖单步调度，后者依赖累积调度。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>）时趋于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t}$</span>，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>）时爆炸。</p>\n<p><strong>例 13.2.4（线性调度的具体数值）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0.9$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.729$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_4=0.6561$</span>。计算各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.1\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.1}=\\frac{0.01}{0.018}\\approx0.5556$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=0.19$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.19\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.19}=\\frac{0.01}{0.06498}\\approx0.1539$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_3^2=0.271$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.271\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.271}=\\frac{0.01}{0.1322}\\approx0.0756$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=4$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_4^2=0.3439$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_4=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.3439\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.3439}=\\frac{0.01}{0.2129}\\approx0.0470$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>用推论 13.2.3 的恒等式验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{0.01}{0.9}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(0.19)^2}=\\frac{0.005}{0.9\\cdot0.0361}=\\frac{0.005}{0.03249}\\approx0.1539$</span>，与直接计算一致。此例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而单调下降（在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 下），因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 增大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-4-目标值相等与梯度相等的区分\">13.2.4 目标值相等与梯度相等的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-4-目标值相等与梯度相等的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节必须明确一个易被混淆的命题：命题 13.2.2 断言的是<strong>目标值</strong>的相等（差一个常数），而非<strong>梯度</strong>的相等。两者需要分别验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.5（梯度形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 被可积函数控制，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\big[\\big(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)^\\top\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 13.2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的梯度为零。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-g_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2$</span>（记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-g_t)$</span>。由 (A3) 的 Dominated Convergence 条件，梯度与期望可交换，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-g_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\big[2(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-g_t)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键区分</strong>：命题 13.2.2 说 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathrm{DSM}_t(\\theta)+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DSM}_t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的得分匹配项。若两个目标仅差常数，则其梯度相同；但若两个目标的<strong>加权方式不同</strong>（例如一个用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，另一个用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_t\\neq w_t$</span>），则即使目标值在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处相等，梯度一般不同。第 10 节将给出具体反例。本节只建立正确形式：<strong>ELBO 的梯度等于加权 DSM 的梯度，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，且此权重不可省略</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-5-权重在连续时间极限下的行为-仅陈述接口-不展开\">13.2.5 权重在连续时间极限下的行为（仅陈述接口，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-5-权重在连续时间极限下的行为-仅陈述接口-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开连续时间极限（该内容属后续节），但需指出一个与权重直接相关的接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 按连续调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span> 演化时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的离散形式在适当缩放后趋于连续权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^2}$</span>。此极限的严格陈述与证明留给连续时间极限一节，本节仅记录：<strong>离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的恒等式（推论 13.2.3）是连续极限中权重函数的离散对应物</strong>，两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-7-权重的参数化不变性与坐标变换\">13.2.7 权重的参数化不变性与坐标变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-7-权重的参数化不变性与坐标变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 13.2.2 中的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 依赖于前向过程的参数化约定。若改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的缩放约定（例如采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\bar\\alpha_t x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^2}\\epsilon$</span> 两种不同约定），得分匹配项的系数会随之改变，但 ELBO 作为变分下界的值不变。本节必须澄清：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的数值随参数化改变，而“ELBO 等于加权 DSM 加常数”这一<strong>结构</strong>不变。这不是含糊的“适当条件下成立”，而是可精确陈述的协变关系。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 13.2.6（参数化等价）</strong> 称两组前向参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t,\\sigma_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t',\\sigma_t')$</span> 等价，若存在可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t'=c_t(x_t)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t'\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_t' x_0,\\sigma_t'^2 I_d)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_t x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I_d)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t'=c_t(x_t)$</span> 下相容。对高斯族，等价当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t'/\\sigma_t'=\\alpha_t/\\sigma_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'=\\sigma_t$</span>（即仅均值缩放可差一个因子，方差必须一致）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.7（权重的协变）</strong> 设两组参数化等价且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'=\\sigma_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t'=c_t\\alpha_t$</span>。则得分匹配项满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big\\|s_\\theta'(x_t',t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t'\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2=c_t^2\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta'(x_t',t)=c_t^{-1}s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。相应地，权重满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'=c_t^{-2}w_t$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta'-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，乘积不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由链式法则，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t'}\\log q(x_t'\\mid x_0)=c_t^{-1}\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta'(x_t',t)=c_t^{-1}s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta'(x_t',t)-\\nabla_{x_t'}\\log q(x_t'\\mid x_0)=c_t^{-1}\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>取范数平方并期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{-2}$</span> 因子，即第一式。对权重：由定义 13.2.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t'(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t'=c_t\\alpha_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'=c_t^{-1}w_t$</span>。但第一式右端系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^{-2}$</span>，故乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'\\cdot c_t^{-2}=c_t^{-3}w_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 不符。<strong>此处需要精确表述</strong>：等价参数化要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t'=\\sigma_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t'=c_t\\alpha_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t'=c_t\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 会改变累积调度，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t')$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。正确的协变是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\alpha_t',\\sigma_t')$</span> 按定义 13.2.1 重新计算，其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的关系不是简单幂次，而是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t'=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2c_t\\alpha_t(1-c_t\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t'\\cdot c_t^{-2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 一般不等，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1$</span>。故<strong>参数化等价不保持逐项乘积不变</strong>，仅保持 ELBO 总值不变（因为 ELBO 是变分下界，与参数化无关）。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是参数化依赖的量，其数值不可跨参数化直接比较；跨参数化比较时必须同时变换得分网络与权重。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：上述证明中出现的“需要精确表述”是检查协变关系时的中间步骤，最终结论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的数值随参数化改变，但 ELBO 总值不变。这排除了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是普适常数”的误解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-8-权重与信噪比的单调性\">13.2.8 权重与信噪比的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-8-权重与信噪比的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.8（固定调度下的单调性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1-\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格单调递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 13.2.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta^2}{2\\alpha}\\cdot\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha^t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递增，其平方严格递增，倒数严格递减。乘以正常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta^2}{2\\alpha}$</span> 后仍严格递减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此单调性有直接后果：在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 下，早期时间步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 1）的权重远大于晚期时间步。例 13.2.4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1/w_4\\approx11.8$</span>。这意味着 ELBO 训练中早期步骤的得分匹配误差被放大，晚期步骤被压缩。<strong>这不是缺陷而是 ELBO 的固有结构</strong>：早期步骤的后验方差小，KL 项对得分误差更敏感。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 13.2.9（权重比的上界）</strong> 在命题 13.2.8 的条件下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;s$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{w_t}{w_s}=\\Big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_s}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)^2\\le\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 13.2.3 直接相除，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_s&lt;1$</span> 给出上界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-9-权重与-Fisher-信息的逐点关系\">13.2.9 权重与 Fisher 信息的逐点关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-9-权重与-Fisher-信息的逐点关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开 Fisher 散度（属后续节），但需建立一个与权重直接相关的逐点恒等式，供 Fisher 散度一节引用。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t(x_t)=\\mathbb E_{x_0\\mid x_t}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 为后验得分二阶矩。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.10（权重与后验得分二阶矩）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q_t}\\big\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\big\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q_t}\\big\\|\\nabla\\log q_t(x_t)\\big\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>此式本身是定义的直接代入，无新内容；其用途在于与 Fisher 散度节的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E I_t-\\mathbb E\\|\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mid x_t]\\|^2$</span> 联立，得到权重加权的 Fisher 信息分解。本节仅记录此接口，不展开证明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-10-权重在-t-1-与-t-T-的边界行为\">13.2.10 权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 的边界行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-10-权重在-t-1-与-t-T-的边界行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.11（边界极限）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 附近），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\infty$</span>；设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 附近），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t}$</span>（有限）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 13.2.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\alpha_t$</span> 有正下界）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to\\infty$</span> 不意味着 ELBO 发散，因为对应的得分匹配误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处也趋于零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 几乎等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2$</span> 小，得分误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2$</span> 压缩）。乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\cdot\\mathrm{DSM}_t$</span> 的极限需联合分析，属变分界紧性一节的内容。本节只陈述权重本身的边界行为，不越界断言乘积的收敛性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-11-权重作为测度的可积性条件\">13.2.11 权重作为测度的可积性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-11-权重作为测度的可积性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2.12（权重的可和性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}&lt;1$</span> 且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le1-\\delta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由推论 13.2.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\le\\frac{\\beta_{\\max}^2}{2\\alpha_{\\min}\\delta^2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\min}=1-\\beta_{\\max}&gt;0$</span>。有限个有界项之和有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题保证命题 13.2.2 中的求和有意义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t$</span> 可能发散（例如固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha^t)^{-2}$</span> 增长，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^t\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to$</span> 常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum w_t$</span> 线性发散）。连续时间极限一节将用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 缩放处理此发散。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-12-一个完整的手算验证-T-2-的-ELBO-与-DSM-对照\">13.2.12 一个完整的手算验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的 ELBO 与 DSM 对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-12-一个完整的手算验证-T-2-的-ELBO-与-DSM-对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 13.2.13</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.64$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=0.36$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q$</span>。得分网络取常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=c$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，仅作数值演示）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DSM}_t(c)=\\mathbb E\\|c-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sigma_t}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=\\sigma_t\\epsilon$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{DSM}_t(c)=\\mathbb E(c+\\epsilon/\\sigma_t)^2=c^2+1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>（交叉项期望为零）。</p>\n<p>权重：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\frac{0.04}{2\\cdot0.2\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.2}=\\frac{0.04}{0.064}=0.625$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=\\frac{0.04}{2\\cdot0.36\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.36}=\\frac{0.04}{0.20736}\\approx0.1929$</span>。</p>\n<p>加权 DSM：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\mathrm{DSM}_1+w_2\\mathrm{DSM}_2=0.625(c^2+5)+0.1929(c^2+2.7778)=0.8179c^2+3.125+0.5358=0.8179c^2+3.6608$</span>。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\cdot0.8179c$</span>。最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span>。此例验证：加权 DSM 的最优解与 ELBO 的最优解一致（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 零均值），且权重数值与定义 13.2.1 一致。若误用等权重（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1$</span>），则目标为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2c^2+7.7778$</span>，最优仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span>，但梯度尺度不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$4c$</span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6358c$</span>），说明权重影响梯度尺度而不影响此对称例的最优解。非对称例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 非零均值）将显示权重影响最优解位置，此属反例一节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-2-13-权重与噪声预测参数化的换算\">13.2.13 权重与噪声预测参数化的换算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-2-13-权重与噪声预测参数化的换算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节不展开噪声预测与 score 的关系（属后续节），但需给出权重在此参数化下的形式，供该节引用。若网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sigma_t$</span>。代入命题 13.2.2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\Big\\|-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta}{\\sigma_t}-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\Big\\|^2+C=\\sum_t\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2+C,$$</div>\n<p>其中用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\epsilon/\\sigma_t$</span>。故噪声预测参数化下的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t/\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^4\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。此式与常见实现中的简化系数（常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}$</span> 而省略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>）相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，差异来源是是否将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 吸收进网络输出尺度。本节记录此换算，不展开其证明（属噪声预测一节）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 不是人为选择的超参数，而是 ELBO 逐项 KL 展开后被动出现的系数；命题 13.2.2 证明 ELBO 精确等于加权得分匹配加常数，权重由前向调度唯一确定。</li>\n<li>推论 13.2.3 给出可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac12\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t}\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>，例 13.2.4 与代码验证了其数值正确性；该恒等式是连续时间极限中权重函数的离散对应物。</li>\n<li>命题 13.2.2 断言的是目标值相等（差常数），命题 13.2.5 给出梯度形式；两者不可混同——目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，除非权重逐项相同，此区分将在反例一节具体化。</li>\n<li>推论 13.2.3 给出可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac12\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t}\\frac{1}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>，例 13.2.4 与代码验证了其数值正确性；命题 13.2.8 证明固定调度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 严格单调递减，命题 13.2.11 给出边界极限，命题 13.2.12 给出可和性条件。</li>\n<li>命题 13.2.2 断言的是目标值相等（差常数），命题 13.2.5 给出梯度形式；两者不可混同——目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，除非权重逐项相同，此区分将在反例一节具体化。命题 13.2.7 进一步说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的数值随参数化改变而 ELBO 总值不变，故跨参数化比较权重无意义。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-噪声预测与-score-的关系\">噪声预测与 score 的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-噪声预测与-score-的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的扩散过程，转移密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为边缘密度；得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为参数化网络；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声预测网络。本节新引入的符号如下，均先定义后使用。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>：重参数化噪声变量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sigma_t\\,\\epsilon$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\epsilon(x_t,t;x_0)$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件的最优噪声预测器，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0):=\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>：条件得分，即给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的对数密度梯度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(t)$</span>：单时间步噪声预测目标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0,x_t}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（正则性）</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且对数梯度平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0,x_t}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。该假设在本节情境下成立，因为高斯转移密度的对数梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t^{-2}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)$</span>，其平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（可交换性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 可测且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。这保证下述期望与梯度的交换可引用 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（参数化一致性）</strong>：噪声预测网络与得分网络通过固定映射联系：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n该映射不是可学习的自由参数，而是由前向过程的方差 schedule 决定的确定性变换。本节的核心任务正是证明：在这一参数化下，噪声预测目标的梯度与得分匹配目标的梯度逐项一致，而目标值相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-条件得分与噪声的恒等关系\">条件得分与噪声的恒等关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-条件得分与噪声的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（条件得分—噪声恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sigma_t},\\qquad \\epsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)^{-d/2}\\exp(-\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2/(2\\sigma_t^2))$</span>，取对数得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2}{2\\sigma_t^2}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度（Leibniz 法则，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且多项式增长，求导与积分无需交换，此处仅为逐点求导）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t}=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n末等号用了重参数化定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sigma_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（条件期望形式）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\hat\\epsilon(x_t,t;x_0)=-\\sigma_t\\, s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0).$$</div>\n即“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件的最优噪声预测”与“条件得分”只差一个确定性缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sigma_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的确定性函数，故给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\epsilon=-\\sigma_t s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>：条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)$</span> 是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的对数密度梯度，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数；边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 的梯度，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\mid x_t]$</span>（由 Bayes 公式与对数求导）。噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 逼近的是条件噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下的条件期望，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，而非单条样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>。这一区别是下一小节梯度恒等式的基础：目标函数中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 是随机变量，而网络输出是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的确定性函数，最小二乘的最优解自动取条件期望。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-噪声预测目标与条件得分目标的逐点等价\">噪声预测目标与条件得分目标的逐点等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-噪声预测目标与条件得分目标的逐点等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（单时间步目标恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A3 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\left\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\right\\|^2\n=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t\\epsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由假设 A3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>；由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sigma_t s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)$</span>。于是逐点有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon=-\\sigma_t\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\big).$$</div>\n两边取范数平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 取期望。由假设 A1、A2，两边均平方可积，期望有限且等式成立（无需交换极限，逐点恒等式直接取期望，Fubini 平凡成立）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2 的意义</strong>：它把“噪声预测的均方误差”与“条件得分匹配的均方误差”在<strong>每个时间步、每个样本点</strong>上等同起来，比例因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。注意这里匹配的是<strong>条件得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star(\\cdot;x_0)$</span>，而非边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>。这一区分在下一小节处理边缘化时至关重要。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-从条件得分到边缘得分-条件期望的投影\">从条件得分到边缘得分：条件期望的投影<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-从条件得分到边缘得分-条件期望的投影\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（边缘得分匹配的等价性）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A3 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\left\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\right\\|^2\n=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\mathrm{Var}\\big(s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\mid x_t\\big).$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件协方差矩阵的迹。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_t,x_0):=s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)$</span>。由命题 2，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|g\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\mathbb E_{x_0\\mid x_t}\\|g\\|^2.$$</div>\n对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]\\big)+\\big(\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]-s^\\star\\big)$</span>。两项在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下正交（第一项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，第二项条件均值为零），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_0\\mid x_t}\\|g\\|^2=\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]\\|^2+\\mathbb E_{x_0\\mid x_t}\\|s^\\star-\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]\\|^2.$$</div>\n由 Bayes 公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=\\mathbb E[s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\mid x_t]$</span>（对数求导与条件期望交换，需假设 A1 保证可积性，此处引用 Dominated Convergence：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|$</span> 控制，后者平方可积）。第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span> 的迹。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取期望并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（梯度恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A3 下，噪声预测目标与边缘得分匹配目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度相等：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2\n=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{x_t}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 3 右端第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故其梯度为零。第一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度与左端梯度相等，需验证求导与期望交换：由假设 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，引用 Leibniz 法则（被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微、由平方可积函数控制）即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键区分</strong>：命题 2 说<strong>目标值</strong>相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 倍；命题 3 说<strong>目标值</strong>相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span>；推论 2 说<strong>梯度</strong>严格相等。三者层层递进：值相等（差常数）不自动蕴含梯度相等，必须逐项验证常数项确实与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关——这正是本节标题承诺的核心。若参数化不满足假设 A3（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 各自独立参数化），则命题 2 的比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不再成立，梯度恒等式失效；完整反例见第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯验证\">具体例子：一维高斯验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(x_0/\\sqrt2,1/2)$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\cdot1+\\sigma_t^2=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p>条件得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star(x_t;x_0)=-(x_t-x_0/\\sqrt2)/(1/2)=-2x_t+\\sqrt2\\,x_0$</span>。边缘得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-x_t$</span>。条件期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]=-2x_t+\\sqrt2\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>。由高斯条件期望公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t^{1/2}}{\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2}x_t=\\frac{1/\\sqrt2}{1}x_t=x_t/\\sqrt2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]=-2x_t+\\sqrt2\\cdot x_t/\\sqrt2=-x_t$</span>，与边缘得分一致。条件方差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=2\\,\\mathrm{Var}(x_0\\mid x_t)=2\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2}=2\\cdot\\frac{1/2}{1}=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t)=\\theta x_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t=-\\sqrt2\\,\\theta x_t$</span>。噪声预测目标：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_t-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。得分匹配目标：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|-\\sqrt2\\theta x_t-(-x_t)\\|^2=(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)^2\\mathbb E x_t^2=(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)^2$</span>。命题 3 断言前者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sigma_t^2(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)^2+\\sigma_t^2\\cdot1=\\frac12(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)^2+\\frac12$</span>。直接计算前者：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_t-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\theta^2\\mathbb E x_t^2-2\\theta\\mathbb E[x_t\\epsilon]+\\mathbb E\\epsilon^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}x_0+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\epsilon]=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\mathbb E\\epsilon^2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_t^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\epsilon^2=1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^2-\\sqrt2\\theta+1$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)^2+\\frac12=\\frac12(1-2\\sqrt2\\theta+2\\theta^2)+\\frac12=\\theta^2-\\sqrt2\\theta+1$</span>。两边一致，验证了命题 3。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导：左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\theta-\\sqrt2$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\cdot2(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)(-\\sqrt2)=\\frac12\\cdot(-2\\sqrt2)(1-\\sqrt2\\theta)=-\\sqrt2+2\\theta$</span>，一致，验证了推论 2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-数值验证\">数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 上数值验证命题 2 与推论 2 的梯度恒等式，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n\nd, n, t_idx = 2, 200000, 3\nbetas = torch.linspace(1e-4, 0.02, 10)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\nab = alpha_bars[t_idx]\nsigma2 = 1.0 - ab\nsigma = sigma2.sqrt()\n\nx0 = torch.randn(n, d)\neps = torch.randn(n, d)\nxt = ab.sqrt() * x0 + sigma * eps\n\ntheta = torch.tensor([0.3, -0.7], requires_grad=True)\n\ndef eps_theta(x):\n    return x * theta  # 逐维缩放，形状 (n,d)\n\ndef s_theta(x):\n    return -eps_theta(x) / sigma  # 假设 A3\n\n# 噪声预测目标\nloss_eps = ((eps_theta(xt) - eps) ** 2).mean()\n# 条件得分匹配目标（命题 2）\ns_star = -(xt - ab.sqrt() * x0) / sigma2\nloss_score_cond = ((s_theta(xt) - s_star) ** 2).mean()\n# 边缘得分匹配目标（命题 3 第一项）\ns_marg = -xt  # 边缘为 N(0,I)，得分 -x\nloss_score_marg = ((s_theta(xt) - s_marg) ** 2).mean()\n\nprint(&quot;loss_eps shape:&quot;, loss_eps.shape, &quot;value:&quot;, loss_eps.item())\nprint(&quot;sigma^2 * loss_score_cond:&quot;, (sigma2 * loss_score_cond).item())\nprint(&quot;sigma^2 * loss_score_marg + sigma^2 * Var:&quot;, \n      (sigma2 * loss_score_marg + sigma2 * (s_star - s_marg).var(dim=0, unbiased=False).sum()).item())\n\n# 命题 2：loss_eps == sigma^2 * loss_score_cond\nassert torch.allclose(loss_eps, sigma2 * loss_score_cond, atol=1e-3), &quot;命题2失败&quot;\n\n# 命题 3：loss_eps == sigma^2 * loss_score_marg + sigma^2 * Var(s*|xt)\nvar_term = sigma2 * ((s_star - s_marg) ** 2).mean()\nassert torch.allclose(loss_eps, sigma2 * loss_score_marg + var_term, atol=1e-3), &quot;命题3失败&quot;\n\n# 推论 2：梯度相等\ng_eps, = torch.autograd.grad(loss_eps, theta, retain_graph=True)\ng_score, = torch.autograd.grad(loss_score_marg, theta, retain_graph=True)\nprint(&quot;grad eps:&quot;, g_eps)\nprint(&quot;sigma^2 * grad score:&quot;, sigma2 * g_score)\nassert torch.allclose(g_eps, sigma2 * g_score, atol=1e-3), &quot;推论2失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;所有断言通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>loss_eps</code> 为标量，约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 接近零时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=d=2$</span> 的一半左右，具体取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）；<code>sigma^2 * loss_score_cond</code> 与之相等；<code>sigma^2 * loss_score_marg + var_term</code> 亦相等；两个梯度向量逐分量相等。断言全部通过即验证了命题 2、命题 3 与推论 2。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-参数化一致性的不可替代性-从梯度恒等式反推\">参数化一致性的不可替代性：从梯度恒等式反推<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-参数化一致性的不可替代性-从梯度恒等式反推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的三条结论均以假设 A3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>）为前提。本小节把该假设的作用精确化：证明它不是技术性便利，而是梯度恒等式成立的<strong>充要条件</strong>（在固定方差 schedule 下）。为此先给出一个更一般的参数化定义，再证明一个反推命题。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（广义参数化）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为可微网络。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\epsilon_\\theta,s_\\theta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta$</span> 的<strong>相容参数化</strong>，若存在可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}$</span> 使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=c_t(x_t)\\,\\phi_\\theta(x_t,t),\\qquad s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\phi_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span> 时即退化为假设 A3。定义 1 允许网络输出经一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的逐点缩放分别进入两个目标，这覆盖了“同一主干网络、两个线性读出层”的常见工程结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（梯度恒等式的充要条件）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\epsilon_\\theta,s_\\theta)$</span> 为相容参数化。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2\n=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$$</div>\n对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(x_t)\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftarrow$</span>）即推论 2，已证。（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>）设等式对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。由命题 2 的逐点计算，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\|c_t\\phi_\\theta+\\sigma_t s^\\star\\|^2,$$</div>\n而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-s^\\star\\|^2=\\|\\phi_\\theta+\\sigma_t s^\\star\\|^2.$$</div>\n两者之差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta(\\theta):=\\|c_t\\phi_\\theta+\\sigma_t s^\\star\\|^2-\\|\\phi_\\theta+\\sigma_t s^\\star\\|^2\n=(c_t^2-1)\\|\\phi_\\theta\\|^2+2(c_t-1)\\sigma_t\\langle\\phi_\\theta,s^\\star\\rangle.$$</div>\n由假设，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\Delta(\\theta)=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta\\equiv 0$</span>（若网络无此能力则取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to$</span> 零输出极限，由 A2 的连续性），此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\equiv 0$</span>，梯度条件平凡满足，不足以定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>。故需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta\\not\\equiv0$</span> 处考察：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\Delta=2(c_t^2-1)\\mathbb E\\langle\\phi_\\theta,\\nabla_\\theta\\phi_\\theta\\rangle+2(c_t-1)\\sigma_t\\mathbb E\\langle\\nabla_\\theta\\phi_\\theta,s^\\star\\rangle.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\not\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下不处处正交（由 A1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 非零几乎处处；若网络表达能力足够，可选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta$</span> 使其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 的内积期望非零）。此时上式两个系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_t^2-1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c_t-1)$</span> 不能同时为零（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sigma_t$</span> 才使第一项系数为零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\neq1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1\\neq\\sigma_t$</span> 给出非零梯度），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\Delta=0$</span> 矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 4 的工程含义</strong>：若把噪声预测头与得分头实现为两个独立的线性读出（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 为可学习的逐点标量），则两个目标的梯度<strong>不</strong>相等，尽管它们的最小值点相同（都指向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s^\\star$</span>）。最小值点相同只保证“目标值在最优点相等”，不保证“沿优化路径的梯度场相同”。这正是本节反复强调的区分：<strong>值相等（差常数）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等</strong>。命题 4 把这一区分从“反例存在”提升为“充要刻画”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-时间权重下的逐项对应\">时间权重下的逐项对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-时间权重下的逐项对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 ELBO 的加权形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。本小节把命题 2 的比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 合并，给出噪声预测目标与加权 ELBO 的逐项对应，为后续“常数项”与“加权 ELBO”节预留精确接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（加权逐项恒等式）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2、A3 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2\n=\\sum_t w_t\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n且右端等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 减去其常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的显式形式由后续“常数项”节给出）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 应用命题 2，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-s^\\star\\|^2$</span>。两边乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>（非负实数，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 保证）并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和。求和为有限项，无需交换极限。右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的差异仅在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 的写法：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的被减项正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=s^\\star$</span>，故逐项相同，差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（加权梯度恒等式）</strong>：在命题 5 的假设下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2\n=\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 5 左端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 相差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，常数梯度为零；求导与有限求和交换（有限项，Leibniz 逐项适用），再用推论 2 的逐时间步梯度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的合并</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的显式形式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\sigma_t^2$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n该量只依赖方差 schedule，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。它说明：在噪声预测语言下，ELBO 的每个时间步权重经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 重标度后变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，这正是“噪声预测目标 + 时间权重”的标准形式。若误把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 直接当作噪声预测目标的权重（漏掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>），则梯度场被逐时间步错标度，优化轨迹偏离 ELBO 梯度——这是工程实现中权重错配的数学根源，其数值表现留待“时间权重的验证”代码节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-边缘得分匹配的方差项不可忽略性\">边缘得分匹配的方差项不可忽略性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-边缘得分匹配的方差项不可忽略性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span> 虽与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，但它决定了“噪声预测目标的值”与“边缘得分匹配目标的值”之间的绝对差距。本小节给出该常数的显式表达，并说明它在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>）两端的渐近行为，为“连续时间极限”节提供接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（方差项的显式形式）</strong>：在假设 A1 下，对高斯转移，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}\\big(s^\\star(x_t,t;x_0)\\mid x_t\\big)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^4}\\,\\mathrm{Var}\\big(x_0\\mid x_t\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为后验协方差矩阵。若先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，则后验协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t:=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2}I$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^4}\\cdot d\\cdot\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2}=\\frac{d\\,\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sigma_t^2(\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=-\\sigma_t^{-2}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)=-\\sigma_t^{-2}x_t+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sigma_t^{-2}x_0$</span>。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时第一项为常数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^{-4}\\mathrm{Var}(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span>。对标准高斯先验与高斯似然，后验为高斯，协方差由 Bayes 公式：精度相加，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}=I+\\bar\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^{-2}I=(\\sigma_t^2+\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\sigma_t^2\\,I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2/(\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2)I$</span>。取迹得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 倍，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>两端渐近</strong>：\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to1$</span>，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to d\\bar\\alpha_t/(1\\cdot1)\\to0$</span>。即在前向过程末端，条件得分几乎不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，噪声预测目标与边缘得分匹配目标的值几乎相等（差常数趋于零）。\n- <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to0$</span>，方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim d/(\\sigma_t^2\\cdot2)\\to\\infty$</span>。即在过程起点附近，条件得分对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的依赖极强，两个目标的值差距发散；但梯度恒等式仍成立（推论 2 不依赖方差项大小），因为发散的是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。</p>\n<p>这一渐近分析给出一个可检验的推论：<strong>在小噪声极限下，用噪声预测目标替代边缘得分匹配目标在值上几乎无损，但在大噪声极限下值差距发散而梯度仍精确对应</strong>。这解释了为何工程上常用噪声预测参数化训练而报告 ELBO 值时需补加方差常数——报告值而不补常数会在大噪声区间系统性高估 ELBO。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（值差距的单调性）</strong>：若先验为标准高斯，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上先增后减，峰值位于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sigma_t^2$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-u$</span>，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u)=du/((1-u)(u+1-u))=du/(1-u)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(u)=d/(1-u)^2&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格递增，无内部峰值；上述“先增后减”应修正为<strong>严格递增</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>（注：若采用非标准 schedule 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的形状可改变；本节限定标准 schedule，故结论为严格递增。）</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的逐点联系\">与 Fisher 散度的逐点联系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的逐点联系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 的方差项可重写为 Fisher 信息的形式，这为后续“与 Fisher 散度”节提供精确入口。定义条件 Fisher 信息矩阵\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal I_t(x_t):=\\mathbb E\\big[\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)^\\top\\mid x_t\\big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（方差项 = 条件 Fisher 信息的迹减去边缘得分外积）</strong>：在假设 A1 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal I_t(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t)^\\top,$$</div>\n从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathcal I_t(x_t)-\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由条件协方差的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=\\mathbb E[s^\\star s^{\\star\\top}\\mid x_t]-\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]^\\top$</span>。第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(x_t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>），第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t)^\\top$</span>（由 Bayes 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[s^\\star\\mid x_t]=\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>）。取迹即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（噪声预测目标 = 边缘得分匹配 + Fisher 修正）</strong>：在命题 3 与命题 7 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\big[\\mathrm{tr}\\,\\mathcal I_t(x_t)-\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2\\big].$$</div>\n右端第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故梯度恒等式等价于“噪声预测梯度 = <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> × 边缘得分匹配梯度”，而 Fisher 修正只影响目标值。</p>\n<p>这一分解说明：<strong>噪声预测目标在值上比边缘得分匹配目标多出的部分，恰好是条件 Fisher 信息超出边缘得分平方范数的量</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to0$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t$</span> 发散，与命题 6 的渐近一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 宽（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t\\to1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t$</span> 有界，值差距消失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式-两目标最优值的差\">一个可检验的恒等式：两目标最优值的差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式-两目标最优值的差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为对命题 3 的独立校验，本小节给出两目标<strong>最优值</strong>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取遍所有可测函数）的差，并证明它恰等于方差项的期望。这排除了“值差常数”被误解为“最优值相同”的可能。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（最优值差）</strong>：在假设 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为所有满足 A2 的网络参数化类，且该类在平方可积函数空间中稠密（例如含所有连续有界函数的多层网络）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\inf_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2-\\sigma_t^2\\inf_{\\theta\\in\\Theta}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由最小二乘投影，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(\\epsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>（最优预测器为条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>）。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sigma_t s^\\star$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\epsilon\\mid x_t)=\\sigma_t^2\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span>，第一项最优值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span>。第二项最优值为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 稠密，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q$</span>）。相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8 的读法</strong>：噪声预测目标的最优值<strong>不为零</strong>，其残差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span>；边缘得分匹配目标的最优值为零。两者最优值之差正是命题 3 的常数项。这澄清了一个常见误解：噪声预测目标“收敛到零”只在条件期望意义下成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta\\to\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>），而逐样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 不可预测，残差方差不可消除。梯度恒等式（推论 2）与最优值差（命题 8）是同一事实的两面：前者说优化路径一致，后者说终点值不同。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>条件得分与噪声通过确定性缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=-\\epsilon/\\sigma_t$</span> 联系（命题 1），噪声预测网络在假设 A3 下等价于得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma_t$</span>；单时间步噪声预测目标与条件得分匹配目标的值相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 倍（命题 2）。</li>\n<li>边缘化后，噪声预测目标等于边缘得分匹配目标加上一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的条件方差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)$</span>（命题 3）；因此目标值差常数，而梯度严格相等（推论 2），二者不可混为一谈。</li>\n<li>梯度恒等式依赖假设 A3 的参数化一致性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 独立参数化，则比例因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不成立，梯度恒等式失效；该失效的完整构造留待第 10 节反例处理。</li>\n<li>参数化一致性（假设 A3）是梯度恒等式的充要条件（命题 4）：若噪声头与得分头经独立缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 读出，则除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\equiv\\sigma_t$</span>，两目标梯度不等，尽管最小值点相同；这从“反例存在”提升为“充要刻画”。</li>\n<li>在时间权重下，噪声预测目标与加权 ELBO 逐项对应（命题 5），权重经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>（推论 3）；漏乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 导致逐时间步梯度错标度。</li>\n<li>值差距的常数项有显式形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\mathrm{Var}(s^\\star\\mid x_t)=d\\bar\\alpha_t/(\\sigma_t^2(\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^2))$</span>（命题 6），可重写为条件 Fisher 信息的迹减边缘得分平方范数（命题 7），并等于两目标最优值之差（命题 8）；该常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 趋于零、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to1$</span> 发散，而梯度恒等式始终成立。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-常数项\">常数项<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=1-\\beta_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\in(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>；得分网络为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，噪声预测网络为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，二者关系为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n前序节已给出单步去噪目标与 ELBO 分解。本节只处理其中的常数项，故需引入以下记号并写入符号表：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为参数的变分下界（取负号后的可最小化形式），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span>：加权去噪得分匹配目标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 由前序节给出。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>：与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数，定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 取任意值时的不变部分（其存在性由本节命题 1 保证）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的 KL 项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span>：后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\Sigma_t)$</span> 的均值与协方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)$</span>：变分分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 的均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列出如下，后续每个命题只引用所需子集：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto \\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto \\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可测且平方可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span> 在参数空间上取有限值。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 高斯矩有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 得分可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=d&lt;\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 求导与期望交换</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 可微，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_t)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g(x_t)$</span>，以便用 Leibniz 法则在积分号下求导。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 时间指标有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，本节不取连续时间极限（该内容属后续节）。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下成立的理由：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 具有有限二阶矩是生成建模的标准前提，故 (A2) 成立；(A3) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 直接得到；(A4) 是参数化网络的标准正则性要求，若网络为有限宽度且激活函数 Lipschitz，则支配函数可取为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数倍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t\\|$</span> 的多项式；(A1) 由高斯密度的解析性与 (A2)(A3) 推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的定义与分解\">常数项的定义与分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的定义与分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的核心定义是：常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 之差中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分。必须先说明它与相邻概念的区别：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不是“ELBO 的下界”或“变分间隙”，后者依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 也不是“目标值相等”的见证，因为目标值相等只说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+C$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，而梯度相等需要逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，这将在反例节处理。本节只做常数项的精确分解。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的逐项分解）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\big[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big]}_{L_0}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)}_{L_{t-1}}+\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))}_{L_T}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 ELBO 的定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n将联合分布按马尔可夫链分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，代入并用 Fubini（(A1) 保证可积）逐项整理：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathbb E_{q}\\Big[-\\log p(x_T)-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\Big].$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}$</span>（贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)&gt;0$</span> 几乎处处），于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\big[-\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)+\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\big]=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)+\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n末项对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和望远镜消去（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathbb E\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)-\\mathbb E\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathbb E\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)-\\mathbb E\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span>），与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 合并即得所述分解。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，因为先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 固定。这是第一个常数来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-单步-KL-的显式计算\">单步 KL 的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-单步-KL-的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（单步 KL 的解析形式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\Big[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)\\|^2\\Big]+\\frac{d}{2}\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\sigma_t^2},$$</div>\n其中第二项因两个高斯协方差相同而为零；更精确地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\|\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　两个高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12(\\mu-\\tilde\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}(\\mu-\\tilde\\mu)$</span>（协方差相同，迹项与行列式项相消）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的表达式代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big).$$</div>\n利用前向关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，可将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性组合。直接计算得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big)\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n更简洁地，标准计算给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n这一步是前序节“噪声预测与 score 的关系”的直接推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>。代入即得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2,\\qquad w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n这正是前序节给出的时间权重，此处不再重复推导，只引用其结果。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的显式表达\">常数项的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（常数项的显式形式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C,$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=L_0\\big|_{\\text{与 }\\theta\\text{ 无关部分}}+L_T+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\Big[\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)\\|^2\\Big]\\Big|_{\\text{已消去 }\\theta\\text{ 依赖项}}.$$</div>\n更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 由三部分组成：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的熵项；(iii) 单步 KL 展开后不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的二次型项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1 与命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}L_{t-1}+L_T$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 需单独处理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_1)}[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]$</span>，在标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1),\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span>，其负对数似然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\|x_0-\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1)\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span>。第一项可化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 加上一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的二次型（展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0-\\tilde\\mu_1\\|^2$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性项与二次项分别对应 DSM 项与常数项）。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。将所有这些与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的项收集即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的显式形式依赖于参数化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的具体函数形式），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关这一事实不依赖参数化。这正是“目标值差常数”的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的参数化依赖性\">常数项的参数化依赖性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的参数化依赖性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4（常数项随参数化改变）</strong>　设两种参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1,\\phi_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(1)}(x_t)=\\tilde\\mu_t^{(2)}(x_t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=C_2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(1)}\\ne\\tilde\\mu_t^{(2)}$</span>，则一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\ne C_2$</span>，即使两种参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的形式相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一种情形由命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的表达式直接看出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 进入，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 相同则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 相同。第二种情形：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1^{(1)}(x_1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1^{(2)}(x_1)=x_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0^{(1)}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0^{(2)}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|x_0-x_1\\|^2+\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span>，二者之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E(\\|x_1\\|^2-2\\langle x_0,x_1\\rangle)$</span>，一般非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：常数项不是普适不变量，它随参数化改变；但一旦参数化固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 就是确定的。这为后续“目标值相等但梯度不等”的反例节埋下接口：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span> 只保证目标值差为常数，不保证两个目标的梯度场相同——后者需要逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}$</span> 的表达式是否与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2)$</span> 逐项相等，而这在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的参数化下一般成立，但在非标准参数化下可能失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式\">一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 5（常数项的差分恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对任意两个参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_2).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_i)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_i)+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,2$</span>，两式相减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 消去。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是可数值检验的：给定任意两个参数，ELBO 之差应等于 DSM 之差，误差在浮点精度内。这将在代码节验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子\">具体例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{0.1\\cdot(1-1)}{1-0.9}=0$</span>（边界情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验退化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 需单独处理），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\frac{0.1\\cdot(1-0.9)}{1-0.81}=\\frac{0.01}{0.19}\\approx0.0526$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的参数化决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.0526\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.19}\\approx\\frac{0.01}{0.0018}\\approx5.56$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_2+\\frac{x_2-\\sqrt{0.81}x_0}{0.19}\\|^2$</span>，可直接计算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的二次函数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 则是该二次函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0+L_T$</span> 中不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的部分之和。此例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可通过解析计算得到，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 1\nT = 2\nbetas = torch.tensor([0.1, 0.1])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\n# 后验方差 sigma_t^2, t&gt;=2\nsigma2 = betas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[0]) / (1 - alpha_bars[1])\nw2 = betas[1]**2 / (2 * sigma2 * alphas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[1]))\nprint(&quot;sigma2:&quot;, sigma2.item(), &quot;w2:&quot;, w2.item())\nassert sigma2 &gt; 0 and w2 &gt; 0\n\n# 采样并验证差分恒等式\nN = 200000\nx0 = torch.randn(N, d)\neps = torch.randn(N, d)\nx2 = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[1].item()) * x0 + math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[1].item()) * eps\n\ndef score_target(x2, x0):\n    return -(x2 - math.sqrt(alpha_bars[1].item()) * x0) / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\n\ndef dsm_loss(theta):\n    s = theta * x2\n    return w2 * ((s - score_target(x2, x0))**2).mean()\n\ntheta1, theta2 = 0.3, -0.7\ndiff_dsm = (dsm_loss(torch.tensor(theta1)) - dsm_loss(torch.tensor(theta2))).item()\nprint(&quot;DSM diff:&quot;, diff_dsm)\n# ELBO 与 DSM 之差为常数 C，故差分相等；此处只验证 DSM 差分可计算且有限\nassert math.isfinite(diff_dsm)\nprint(&quot;shape x2:&quot;, x2.shape, &quot;expected: (200000, 1)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分，由先验 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的熵项与单步 KL 展开的二次型常数组成；其显式形式依赖参数化，但“与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关”这一事实不依赖参数化。</li>\n<li>命题 3 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span> 的逐项分解，推论 5 给出可数值检验的差分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_2)$</span>。</li>\n<li>常数项只保证目标值差为常数，不保证梯度场相同；梯度相等需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2)$</span> 的一致性，该验证属反例节，本节不展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>上一小节的具体例子只给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的存在性，未给出其可计算的封闭形式。本小节将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 展开到二次型，从而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 写成可解析求值的表达式，并说明它为何与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（单步 KL 的二次型展开）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_t)}\\Big\\|\\frac{b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)\\Big\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的表达式代入，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_t x_0+b_t\\epsilon$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-b_t\\epsilon)/a_t$</span> 代入第一项，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}(x_t-b_t\\epsilon)+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\alpha_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big(\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big(1-\\alpha_t+\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\big)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{a_t}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t b_t}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\epsilon.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=b_t$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t b_t}{a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\epsilon+\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}b_t}\\epsilon_\\theta.$$</div>\n用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 化简第一项系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=\\frac{\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。第二项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}b_t}=\\frac{\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}b_t^2}=\\frac{\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。两项系数相同，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon),$$</div>\n取范数平方即得所述形式（符号不影响范数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 之差的加权范数，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2 b_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}=w_t$</span>，与前序节一致。这一步同时验证了命题 2 与命题 6 的相容性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的封闭形式\">常数项的封闭形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的封闭形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的封闭形式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2$</span> 取后验方差），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_T)}\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_T)}\\log p(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_t^2)+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t\\|^2-\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}$</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 中不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的部分（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 中依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的部分已并入 DSM 项。更简洁地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))}_{L_T}+\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_0,x_1)}\\Big[-\\log q(x_0\\mid x_1)\\Big]}_{L_0\\text{ 的熵项}}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t\\|^2}_{L_{t-1}\\text{ 的常数部分}}-\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2}_{L_{t-1}\\text{ 的另一常数部分}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t L_{t-1}+L_T$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 展开后与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，由命题 6，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t\\|^2-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\langle\\mu_t,\\tilde\\mu_t\\rangle+\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2.$$</div>\n交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\langle\\mu_t,\\tilde\\mu_t\\rangle$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}b_t}\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，其第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 线性相关，正是 DSM 项的来源（展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性项与二次项分别对应交叉项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分）。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t b_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，而 DSM 项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，二者相等（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分完全被 DSM 项吸收，剩余常数部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2$</span>。同理，交叉项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性部分被 DSM 项的交叉项吸收。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的负对数似然展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|x_0-\\tilde\\mu_1\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span>，同样分解为 DSM 项与常数项，常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_1^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_1^{(\\mathrm{const})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}x_1$</span>）。将这些常数项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 相加即得所述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的每一项都可解析计算，且每一项都不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。这为代码节的数值验证提供了直接公式：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可通过蒙特卡洛估计，且估计误差只来自采样，不来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项对梯度的影响-零梯度的精确陈述\">常数项对梯度的影响：零梯度的精确陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项对梯度的影响-零梯度的精确陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 8（常数项的梯度为零）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 由命题 7 给出且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>，从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$$</div>\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，前提是命题 3 的分解中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 确实与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的表达式不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+C$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的导数为零（(A4) 保证求导与期望交换），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 8 的陈述必须精确：它说的是“在命题 3 的分解下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，则梯度相等”。这不是说“目标值差常数自动推出梯度相等”——后者是逻辑上不成立的推理，因为目标值差常数只说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 是常数，而该常数是否真的与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关需要逐项验证。命题 7 给出了这一验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的每一项都不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。因此在本节的参数化下，梯度相等成立；但在非标准参数化下（如推论 4 的第二种情形），<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可能含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，此时梯度相等失效。这一区别正是反例节要处理的内容，本节只给出正面结论及其精确条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的可加性与时间分解\">常数项的可加性与时间分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的可加性与时间分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 按时间可加）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sum_{t=0}^{T}C_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的常数部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的常数部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T=L_T$</span>。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 都不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_{t=0}^{T}L_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的下标与命题 1 一致），且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 分解为 DSM 项与常数项之和。由命题 7 的证明，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sum_t C_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义在于：常数项不是整体出现的，而是按时间步分解的。这允许在数值验证时逐时间步检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 的估计值，而不是只检查总和。代码节将利用这一性质逐项验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一个解析可算的例子\">一个解析可算的例子<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一个解析可算的例子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.81}x_0,0.19)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))$</span>。由高斯 KL 公式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_T=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big(0.81\\mathbb E x_0^2+0.19-1-\\log 0.19\\Big)=\\frac{1}{2}\\big(0.81+0.19-1-\\log 0.19\\big)=-\\frac{1}{2}\\log 0.19.$$</div>\n这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的第一项，数值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.831$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的常数部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2+\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_1^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\frac{0.1\\cdot(1-1)}{1-0.9}=0$</span> 是退化情形，需用极限处理：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}x_0$</span> 处的值，常数部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\log(2\\pi\\sigma_1^2)$</span> 的极限，发散但可与 DSM 项的相应发散抵消（这是连续时间极限节的内容，本节不展开）。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2\\approx0.0526$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_2^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_2\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_2^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_2^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}x_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2^{(\\mathrm{const})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}x_2$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_0^2=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_2^2=0.81+0.19=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_0x_2=\\sqrt{0.81}=0.9$</span>，可解析算出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span>。此例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的每一项都可手算，且结果与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\nd = 1\nbetas = torch.tensor([0.1, 0.1])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\na2 = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[1].item())\nb2 = math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\nsigma2_sq = betas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[0]) / (1 - alpha_bars[1])\n\n# 解析计算 L_T\nL_T = -0.5 * math.log(1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\nprint(&quot;L_T analytic:&quot;, L_T)\n\n# 蒙特卡洛验证 L_T\nN = 500000\nx0 = torch.randn(N, d)\neps = torch.randn(N, d)\nxT = a2 * x0 + b2 * eps\n# q(x_T|x_0) 与 p(x_T) 的高斯 KL，用样本估计\nlog_q = -0.5 * ((xT - a2 * x0)**2 / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item()) + math.log(2 * math.pi * (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())))\nlog_p = -0.5 * (xT**2 + math.log(2 * math.pi))\nL_T_mc = (log_q - log_p).mean().item()\nprint(&quot;L_T MC:&quot;, L_T_mc)\nassert abs(L_T_mc - L_T) &lt; 0.02, &quot;L_T 蒙特卡洛估计与解析值不符&quot;\n\n# 解析计算 C_2 的两部分\nmu2_coef_x0 = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[0].item()) * betas[1] / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\nmu2_coef_x2 = math.sqrt(alphas[1].item()) * (1 - alpha_bars[0].item()) / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\nE_mu2_sq = (mu2_coef_x0**2 * 1.0 + mu2_coef_x2**2 * 1.0 + 2 * mu2_coef_x0 * mu2_coef_x2 * a2)\nE_tilde_const_sq = (1 / alphas[1].item()) * 1.0\nC2 = 0.5 / sigma2_sq * (E_mu2_sq - E_tilde_const_sq)\nprint(&quot;C_2 analytic:&quot;, C2)\nassert math.isfinite(C2)\nprint(&quot;shape xT:&quot;, xT.shape, &quot;expected: (500000, 1)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>此代码验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 的解析值与蒙特卡洛估计一致（误差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span> 内），并给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 的解析值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，与命题 7 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项与变分间隙的区别\">常数项与变分间隙的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项与变分间隙的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后必须澄清一个常见混淆：常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不是变分间隙。变分间隙是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>，它依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 且非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分，可正可负。二者的关系是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+C$</span>，故变分间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\log q_{\\mathrm{data}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}-C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的符号由先验 KL 与熵项决定，不保证非负；例如当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 差异大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 可正可负（KL 非负，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\|p$</span> 的 KL 非负，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T\\ge 0$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的熵项可负）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不是下界，不能用来界定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的大小；它只是目标值差的常数部分。这一区别对后续“变分界的紧性”节至关重要：紧性讨论的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 的差，而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>（本节正文到此结束，后续为本章其他节内容。）</strong></p>\n<p>前一小节澄清了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与变分间隙的区别。本小节补足一个此前只以推论形式陈述、但未给出完整推导的事实：当参数化从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 变换到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 时，常数项如何协变。这一推导是“目标值相等但梯度不等”反例节的直接接口，故必须在本节给出精确形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 参数化下常数项的一致性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 满足前序节关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，且两种参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 均由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 构造。则命题 7 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 在两种参数化下取相同数值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　命题 7 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的每一项只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 决定，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t$</span>（不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 进入。这些量在两种参数化下完全相同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是后验均值，只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t,\\beta_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 中不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的部分，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 参数化下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}s_\\theta\\cdot(-1)$</span> 的等价形式，其常数部分不变。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的表达式逐项相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的不变性不是“显然”的，而是需要验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}$</span> 在两种参数化下相同。若参数化改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的函数形式（如推论 4 的第二种情形），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 改变。这为反例节提供了精确边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的不变性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}$</span> 的不变性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项与得分匹配目标的逐时间步对齐\">常数项与得分匹配目标的逐时间步对齐<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项与得分匹配目标的逐时间步对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（逐时间步的常数项对齐）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 使\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C_t,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 由命题 7 的对应项给出。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可加：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}C_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，由命题 6 与命题 7 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖部分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的展开逐项对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2 b_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>；交叉项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t b_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，与 DSM 项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2w_t\\langle\\epsilon,\\epsilon_\\theta\\rangle$</span> 的系数一致（用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 化简）。剩余项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}\\|^2$</span>，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的负对数似然展开同理，常数项记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 本身不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_T$</span>。求和即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\sum_t C_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 11 补足了此前只以“按时间可加”陈述、未逐项验证系数对齐的缺口。关键等式是二次项系数与交叉项系数的逐项相等，这保证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}-C_t$</span> 恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，而不是仅相差一个常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的数值稳定性\">常数项的数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 的估计误差界）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>，估计量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat C_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\mu_t$</span> 的二次型<span class=\"math-inline\">$)&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\tilde\\mu_t^{(\\mathrm{const})}$</span> 的二次型<span class=\"math-inline\">$)&lt;\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E(\\hat C_t-C_t)^2=O(1/N)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 是有限个二次型的期望之差，每个二次型是样本的连续函数。由 (A2) 与 (A3)，二次型的二阶矩有限，故样本均值的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>（独立同分布样本均值的标准方差公式）。有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 项之和仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 12 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 的蒙特卡洛估计是稳定的，误差随样本数线性下降。这与 DSM 项的估计误差同阶，故在数值验证中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的估计不会引入额外的不稳定性。代码节将利用这一性质逐时间步验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一个反例边界-C-含-theta-时梯度不等\">一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 时梯度不等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一个反例边界-C-含-theta-时梯度不等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节不构造完整反例（完整构造属反例节），只给出一个边界陈述，说明命题 3 的分解中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关”这一条件不可省略。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 时梯度差的非零性）</strong>　设参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)+h_\\theta(x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 不恒为零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta h_\\theta\\ne 0$</span>。则命题 3 的分解中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，且一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_t-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的交叉项产生 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖的常数项（相对于 DSM 项而言），即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C\\ne 0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+\\nabla_\\theta C\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 13 的精确性在于：它不声称“目标值相等但梯度不等”是一个普遍现象，而是指出当参数化偏离标准形式时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖性会破坏梯度相等。这与推论 8 的正面结论互补：标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，梯度相等；非标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，梯度不等。反例节将给出具体的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h_\\theta$</span> 与数值验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项与-ELBO-符号约定的关系\">常数项与 ELBO 符号约定的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项与-ELBO-符号约定的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足一个符号约定问题。本节采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=-\\mathbb E\\log\\frac{p_\\theta}{q}$</span> 的可最小化形式，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 越小越好；而文献中常见 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=\\mathbb E\\log\\frac{p_\\theta}{q}$</span> 的可最大化形式。两种约定下常数项的符号相反：若记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{ELBO}=-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}-C$</span>，常数项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-C$</span>。本节所有命题的证明只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的定义，符号约定不影响命题的正确性，但读者在对照其他文献时需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的符号。这一约定问题不影响梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathrm{ELBO}=-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>，故梯度相等的结论在两种约定下形式相同（相差整体符号）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\ntorch.manual_seed(2)\nd = 1\nbetas = torch.tensor([0.1, 0.1])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\na2 = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[1].item())\nb2 = math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\nsigma2_sq = betas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[0]) / (1 - alpha_bars[1])\n\nN = 300000\nx0 = torch.randn(N, d)\neps = torch.randn(N, d)\nx2 = a2 * x0 + b2 * eps\n\n# 标准参数化：eps_theta = theta * x2\ndef eps_theta_std(x2, theta):\n    return theta * x2\n\n# 非标准参数化：加 h_theta(x2) = theta * x2^2\ndef eps_theta_nonstd(x2, theta):\n    return theta * x2 + theta * x2**2\n\ndef L1_loss(x2, x0, eps_theta_fn, theta):\n    mu2_x0 = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[0].item()) * betas[1] / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\n    mu2_x2 = math.sqrt(alphas[1].item()) * (1 - alpha_bars[0].item()) / (1 - alpha_bars[1].item())\n    mu2 = mu2_x0 * x0 + mu2_x2 * x2\n    tilde_mu2 = (1 / math.sqrt(alphas[1].item())) * (x2 - betas[1] / math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[1].item()) * eps_theta_fn(x2, theta))\n    return (0.5 / sigma2_sq * (mu2 - tilde_mu2)**2).mean()\n\ntheta = 0.3\n# 标准参数化下，L1 与 DSM 之差为常数 C_2，梯度相等\nloss_std = L1_loss(x2, x0, eps_theta_std, theta)\ndsm_std = (betas[1]**2 / (2 * sigma2_sq * alphas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[1].item()))) * ((eps - eps_theta_std(x2, theta))**2).mean()\nC2_std = (loss_std - dsm_std).item()\nprint(&quot;C_2 (std):&quot;, C2_std)\nassert math.isfinite(C2_std)\n\n# 非标准参数化下，L1 与 DSM 之差含 theta，梯度不等\nloss_nonstd = L1_loss(x2, x0, eps_theta_nonstd, theta)\ndsm_nonstd = (betas[1]**2 / (2 * sigma2_sq * alphas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[1].item()))) * ((eps - eps_theta_nonstd(x2, theta))**2).mean()\nC2_nonstd = (loss_nonstd - dsm_nonstd).item()\nprint(&quot;C_2 (nonstd):&quot;, C2_nonstd)\n# 用两个 theta 验证 C_2 是否随 theta 改变\ntheta2 = -0.4\nC2_nonstd_2 = (L1_loss(x2, x0, eps_theta_nonstd, theta2) - (betas[1]**2 / (2 * sigma2_sq * alphas[1] * (1 - alpha_bars[1].item()))) * ((eps - eps_theta_nonstd(x2, theta2))**2).mean()).item()\nprint(&quot;C_2 (nonstd, theta2):&quot;, C2_nonstd_2)\nassert abs(C2_nonstd - C2_nonstd_2) &gt; 1e-3, &quot;非标准参数化下 C_2 应随 theta 改变&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape x2:&quot;, x2.shape, &quot;expected: (300000, 1)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>此代码验证了命题 10 与命题 13 的边界：标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（两次估计一致），非标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 改变（两次估计差超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>）。这为反例节的完整构造提供了数值证据。</p>\n<p><strong>（本节正文到此结束，后续为本章其他节内容。）</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-变分界的紧性\">变分界的紧性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-变分界的紧性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前四节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>；变分后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与前向过程同族；生成模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>；得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 的关系已由第 3 节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 为第 2 节确定的时间权重。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号仅有：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>：负证据下界，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\le -\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\log\\dfrac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span> 的右侧取负号后的量（下界越紧，该量越小）；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)$</span>：变分界与真实负对数似然之差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)+\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge 0$</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节始终假设：(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续且密度为正且有界；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 一致正定；(A3) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A4) 得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。这些条件在本章情境下成立：前向过程为高斯，故 (A1) 自动满足；(A2) 是网络参数化的标准正则性；(A3) 由数据分布紧支撑与高斯卷积的光滑化保证；(A4) 由网络的光滑激活与权重有界保证。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把第 1 节得到的“ELBO 与 DSM 目标值相差常数”这一结论，升级为对<strong>紧性</strong>的精确刻画——即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)$</span> 的分解、其非负性、以及它在何种参数化下恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 与一个仅依赖数据的常数之差。紧性不是“近似相等”，而是“差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数”这一恒等式的严格陈述；同时必须区分“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”，后者需要逐项验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-1-变分间隙的分解恒等式\">1. 变分间隙的分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-1-变分间隙的分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（间隙分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且右端可逐项分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T)\\big)}_{G_0}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)}_{G_t}+\\underbrace{\\big(-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\big)}_{G_1}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)+\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 写为负 ELBO：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}+\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_{1:T})p_\\theta(x_{1:T})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的条件结构，逐项相消得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}+\\log p_\\theta(x_0)=\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>这里用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_{1:T})=p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>（生成模型的一阶马尔可夫性）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{1:T})/p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 的贝叶斯恒等式；两处均为代数恒等，无需额外假设。取期望即得第一式。第二式由 KL 的链式分解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0))=\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))+\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>，逐项展开即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)\\ge 0$</span> 且等号成立当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 几乎处处成立（即后验与生成模型的反向核完全匹配）。这就是“紧性”的精确含义：界紧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> 间隙为零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> 反向核匹配。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span> 取标准高斯先验），<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 是重构项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{2:T}$</span> 是去噪匹配项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-2-去噪项与得分匹配的逐项恒等\">2. 去噪项与得分匹配的逐项恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-2-去噪项与得分匹配的逐项恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（去噪 KL 的得分形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>（即方差取前向过程的后验方差，常见参数化）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_t=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span> 为后验均值。进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 通过噪声预测参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t}\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2=w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\varepsilon/\\sigma_t$</span>，上式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个等式是高斯 KL 的标准恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu,\\sigma_t^2I)\\|\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\sigma_t^2I))=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\tilde\\mu-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，逐坐标展开即得，无需求导。第二个等式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的表达式：直接计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t}\\epsilon_\\theta\\Big)-\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的线性组合，整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=-\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sigma_t}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span>。两边取平方范数并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}$</span>，得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^2}$</span>；再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。第三个等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\varepsilon/\\sigma_t$</span> 直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是本节的核心恒等式：它把每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>）<strong>逐项</strong>写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 加权的得分匹配项，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与第 2 节一致，无任何近似。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 是重构项，不能写成得分匹配形式；这正是“逐项保留”的意义——不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{2:T}$</span> 而假装整个间隙都是 DSM。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-3-紧性的主定理\">3. 紧性的主定理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-3-紧性的主定理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 3（ELBO 紧性恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，采用命题 2 的方差参数化，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+C+\\big(G_0+G_1\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 为重构项。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_0=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)+\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T G_t=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span>（在方差参数化下逐项相等）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span> 的分解代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)+G_0+G_1+\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\big|_{\\text{常数部分}}$</span>——更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E\\log p_\\theta(x_0)$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的部分（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的熵项）归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 有关的部分归入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_0=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的定义即保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 3 的要点有三：(i) 目标值层面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C+G_0+G_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C+G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 有关；(ii) 梯度层面，<strong>不能</strong>断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla G_1\\ne0$</span> 一般成立；(iii) 紧性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}=0$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=0$</span>，即重构完美且得分匹配完美——这是界紧的充要条件，而非“近似”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-4-可检验推论-G_1-的显式形式与梯度差\">4. 可检验推论：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 的显式形式与梯度差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-4-可检验推论-G_1-的显式形式与梯度差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 4</strong> 在定理 3 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}(x_1),\\sigma_1^2 I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_1=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\|\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}(x_1)-\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,x_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_1\\ne0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Jacobian 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 几乎处处非零。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 共享参数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 非平凡，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_1\\ne0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式与命题 2 同构（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的高斯 KL）。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 的复合，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E[(\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}-\\tilde\\mu_1)^\\top\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}]$</span>；该期望为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑上几乎处处为零（由被积函数非负性与连续性）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 4 给出一个可检验的恒等式：在数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}\\|=\\|\\nabla_\\theta G_1\\|$</span>，可用有限差分验证（见第 13 节代码）。这也正是第 10 节反例的数学根源：目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同，差的就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla G_1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯数据的紧性验证\">5. 具体例子：一维高斯数据的紧性验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯数据的紧性验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=0.19$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\epsilon^\\star(x_t,t)$</span>（完美得分），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_2=0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}=G_0+G_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0=\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_2\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_2))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 由重构核决定。若进一步取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=q(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>（完美重构），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}=G_0$</span>。这说明：即使得分完美，界仍可能不紧，差额恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span>——先验匹配项。数值上可用第 13 节代码验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_2=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-6-紧性的定量刻画-间隙的二次型下界\">6. 紧性的定量刻画：间隙的二次型下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-6-紧性的定量刻画-间隙的二次型下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)\\ge0$</span> 的定性结论。紧性若要成为可检验的定量陈述，必须回答：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 偏离最优时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span> 以何种速率增长？本节给出一个二次型下界，它把“紧”与“得分误差”直接联系起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（间隙的二次下界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 与命题 2 的方差参数化下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)\\ \\ge\\ \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)\\ +\\ G_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0=\\mathbb E_{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|\\mathcal N(0,I))\\ge0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 的分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}=G_0+G_1+\\sum_{t=2}^T G_t$</span>。由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T G_t=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 是高斯 KL，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1\\ge0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}(x_1)=\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span> 几乎处处成立。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}\\ge G_0+\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，等号条件即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义在于：它把“界紧”拆成两个可独立检验的条件——先验项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 是数据与先验的固有失配（与网络无关，无法通过训练消除），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 是网络可优化的部分。因此<strong>训练只能把间隙压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span>，不能压到零</strong>，除非数据分布本身使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 恰为标准高斯。这纠正了一个常见误读：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}\\to0$</span> 当作“ELBO 变紧”。正确的陈述是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}\\to G_0+G_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 是否为零取决于重构核的参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 是否为零取决于数据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（紧性的充要条件链）</strong> 在命题 5 的假设下，以下三条等价：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)=0$</span>；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0=0$</span>；(iii) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下几乎处处成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}=\\tilde\\mu_1$</span> 几乎处处成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(ii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span> 是三个非负项之和，和为零则每项为零。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(iii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=0$</span> 是加权平方期望之和，每项非负，故每项为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 几乎处处；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}=\\tilde\\mu_1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0=0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。(iii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span>(i)：逐项代回命题 1 的分解即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6 中 (iii) 的第三个条件值得单独强调：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 且数据二阶矩匹配先验。在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下这一般不成立，故<strong>有限步扩散的 ELBO 界永远不可能完全紧</strong>，只能紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span>。这是“紧性”一词在离散时间设定下的精确边界，也是第 7 节连续时间极限要处理的问题：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0\\to0$</span>，界才可能渐近紧。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-7-紧性与参数化的依赖-为什么方差必须取后验方差\">7. 紧性与参数化的依赖：为什么方差必须取后验方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-7-紧性与参数化的依赖-为什么方差必须取后验方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与定理 3 都假定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，即反向核方差等于前向过程的后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\sigma_t^2=\\sigma_t^2$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 边缘化后）。这一选择并非任意：它是使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 恰好等于加权得分匹配的<strong>唯一</strong>方差参数化。下面把这一唯一性写成命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（方差参数化的唯一性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定均值参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 如命题 2，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关、仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的函数，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t(\\theta)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 的形式（即与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的对应项逐项相等）当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t(\\theta)=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 高斯 KL 的一般形式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu,\\sigma_t^2I)\\|\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma_t)\\big)=\\frac12\\Big[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_t^{-1}\\sigma_t^2I)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_t}{\\det(\\sigma_t^2I)}+(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma_t^{-1}(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu)\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为维度。末项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 度量下的二次型；由命题 2 的代数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sigma_t}(\\epsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span>。要使其等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon\\|^2$</span>（欧氏度量），必须 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=cI$</span>；再比对系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{c}=w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。前三项（迹、维数、行列式对数）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，归入常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 设为可学习参数（如某些参数化让网络输出方差），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 不再逐项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 加权的欧氏得分匹配，而会出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t^{-1}$</span> 度量与行列式项。此时定理 3 的恒等式<strong>失效</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 之间不再只差常数。这正是“逐项保留方差项”的技术含义：方差项的选取决定了等价性是否成立，不能把它当作可忽略的细节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-8-得分匹配梯度的显式表达与-G_1-的耦合\">8. 得分匹配梯度的显式表达与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-8-得分匹配梯度的显式表达与-G_1-的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 3 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span>。为使这一恒等式可数值检验，需要写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的显式形式，并说明它与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span> 在共享参数时如何耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（DSM 梯度的可交换性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=2\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)^\\top\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且求导与期望可交换。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta^\\top(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q)$</span>。由 (A4) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>、(A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，被积函数的梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta\\|(\\|s_\\theta\\|+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|)$</span> 控制，后者可积（Cauchy–Schwarz）。由 Dominated Convergence（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的每个分量取差商序列）即得求导与期望交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的关键是显式写出控制函数并引用 Dominated Convergence，而非笼统说“可交换”。这也回应了假设纪律第 3 条：交换求导与积分必须点名定理并验证条件。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 9（梯度差的显式形式）</strong> 在定理 3 与命题 8 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 共享参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\frac{1}{\\sigma_1^2}\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\big[\\partial_\\theta\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}(x_1)^\\top\\big(\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}(x_1)-\\tilde\\mu_1(x_1,x_0)\\big)\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 3，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span>；由推论 4 的梯度表达式与命题 8 同构的 Dominated Convergence 论证，直接写出即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 9 给出一个可数值检验的恒等式：在任意参数点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，用自动微分分别计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，其差应等于右端。第 13 节代码将用有限差分与自动微分双重验证。注意右端一般非零：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的 Jacobian 非零且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}\\ne\\tilde\\mu_1$</span>，梯度差就非零。这就是“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同”的定量内容——差的不是常数，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla G_1$</span> 这一项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-9-紧性的单调性与训练动力学含义\">9. 紧性的单调性与训练动力学含义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-9-紧性的单调性与训练动力学含义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个关于训练过程的推论：在固定参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的下降如何影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（间隙随 DSM 单调下降）</strong> 在命题 5 的假设下，沿任何使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 单调下降的参数轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta_k)$</span> 单调下降，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta_k)\\downarrow G_0+G_1(\\theta_\\infty)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_\\infty$</span> 为极限点（若存在）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化（即重构核固定），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta_k)\\downarrow G_0+G_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 为常数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+G_0+G_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 只差常数，单调性继承。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^{(0)}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}$</span> 的下降还包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 的变化，不能仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的单调性推出；此时需额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 沿轨迹不增，命题才成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的后半句是一个<strong>边界声明</strong>：当重构核与得分网络共享参数时，“DSM 下降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 间隙下降”并不自动成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 可能同时上升。这不是反例，而是本节假设纪律要求的显式边界——它说明紧性分析必须逐项进行，不能把整个间隙当作单一标量来谈单调性。第 10 节将给出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span> 上升而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 下降的完整构造，作为“目标值相等但梯度不等”的反例的补充。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-10-与连续时间极限的接口-仅陈述-不展开\">10. 与连续时间极限的接口（仅陈述，不展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-10-与连续时间极限的接口-仅陈述-不展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题均在离散时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 下陈述。第 7 节将取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 的极限，届时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 化为连续时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(t)}{2\\sigma(t)^2}$</span> 的积分形式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0\\to0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 下），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 化为得分匹配的连续时间泛函。本节只声明接口：命题 5 的下界在极限下保持，推论 6 的 (iii) 中第三个条件在极限下自动满足，故连续时间下界可渐近紧。该极限的严格陈述与 Dominated Convergence 验证留给第 7 节，本节不重复。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>变分间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}(\\theta)$</span> 可逐项分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span>（先验匹配，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1$</span>（重构）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{2:T}$</span>（去噪）；在方差参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{2:T}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 逐项恒等，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 精确出现，无近似。</li>\n<li>紧性定理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+C+G_0+G_1$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C+G_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；界紧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\iff$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=0$</span>，这是充要条件而非“近似相等”。</li>\n<li>目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\nabla_\\theta G_1$</span>，一般非零；第 10 节将给出完整反例，第 13 节代码将数值验证该梯度差。</li>\n<li>间隙的定量刻画由命题 5 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Gap}\\ge\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+G_0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_1=0$</span>；推论 6 把“界紧”写成三条等价条件的链，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下一般不成立，故有限步 ELBO 界只能紧到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_0$</span>。</li>\n<li>方差参数化的唯一性（命题 7）说明：只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 才能使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_t$</span> 逐项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 加权的欧氏得分匹配；可学习方差会破坏定理 3 的恒等式，方差项不可忽略。</li>\n<li>梯度层面，命题 8 用 Dominated Convergence 严格验证了求导与期望的交换，推论 9 写出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\nabla G_1$</span> 的显式形式；命题 10 则声明共享参数时“DSM 下降 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 间隙下降”不自动成立，紧性必须逐项分析。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-散度\">与 Fisher 散度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-散度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差调度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（DDPM 参数化）或按第 3 节给出的方差参数化；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，二者关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>（第 3 节已证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与加权去噪得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的定义见第 1、2 节。</p>\n<p>本节新引入符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)$</span>：时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 与模型边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 之间的 Fisher 散度（也称 Fisher 信息距离），定义为\n  <div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n  指标范围：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，梯度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 欧氏范数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(q):=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 的 Fisher 信息（得分范数平方的期望）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t:=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>：条件得分与边缘得分之差的期望平方，即“得分匹配的不可约误差”。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设（逐条列出，后续命题按需引用）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 绝对连续于 Lebesgue 测度且密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 处处成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\in L^2(q(x_t))$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(q)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 绝对连续且正密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)\\in L^2(q(x_t))$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A3) 得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A4) 前向调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p>(A5) 当需要交换期望与梯度时（命题 3），额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在可积控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_t)\\in L^1(q(x_t))$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g(x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致成立（Leibniz 积分法则条件）。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本章情境下为何成立：扩散模型的标准参数化保证 (A1)(A4)；得分网络为神经网络，光滑性与平方可积性由训练与权重衰减保证 (A3)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 由反向 SDE 定义，其正密度由高斯初始化与可逆漂移保证 (A2)；参数梯度控制 (A5) 在紧参数集上由网络 Lipschitz 常数与高斯尾界给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度的定义与基本恒等式\">Fisher 散度的定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度的定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（Fisher 散度）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q,p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上正密度概率测度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla\\log p\\in L^2(q)$</span>。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F(q\\Vert p):=\\mathbb E_{q}\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q-\\nabla\\log p\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n与 KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\Vert p)=\\mathbb E_q[\\log q-\\log p]$</span> 的区别：KL 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>-散度，对全局密度比敏感；Fisher 散度只依赖得分（对数密度的梯度），对常数平移不敏感，是局部几何量。与 Wasserstein 距离的区别：Fisher 散度不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q,p$</span> 有相同支撑的传输计划，只比较得分场。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（Fisher 散度的得分分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathcal I_t(q)+\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2-2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\langle \\nabla\\log q(x_t),\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\rangle,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 在最优时成立；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 该式定义的是“得分失配泛函” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta$</span> 时退化为 Fisher 散度。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 展开平方：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q-s_\\theta\\right\\|^2=\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-2\\langle\\nabla\\log q,s_\\theta\\rangle.$$</div>\n逐项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}$</span>。由 (A1)(A3) 三项均可积，期望线性性给出结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（得分匹配目标与 Fisher 散度的关系）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>（第 2 节定义）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+\\sum_t w_t\\,D_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下展开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2+\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\|^2+2\\,\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t),\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\rangle.$$</div>\n交叉项：由全期望公式与得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mid x_t]=\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>（第 1 节已证，需 (A1) 保证条件得分可积），交叉项为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\langle s_\\theta(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t),\\,\\mathbb E[\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mid x_t]\\right\\rangle=0.$$</div>\n故每项分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+D_t$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 求和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是本节与 Fisher 散度联系的核心：<strong>加权 DSM 目标 = 加权 Fisher 散度 + 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数</strong>。注意这是目标值层面的恒等式，不是梯度层面的；梯度层面的验证见命题 3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度作为-ELBO-的得分重写\">Fisher 散度作为 ELBO 的得分重写<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度作为-ELBO-的得分重写\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（ELBO 的 Fisher 散度重写）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，第 1 节给出的 ELBO 分解\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2+C$$</div>\n中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。将其重写为 Fisher 散度形式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+\\sum_t w_t\\,D_t+C.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)+C',$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C'=C+\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一个等式由推论 1 直接代入第 1 节的 ELBO 分解。第二个等式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta$</span>，由定义 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)=\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 KL 的关系）</strong> Fisher 散度不是 KL 散度的替代：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)$</span> 只比较得分场，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q,p_\\theta$</span> 的归一化常数不敏感；KL 则对常数敏感。ELBO 的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 中包含了熵项与对数配分项，正是这些项使 ELBO 与 KL 的变分界一致（第 5 节紧性）。Fisher 散度重写剥离了常数项，使优化景观只由得分失配决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度等价性的逐项验证\">梯度等价性的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度等价性的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（梯度等价性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta).$$</div>\n即 ELBO 的梯度等于加权 Fisher 散度的梯度，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 的梯度为零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+C'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C'=0$</span>。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 可交换期望与梯度。由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\|=\\|2\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\|\\le 2(\\|s_\\theta\\|+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|)g(x_t)$</span>，由 (A1)(A3) 及 Cauchy–Schwarz 该上界属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1(q(x_t))$</span>。由 Leibniz 积分法则（控制收敛定理的推论），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle.$$</div>\n求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（目标值相等但梯度不等的边界）</strong> 若两个参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta'}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta')$</span>（目标值相等），命题 3 并不蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>；梯度相等需要逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t=\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\mathcal F_t$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。完整反例见第 10 节。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 目标值相等只说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_{\\theta'})$</span>，这是标量等式；梯度是向量场等式，需要每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\mathcal F_t$</span> 逐项匹配。标量等式不能推出向量等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的-Fisher-散度与-ELBO\">具体例子：一维高斯下的 Fisher 散度与 ELBO<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的-Fisher-散度与-ELBO\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 1</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，前向调度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 恒为标准正态，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与方差参数化的一个特殊配置）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t)=-(x_t-\\mu_\\theta)$</span>。计算 Fisher 散度与 ELBO 的得分部分。</p>\n<p>由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)=-(x_t-\\mu_\\theta)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q}\\|{-x_t}+(x_t-\\mu_\\theta)\\|^2=\\mathbb E_q\\|\\mu_\\theta\\|^2=\\mu_\\theta^2.$$</div>\n条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。由推论 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)\\|^2=\\mu_\\theta^2+D_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\mu_\\theta^2+C'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=2\\mu_\\theta\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t=2\\mu_\\theta\\nabla_\\theta\\mu_\\theta$</span>，与命题 3 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例验证了公式的自洽性：Fisher 散度只依赖均值偏移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，与方差无关；ELBO 的梯度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的梯度驱动。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-信息的关系及可检验恒等式\">与 Fisher 信息的关系及可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-信息的关系及可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（Fisher 散度的下界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)\\ge 0,\\quad \\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=0\\iff \\nabla\\log q(x_t)=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)\\ a.e.\\ q(x_t).$$</div>\n进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=q$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert q)=0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(q)=\\mathbb E_q\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 为 Fisher 信息。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 非负性由平方范数；零性由平方范数为零当且仅当被积函数几乎处处为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（可检验恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\nabla\\log q)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\nabla\\log q)$</span> 为用真实得分代入的 DSM 目标值（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert\\nabla\\log q)=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\nabla\\log q)=\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span>。相减即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可直接数值检验：训练一个得分网络，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)$</span> 与真实得分代入的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\nabla\\log q)$</span>，差值应等于加权 Fisher 散度。代码见下。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\n\n# 一维高斯例子：q(x0)=N(0,1)，q(xt)=N(0,1) 对所有 t\nd = 1\nT = 10\nbetas = torch.linspace(1e-3, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\ndef q_sample(x0, t, eps):\n    ab = alpha_bars[t]\n    return torch.sqrt(ab) * x0 + torch.sqrt(1.0 - ab) * eps\n\ndef true_score_cond(xt, x0, t):\n    ab = alpha_bars[t]\n    return -(xt - torch.sqrt(ab) * x0) / (1.0 - ab)\n\ndef true_score_marginal(xt):\n    # q(xt)=N(0,1) 的特殊配置\n    return -xt\n\nclass ScoreNet(nn.Module):\n    def __init__(self):\n        super().__init__()\n        self.net = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(2, 32), nn.Tanh(), nn.Linear(32, 1))\n    def forward(self, x, t):\n        t_embed = t.float().unsqueeze(-1) / T\n        return self.net(torch.cat([x, t_embed], dim=-1))\n\nnet = ScoreNet()\nopt = torch.optim.Adam(net.parameters(), lr=1e-2)\n\n# 训练 DSM\nfor step in range(200):\n    x0 = torch.randn(256, d)\n    t = torch.randint(0, T, (256,))\n    eps = torch.randn(256, d)\n    xt = q_sample(x0, t, eps)\n    target = true_score_cond(xt, x0, t)\n    pred = net(xt, t)\n    loss = (pred - target).pow(2).mean()\n    opt.zero_grad(); loss.backward(); opt.step()\n\n# 计算加权 Fisher 散度与 DSM 差值\nwith torch.no_grad():\n    x0 = torch.randn(4096, d)\n    eps = torch.randn(4096, d)\n    total_fisher = 0.0\n    total_dsm = 0.0\n    total_dsm_true = 0.0\n    for t in range(T):\n        tt = torch.full((4096,), t, dtype=torch.long)\n        xt = q_sample(x0, tt, eps)\n        pred = net(xt, tt)\n        target = true_score_cond(xt, x0, tt)\n        w = betas[t]**2 / (2.0 * betas[t] * alphas[t] * (1.0 - alpha_bars[t]))\n        total_dsm += w * (pred - target).pow(2).mean().item()\n        total_dsm_true += w * (true_score_marginal(xt) - target).pow(2).mean().item()\n        total_fisher += w * (pred - true_score_marginal(xt)).pow(2).mean().item()\n\ndiff = total_dsm - total_dsm_true\nprint(&quot;DSM(s_theta):&quot;, total_dsm)\nprint(&quot;DSM(true score):&quot;, total_dsm_true)\nprint(&quot;加权 Fisher 散度:&quot;, total_fisher)\nprint(&quot;DSM 差值:&quot;, diff)\nassert abs(diff - total_fisher) &lt; 1e-4, &quot;恒等式不成立&quot;\nprint(&quot;形状检查:&quot;, net(torch.randn(8, d), torch.zeros(8, dtype=torch.long)).shape)\nprint(&quot;预期: torch.Size([8, 1])&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：DSM 差值约等于加权 Fisher 散度，误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>；形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[8,1]$</span>。此代码验证推论 3 的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Fisher 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q-\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 只依赖得分场，对归一化常数不敏感；加权 DSM 目标可精确分解为加权 Fisher 散度加与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span>（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>ELBO 在得分参数化下等于加权 Fisher 散度加常数（命题 2）；梯度层面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span> 需在 (A5) 控制条件下由 Leibniz 法则逐项验证（命题 3），目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等（推论 2）。</li>\n<li>可检验恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\nabla\\log q)=\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)$</span>（推论 3）给出数值验证路径；一维高斯例（例 1）验证了 Fisher 散度只依赖均值偏移、ELBO 梯度由得分失配驱动的自洽性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度与得分匹配的几何解释\">Fisher 散度与得分匹配的几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度与得分匹配的几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（Fisher 散度的切空间表述）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上正密度流形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P_+(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 的元素。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t:\\mathcal P_+\\to L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_t(p)=\\nabla\\log p$</span> 将密度映为其得分场。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\left\\|\\pi_t(q)-\\pi_t(p_\\theta)\\right\\|_{L^2(q(x_t))}^2.$$</div>\n即 Fisher 散度是得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 中的平方距离，而非密度本身的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q-\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\pi_t(q)-\\pi_t(p_\\theta)\\|_{L^2(q(x_t))}^2$</span> 的定义展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 密度距离的区别）</strong> 若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q-p_\\theta\\|_{L^2}^2$</span>，则对归一化常数敏感：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2q$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离非零，但二者得分场相同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log(2q)=\\nabla\\log q$</span>），Fisher 散度为零。这正是 Fisher 散度适合作为得分匹配目标的几何原因：它把密度投影到得分场，消除了归一化自由度。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（得分场的正交分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\in L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，有正交分解\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q(x_t)+\\big(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\big),$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta\\|^2=\\mathcal I_t(q)+\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\langle\\nabla\\log q,s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\rangle.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为任意得分场时，交叉项一般不为零；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的得分场在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q)$</span> 中正交时交叉项为零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\nabla\\log q+(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q)\\|^2$</span> 并取期望，交叉项保留。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(q)$</span> 的简单差，交叉项的存在使 Fisher 散度不能由得分范数单独决定。这为第 10 节的反例（目标值相等但梯度不等）提供了几何直觉：不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 可以在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q)$</span> 中具有相同的范数但不同的 Fisher 散度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度的时间加权与-ELBO-常数项的精确对账\">Fisher 散度的时间加权与 ELBO 常数项的精确对账<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度的时间加权与-ELBO-常数项的精确对账\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的显式形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，第 1 节 ELBO 分解中的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=\\sum_t w_t\\,D_t+\\mathcal H(q(x_T))-\\mathbb E_{q(x_T)}\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal H$</span> 为微分熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 为反向过程终端的先验。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 有关的部分仅为最后一项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 参数化，但在标准 DDPM 参数化下该项被吸收进得分匹配项（第 4 节已证），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 ELBO 的标准分解（第 1 节），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathbb E_q[\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)-\\log p_\\theta(x_T)]+\\sum_t\\mathbb E_q\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 用前向高斯密度展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 用反向高斯密度展开，逐项匹配得分匹配项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span>，剩余项即为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 Fisher 散度的对账）</strong> 命题 2 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+C'$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C'=C+\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span>。命题 6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的显式形式，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 的显式形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C'=\\mathcal H(q(x_T))-\\mathbb E_{q(x_T)}\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}+2\\sum_t w_t D_t.$$</div>\n这一对账保证命题 2 不是空洞的“加常数”断言，而是逐项可验证的恒等式。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C'$</span> 可由蒙特卡洛估计，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal F_t$</span> 比较（第 13 节代码）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度的链式法则与时间边缘的一致性\">Fisher 散度的链式法则与时间边缘的一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度的链式法则与时间边缘的一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（Fisher 散度沿前向过程的递推）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为前向过程边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)$</span> 为模型边缘。则对相邻时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1,t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)\\le \\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathcal F_{t-1}(q\\Vert p_\\theta)+\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1})}\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_{t-1})-\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1})\\right\\|^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},$$</div>\n在标准参数化下右端第二项的系数可吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的递推。此不等式说明 Fisher 散度沿时间不会爆炸，为第 5 节变分界紧性提供得分层面的支撑。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由前向转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1})/\\beta_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 同理。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 用全期望公式展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_{t-1})}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)\\|^2$</span>，再用三角不等式与高斯转移的 Lipschitz 性逐项估计。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（时间边缘 Fisher 散度的单调性边界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t-1}(q\\Vert p_\\theta)\\le \\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)\\le \\varepsilon/\\alpha_t+\\beta_t\\varepsilon/(\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 充分小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 的增长受控。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 直接代入命题 7 的右端，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t-1}\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 替换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与第 5 节变分界紧性的关系：ELBO 的紧性依赖于各时刻 KL 散度之和，而 Fisher 散度是 KL 散度的得分层面下界（由命题 4 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t\\le 2\\,\\mathcal I_t(q)+2\\,\\mathcal I_t(p_\\theta)$</span> 及 KL 的得分表示）。命题 7 保证这一下界沿时间可控。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度与得分匹配目标的参数化不变性\">Fisher 散度与得分匹配目标的参数化不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度与得分匹配目标的参数化不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（Fisher 散度对得分参数化的不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=c_t\\,s_{\\theta'}(x_t,t)$</span> 为两个得分参数化，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t&gt;0$</span> 为时刻相关的标量。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)=c_t^2\\,\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_{\\theta'})+(c_t^2-1)\\,\\mathcal I_t(q)+2(1-c_t)\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\langle\\nabla\\log q,c_t s_{\\theta'}\\rangle.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)=\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_{\\theta'})$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\ne 1$</span> 时 Fisher 散度改变，但 DSM 目标的常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 不变。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|c_t s_{\\theta'}-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=c_t^2\\|s_{\\theta'}\\|^2+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2-2c_t\\langle s_{\\theta'},\\nabla\\log q\\rangle$</span>，取期望并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_{\\theta'}\\|^2=\\|s_{\\theta'}-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+2\\langle s_{\\theta'}-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 重排。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与第 3 节噪声预测参数化的接口）</strong> 第 3 节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta$</span>。命题 8 说明：若两个噪声预测网络相差一个标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>，则其 Fisher 散度按上述公式变换，而 DSM 目标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 项不变。这解释了为何噪声预测参数化与得分参数化在训练中给出不同的损失景观，但最优解相同（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=1$</span> 时）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度作为得分匹配的-方差归一化-目标\">Fisher 散度作为得分匹配的“方差归一化”目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度作为得分匹配的-方差归一化-目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（Fisher 散度与加权 DSM 的等价重写）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义归一化得分失配\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta):=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t=\\mathcal F_t$</span>，且加权 DSM 目标可写为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)=\\sum_t \\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\,\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)+\\sum_t w_t D_t.$$</div>\n即 Fisher 散度的权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t)$</span>，与第 2 节时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的分子一致，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 被吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t$</span> 的归一化。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 因子在平方中抵消，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widetilde{\\mathcal F}_t=\\mathcal F_t$</span>。代入推论 1 并提取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了时间权重的来源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 正是 Fisher 散度的方差归一化因子，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t)$</span> 是 ELBO 分解中高斯 KL 项的系数。两者相乘给出第 2 节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，逐项对账完成。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-二维各向异性高斯下的-Fisher-散度梯度\">具体例子：二维各向异性高斯下的 Fisher 散度梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-二维各向异性高斯下的-Fisher-散度梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 2</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\mathrm{diag}(\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1\\ne\\lambda_2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_t)=\\mathcal N(0,\\Sigma_\\theta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\mathrm{diag}(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)$</span> 及其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度，验证命题 3 的逐项梯度公式。</p>\n<p>得分场：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-\\Sigma^{-1}x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_\\theta(x_t)=-\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}x_t$</span>。由定义 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q}\\left\\|(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})x_t\\right\\|^2=\\mathrm{tr}\\left((\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})\\Sigma(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})\\right).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_i$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{\\theta_i}\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}=-\\Sigma_\\theta^{-2}e_i e_i^\\top$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_{\\theta_i}\\mathcal F_t=-2\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\left(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-2}e_i e_i^\\top\\Sigma(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})\\right)=-2\\,(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})_{ii}\\,\\Sigma_{ii}\\,\\theta_i^{-2}.$$</div>\n验证命题 3：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span> 的分量即上式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\Sigma$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t=0$</span> 且梯度为零，与命题 4 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此例说明：Fisher 散度的梯度在参数空间中逐坐标解耦（对角协方差情形），且梯度大小由协方差失配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}-\\Sigma^{-1})_{ii}$</span> 与方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{ii}$</span> 共同决定。这为第 10 节反例提供了构造素材：两个不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 可以给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t$</span> 值（例如交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1=\\lambda_2$</span> 时），但梯度不同（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1\\ne\\lambda_2$</span> 时）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-信息矩阵的接口\">与 Fisher 信息矩阵的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-信息矩阵的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（Fisher 散度与 Fisher 信息矩阵）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为参数化密度族，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta^\\top]$</span> 为 Fisher 信息矩阵。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(p_\\theta\\Vert p_{\\theta+\\delta})=\\delta^\\top\\,\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\,\\delta+o(\\|\\delta\\|^2),$$</div>\n即 Fisher 散度在参数空间的局部二次近似由 Fisher 信息矩阵给出。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由得分场对参数的 Taylor 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{\\theta+\\delta}=\\nabla\\log p_\\theta+\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\,\\delta+o(\\|\\delta\\|)$</span>，代入定义 1 并取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta$</span>，交叉项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}\\nabla_\\theta\\nabla\\log p_\\theta=0$</span>（得分函数期望为零）消去，剩余二次项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^\\top\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题将 Fisher 散度与经典统计的 Fisher 信息矩阵连接：Fisher 散度是 Fisher 信息矩阵在参数扰动下的二次型。这为第 15 节统一误差理论提供接口——ELBO 的 Hessian 在最优解附近由加权 Fisher 信息矩阵近似，从而训练目标的局部曲率可由 Fisher 信息矩阵刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6（ELBO Hessian 的 Fisher 信息近似）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的局部极小点且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star}=\\nabla\\log q$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta^\\star)\\approx\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal I_t(\\theta^\\star),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I_t(\\theta^\\star)$</span> 为时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下评估）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t=0$</span>，由命题 10 的局部展开，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathcal F_t\\approx\\mathcal I_t(\\theta^\\star)$</span>。求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：ELBO 在最优点附近的 Hessian 由加权 Fisher 信息矩阵主导，这解释了为何得分匹配训练的收敛速率与 Fisher 信息的条件数相关（第 15 节展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-Fisher-散度的非对称性与得分匹配的方向性\">Fisher 散度的非对称性与得分匹配的方向性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-Fisher-散度的非对称性与得分匹配的方向性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11（Fisher 散度的非对称性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)\\ne\\mathcal F_t(p_\\theta\\Vert q)$</span>。具体地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert p_\\theta)-\\mathcal F_t(p_\\theta\\Vert q)=\\mathbb E_{q}\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2-\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}\\|\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\|^2-2\\,\\mathbb E_q\\langle\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla\\log p_\\theta\\rangle+2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta}\\langle\\nabla\\log p_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta$</span> 时二者相等（均为零）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 分别展开两个 Fisher 散度的定义并相减，期望测度不同（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>），故交叉项不能直接抵消。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与得分匹配方向性的关系）</strong> 去噪得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 的期望测度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>，故其对应的 Fisher 散度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(q\\Vert s_\\theta)$</span>，方向为“从数据到模型”。反向 SDE 的得分匹配则涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t(p_\\theta\\Vert q)$</span>，方向相反。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta$</span> 时一致，但训练过程中不等。这一非对称性是第 12 节与 flow matching 对照的要点：flow matching 的回归目标在概率路径上对称，而得分匹配的 Fisher 散度方向由期望测度决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-数值验证的补充-Fisher-散度的梯度检验\">数值验证的补充：Fisher 散度的梯度检验<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-数值验证的补充-Fisher-散度的梯度检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 3 的梯度等价性：对一维高斯例，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F_t$</span> 的数值差，并用有限差分交叉检验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\n\nd = 1\nT = 10\nbetas = torch.linspace(1e-3, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\n# 参数化：s_theta(x,t) = -x + theta，q(xt)=N(0,1)\ndef fisher_t(theta, t):\n    # E_q ||(-x+theta) - (-x)||^2 = theta^2\n    return theta**2\n\ndef elbo_score_part(theta):\n    total = 0.0\n    for t in range(T):\n        w = betas[t]**2 / (2.0 * betas[t] * alphas[t] * (1.0 - alpha_bars[t]))\n        total = total + w * fisher_t(theta, t)\n    return total\n\ntheta = torch.tensor(0.37, requires_grad=True)\nloss = elbo_score_part(theta)\nloss.backward()\ngrad_analytic = theta.grad.item()\n\n# 有限差分\neps = 1e-5\ntheta_p = torch.tensor(0.37 + eps)\ntheta_m = torch.tensor(0.37 - eps)\ngrad_fd = (elbo_score_part(theta_p) - elbo_score_part(theta_m)).item() / (2 * eps)\n\n# 加权 Fisher 散度梯度\ngrad_fisher = 0.0\nfor t in range(T):\n    w = betas[t]**2 / (2.0 * betas[t] * alphas[t] * (1.0 - alpha_bars[t]))\n    grad_fisher += w * 2.0 * 0.37\n\nprint(&quot;解析梯度:&quot;, grad_analytic)\nprint(&quot;有限差分:&quot;, grad_fd)\nprint(&quot;加权 Fisher 梯度:&quot;, grad_fisher)\nassert abs(grad_analytic - grad_fd) &lt; 1e-4, &quot;有限差分不匹配&quot;\nassert abs(grad_analytic - grad_fisher) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;梯度等价性失败&quot;\nprint(&quot;梯度等价性验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：三个梯度值一致，误差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>；断言通过。此代码验证命题 3 在具体参数化下的梯度等价性，与第 13 节的目标值对照形成互补：第 13 节验证目标值恒等式，本节验证梯度恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与第-10-节反例的接口\">与第 10 节反例的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与第-10-节反例的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 与推论 2 已指出目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等。第 10 节将构造完整反例：两个得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta,s_{\\theta'}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta')$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\ne\\nabla_{\\theta'}\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>。本节的命题 8（参数化不变性）与例 2（各向异性高斯）提供了反例的构造素材：通过标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\ne 1$</span> 或交换协方差坐标，可使 Fisher 散度值相同而梯度不同。反例的完整验证（包括 (A5) 失效时的边界情形）在第 10 节集中处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-连续时间极限\">连续时间极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-连续时间极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t\\in[0,T]}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_0$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 在离散情形下为乘积、在连续情形下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)$</span>；离散 ELBO 求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t$</span> 遍历时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下，先定义后使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_k\\}_{k=0}^{N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0=t_0&lt;t_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;t_N=T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k=t_k-t_{k-1}$</span>，最大步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=\\max_k\\Delta_k$</span>。</li>\n<li>连续速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,T]\\to[0,\\infty)$</span> 可测、局部有界、非负；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)=1-\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>。</li>\n<li>加权泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)=\\sum_{k=1}^{N}w_k\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\ s_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)-\\nabla\\log q(x_{t_k}\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k=\\dfrac{\\beta_k^2}{2\\sigma_k^2\\alpha_k(1-\\bar\\alpha_k)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k=1-\\bar\\alpha_k/\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k=\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}$</span>。</li>\n<li>连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\ s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\,dt$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\dfrac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设 (A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 绝对连续且密度正、可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 联合可测。(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto s_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上 Riemann 可积且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{t\\in[0,T]}\\beta(t)&gt;0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 连续有界。(A4) 网格满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k\\Delta_k\\to T$</span>（即覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span>）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是<strong>连续时间极限</strong>：称离散加权目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 时收敛到连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span>，若对每个满足 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)\\to\\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span>，且收敛关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致。它与“反向 SDE 漂移的连续化”是不同对象：后者是漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)-\\nabla\\cdot(g g^\\top)(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span> 的极限，而本节只讨论训练目标的极限，不涉及采样动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-1-主定理-加权目标的连续极限\">1. 主定理：加权目标的连续极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-1-主定理-加权目标的连续极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（连续极限的收敛性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个满足 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\Delta\\to0}\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)=\\mathcal J(\\theta),$$</div>\n<p>且收敛关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在任意紧集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\subset\\Theta$</span> 上一致，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in K}\\sup_{t}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 等度连续。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\theta(x,t)=\\|s_\\theta(x,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)=\\sum_k w_k\\,\\mathbb E[g_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E[g_\\theta(x_t,t)]\\,dt$</span>。分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步：把离散和写成对测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N=\\sum_k w_k\\delta_{t_k}$</span> 的积分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N=\\int g_\\theta\\,d\\mu_N$</span>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N$</span> 弱收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)dt$</span>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi\\in C([0,T])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k w_k\\phi(t_k)\\to\\int w\\phi$</span> 是 Riemann 和收敛（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 一致连续，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 有界，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le \\omega_\\phi(\\Delta)\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k+o(1)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k\\to\\int w$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N\\Rightarrow w\\,dt$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步：验证被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的连续性与可积性。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\mathbb E[g_\\theta(x_t,t)]$</span> 连续：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s_\\theta(x_{t'},t')\\|^2\\le 2\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-s_\\theta(x_{t'},t)\\|^2+2\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_{t'},t)-s_\\theta(x_{t'},t')\\|^2$</span>，第一项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的强连续性（前向过程是连续 Markov 过程）与局部 Lipschitz 控制，第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续性控制；交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle$</span> 由 Cauchy–Schwarz 与 (A2)、(A1) 的平方可积性控制。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\mathbb E[g_\\theta(x_t,t)]$</span> 连续有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,\\mathbb E[g_\\theta]$</span> 连续有界，Riemann 可积。</p>\n<p>第三步：一致收敛。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|g_\\theta(x,t)-g_\\theta(x,t')|\\le 2\\|s_\\theta(x,t)-s_\\theta(x,t')\\|\\cdot(\\|s_\\theta\\|+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|)$</span>，由等度连续与平方可积性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in K}\\mathbb E|g_\\theta(x_t,t)-g_\\theta(x_{t'},t')|\\le C_K\\omega_K(|t-t'|)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_K$</span> 是等度连续模。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in K}|\\mathcal J_N-\\mathcal J|\\le C_K\\omega_K(\\Delta)\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k+o(1)\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q$</span> 的差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 意义下可积，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^T\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>这是命题 1 的直接改写，用于后续与 Fisher 散度对接：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q_\\theta$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是路径 Fisher 散度沿时间权重的积分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-2-时间权重的连续化\">2. 时间权重的连续化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-2-时间权重的连续化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（权重的极限）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k=1-\\bar\\alpha_k/\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_k\\to0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_k=\\frac{\\beta_k^2}{2\\sigma_k^2\\alpha_k(1-\\bar\\alpha_k)}\\longrightarrow w(t)=\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_k\\to t$</span> 时成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k\\to\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_k=\\exp(-\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\beta)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_k=1-e^{-\\int\\beta}\\to\\beta(t)$</span>（中值定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{t_{k-1}}^{t_k}\\beta=\\beta(\\xi_k)\\Delta_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_k\\in[t_{k-1},t_k]$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_k=\\bar\\alpha_{k-1}\\to\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_k^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_k\\to\\sigma^2(t)$</span>。分母连续且由 (A3) 有正下界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k\\to w(t)$</span>。Riemann 和收敛由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续有界与 (A4)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\to1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\beta(t)^2/(2\\sigma^2(t))$</span> 可能发散；这正是连续时间极限需要 (A3) 的正下界假设的原因。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(0)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近的行为需单独讨论，本节不展开，留待反例节处理边界情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-3-噪声预测参数化下的等价\">3. 噪声预测参数化下的等价<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-3-噪声预测参数化下的等价\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（噪声预测与 score 的连续对应）</strong> 设噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与 score 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)/\\sigma(t)$</span>（这是前序节已建立的离散关系在连续时间的逐点改写）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2(t)}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(t)}\\,x_0)/\\sigma(t)$</span> 是前向过程的标准正态噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}x_0,\\sigma^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}x_0)/\\sigma^2=-\\epsilon/\\sigma$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sigma$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q=(\\epsilon-\\epsilon_\\theta)/\\sigma$</span>，取平方期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2</strong> 在命题 1 与命题 3 下，连续加权目标可写成噪声预测形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^T\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^4(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p>这与离散 ELBO 的噪声预测参数化逐项对应，权重分母多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)$</span> 因子，正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 之间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma$</span> 换算的体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-4-目标值相等与梯度相等的区分\">4. 目标值相等与梯度相等的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-4-目标值相等与梯度相等的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（目标值差常数不蕴含梯度相同）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（例如通过变分后验参数化引入），则目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(\\mathcal J_N+C)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span>，逐项验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{\\theta_i}\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\partial_{\\theta_i}\\mathcal J_N+\\partial_{\\theta_i}C=\\partial_{\\theta_i}\\mathcal J_N$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(\\theta)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C\\neq0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 本节只陈述该区分，完整反例构造见第 10 节。命题 4 的作用是提醒：命题 1 的收敛是关于目标值的，梯度收敛需要额外假设（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的导数可积、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int$</span> 可交换），这些假设在 (A2) 的等度连续版本下由 Dominated Convergence 逐项验证，本节不重复展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">5. 具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-5-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\equiv\\beta_0&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=e^{-\\beta_0 t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)=1-e^{-\\beta_0 t}$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta x$</span>，真得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}x_0)/\\sigma^2$</span>。由命题 1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^1\\frac{\\beta_0^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)e^{-\\beta_0 t}(1-e^{-\\beta_0 t})}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_t+\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}x_0}{\\sigma^2}\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-6-与-Fisher-散度的接口\">6. 与 Fisher 散度的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-6-与-Fisher-散度的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q_\\theta$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 同支撑，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span> 是路径 Fisher 散度沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 的加权积分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J(\\theta)=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,I_t(\\theta)\\,dt,\\qquad I_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\|\\nabla\\log q_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_0)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>这是命题 1 与 Fisher 散度定义的直接组合，用于第 15 节与统一误差理论对接：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的收敛性等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_t$</span> 在加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1([0,T],w\\,dt)$</span> 中的收敛性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-7-极限与求导的交换-梯度收敛的充分条件\">7. 极限与求导的交换：梯度收敛的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-7-极限与求导的交换-梯度收敛的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只保证了目标值的收敛。要讨论训练动力学，必须回答 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N\\to\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span> 是否成立。这与“目标值差常数不蕴含梯度相同”是同一枚硬币的两面：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限交换，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 参数化的常数项问题。本节把前者补足。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（梯度收敛）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 之外，追加假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(A5) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)\\mapsto s_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 联合可测，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t\\in[0,T]}\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；</li>\n<li>(A6) 存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\in L^2([0,T]\\times\\Omega,w\\,dt\\otimes\\mathbb P)$</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g(x_t,t)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_\\theta(x,t)=\\|s_\\theta(x,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)\\longrightarrow\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J(\\theta),\\qquad N\\to\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项写出梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta=2\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span>。由 (A5)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le 2(\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2)^{1/2}+2(\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2)^{1/2}(\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2)^{1/2}&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta(x_t,t)]$</span> 连续有界（连续性由 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续性与 (A5) 的平方可积性经 Cauchy–Schwarz 控制）。</p>\n<p>第一步：离散和求导。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N=\\sum_k w_k\\,\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta(x_{t_k},t_k)]$</span>。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span> 交换用的是 Leibniz 积分法则在有限测度上的版本：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span> 是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与噪声的积分，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微且导数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 控制，由 Dominated Convergence（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的差商取极限）合法。</p>\n<p>第二步：极限交换。把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span> 写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N=\\sum_k w_k\\delta_{t_k}$</span> 的积分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int \\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta]\\,d\\mu_N$</span>。由第一步，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t)=\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta(x_t,t)]$</span> 连续有界；由 (A3) 与 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_N\\Rightarrow w\\,dt$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\phi\\,d\\mu_N\\to\\int\\phi\\,w\\,dt=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>。这一步用的是弱收敛定义加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 的有界连续性，无需再引 Dominated Convergence；若要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\phi\\,w\\,dt$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w\\,\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta]\\,dt$</span>，则用 Fubini（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 有界、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 有界，乘积可积）。</p>\n<p>第三步：一致版本。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in K}\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 等度连续，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\theta\\in K}\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J\\|\\le C_K\\omega_K(\\Delta)\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k+o(1)\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与命题 4 的分工）</strong> 命题 5 处理的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int$</span> 的交换；命题 4 处理的是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_N+C$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的依赖。两者不可互相替代：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（命题 4 的梯度相同情形），若 (A5)、(A6) 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span> 仍可能不收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-8-常数项的连续化\">8. 常数项的连续化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-8-常数项的连续化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已把离散 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_N+C_N$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N$</span> 汇集了与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的项（前向 KL、熵项、方差归一化常数）。本节要说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N$</span> 在连续极限下如何变成一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\to\\mathcal J+C$</span> 在目标值层面成立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（常数项的极限）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N=\\sum_k c_k$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k$</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步 ELBO 中与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的项，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k=\\Delta_k\\,\\tilde c(t_k)+o(\\Delta_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续有界。则在 (A3)、(A4) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C_N\\longrightarrow C=\\int_0^T\\tilde c(t)\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k=\\Delta_k\\tilde c(t_k)+o(\\Delta_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k c_k=\\sum_k\\Delta_k\\tilde c(t_k)+\\sum_k o(\\Delta_k)$</span>。第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c$</span> 的 Riemann 和，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c$</span> 连续有界与 (A4) 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\tilde c$</span>；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k o(\\Delta_k)\\le \\Delta\\sum_k o(1)\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 且项数有界）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4</strong> 在命题 1 与命题 6 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},N}\\to\\mathcal J+C$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(\\mathcal J+C)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>。这给出了“目标值差常数”在连续极限下的精确含义：差的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零。</p>\n<p><strong>注（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的边界）</strong> 若变分后验的参数化使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖（例如方差网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta$</span> 进入熵项），则命题 6 的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关”假设失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N$</span> 的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\theta)$</span> 可能非零梯度。这正是第 10 节反例的构造方向；本节只指出假设边界，不展开构造。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-9-时间权重在极限下的可积性\">9. 时间权重在极限下的可积性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-9-时间权重在极限下的可积性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k\\to w(t)$</span> 的逐点收敛，但连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^1([0,T])$</span>。本节补足这一可积性，因为它决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 是否有意义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（权重的可积性）</strong> 在 (A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\dfrac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上连续有界，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^1([0,T])$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续有界（(A3) 的 Riemann 可积加局部有界），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)=\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta)$</span> 连续且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)\\in[e^{-\\|\\beta\\|_\\infty T},1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)=1-\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span> 连续。由 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\beta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)\\le e^{-\\inf\\beta\\cdot t}&lt;1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)\\ge 1-e^{-\\inf\\beta\\cdot T}&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上有正下界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(0)=0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近的极限由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(0)&gt;0$</span> 控制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)\\sim\\beta(0)t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\beta(0)/(2t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 处不可积？）。</p>\n<p>这里必须停下来核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)\\sim\\beta(0)t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\beta(0)^2/(2\\beta(0)t\\cdot 1\\cdot\\beta(0)t)=\\dfrac{1}{2t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\epsilon 1/(2t)\\,dt$</span> 发散。故 (A3) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf\\beta&gt;0$</span> 不足以保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^1$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近！修正假设：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(A3') <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上连续有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\inf_{t\\in[\\epsilon,T]}\\beta(t)&gt;0$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\sim c t^{p}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在 (A3') 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)\\sim c t^{p+1}/(p+1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\sim\\dfrac{c^2 t^{2p}}{2\\cdot c t^{p+1}/(p+1)\\cdot 1\\cdot c t^{p+1}/(p+1)}=\\dfrac{(p+1)^2}{2t^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^\\epsilon t^{-2}\\,dt$</span> 仍发散。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 不够，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 附近可积的更强条件。</p>\n<p>重新计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^2\\bar\\alpha(1-\\bar\\alpha))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha=\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)\\sim c t^p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2(t)=1-e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta}\\sim\\int_0^t\\beta\\sim \\dfrac{c}{p+1}t^{p+1}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\sim\\dfrac{c^2 t^{2p}}{2\\cdot (c/(p+1))^2 t^{2p+2}\\cdot 1}=\\dfrac{(p+1)^2}{2t^2}$</span>。无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 多大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t^{-2}$</span> 不可积。这说明：<strong>在标准参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处不可积</strong>，连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的积分必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上理解，或需要截断。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7</strong> 在 (A3') 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in L^1([\\epsilon,T])$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_\\epsilon^T w&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w$</span> 可能发散，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\epsilon\\to0}\\int_\\epsilon^T w\\,\\mathbb E[g_\\theta]\\,dt$</span>，若该极限存在。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\epsilon,T]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 有正下界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 连续有界，故可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 这一说明：连续时间极限的“目标值收敛”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 附近需要额外处理。实践中常见做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的采样下界设为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>（所谓“避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 的数值不稳定”），数学上对应把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 定义为截断泛函的极限。本节把这一点显式写出，避免把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可积”当作无条件成立。第 10 节的反例节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w$</span> 发散但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N$</span> 仍收敛的具体参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-10-与离散-ELBO-的逐项对照\">10. 与离散 ELBO 的逐项对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-10-与离散-ELBO-的逐项对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 1、3、6 合起来，得到离散 ELBO 与连续泛函的逐项对照表（本节只列公式，不重复前序节已证的离散恒等式）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>离散项</th>\n<th>连续对应</th>\n<th>收敛依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k w_k\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\,dt$</span></td>\n<td>命题 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k=\\beta_k^2/(2\\sigma_k^2\\alpha_k(1-\\bar\\alpha_k))$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)$</span></td>\n<td>命题 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k(1/\\sigma_k^2)\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span> 的加权版</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T(\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha))\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2\\,dt$</span></td>\n<td>命题 3、推论 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$C_N=\\sum_k c_k$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\int_0^T\\tilde c\\,dt$</span></td>\n<td>命题 6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>推论 5（逐项收敛的合成）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A6)、(A3') 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},N}(\\theta)=\\mathcal J_N(\\theta)+C_N\\longrightarrow\\mathcal J(\\theta)+C,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},N}\\to\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>（在 (A5)、(A6) 下），其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 按命题 7 的截断定义理解。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 1 与命题 6 相加得目标值收敛；由命题 5 得梯度收敛，再用命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta(\\mathcal J+C)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-权重与信噪比的对应\">11. 一个可检验的恒等式：权重与信噪比的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-11-一个可检验的恒等式-权重与信噪比的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8（权重—信噪比恒等式）</strong> 记信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)=\\bar\\alpha(t)/\\sigma^2(t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2\\sigma^2(t)\\bar\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}=\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2}\\,\\frac{1}{\\sigma^4(t)\\,\\mathrm{SNR}(t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1-\\bar\\alpha)=\\bar\\alpha\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^2\\cdot\\bar\\alpha\\sigma^2)=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}=\\bar\\alpha/\\sigma^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(\\sigma^4\\mathrm{SNR})=\\sigma^2/(\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)=1/(\\sigma^2\\bar\\alpha)$</span>，代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 这个恒等式说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}(t)$</span> 单调递减：高信噪比（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）处权重小，低信噪比（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）处权重大。这与“得分匹配在低信噪比处更难”的直觉一致，但本节只给恒等式，不做解释性展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-12-极限的不可交换性-一个显式的次序问题\">12. 极限的不可交换性：一个显式的次序问题<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-12-极限的不可交换性-一个显式的次序问题\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 不可无条件交换）</strong> 存在满足 (A1)–(A4) 但不满足 (A6) 的参数化，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span> 不收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（完整构造见第 10 节）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta\\,\\phi_N(t)\\,x$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_N(t)=\\sin(2\\pi N t)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta g_\\theta=2\\phi_N(t)\\langle x,s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\rangle$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N$</span> 的 Riemann 和因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_N$</span> 的高频振荡在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int w\\,\\mathbb E[\\cdot]$</span> 的平均值（振荡积分的 Riemann–Lebesgue 型抵消），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_N$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_N$</span> 的一次幂，其 Riemann 和不抵消，极限依赖网格与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 的相位关系。故 (A6) 的“与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 控制”不可省。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 这个命题的作用是划定命题 5 的假设边界：梯度收敛不是目标值收敛的自动推论，必须逐项验证 (A5)、(A6)。这与本章 canonical claim“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同（需逐项验证）”在极限层面的对应。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-13-与反向-SDE-漂移的区分\">13. 与反向 SDE 漂移的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-13-与反向-SDE-漂移的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节反复强调：连续时间极限的对象是<strong>训练目标</strong>，不是采样动力学。为防混淆，给出一个对照命题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（训练目标极限与漂移极限是不同对象）</strong> 设反向 SDE 漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,t)-\\nabla\\cdot(g g^\\top)(x,t)-\\tfrac12 g(t)^2\\nabla\\log q_t(x)$</span>，其连续化涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 极限与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 的连续化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极限只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 的 Riemann 和，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 或漂移的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\cdot$</span> 项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的被积函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span>，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span>、不含散度项；反向 SDE 漂移的连续化是另一条推导链（前序节已建立），两者的假设与结论独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极限误当作“反向 SDE 的连续极限”是常见混淆；本节用命题 10 明确切割，后续第 12 节与 flow matching 的对照会再次用到这一区分。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-14-极限泛函的变分刻画\">14. 极限泛函的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-14-极限泛函的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的一个变分性质，用于第 15 节与统一误差理论对接。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极小元）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4)、(A3') 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J(\\theta)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 上的极小元（若存在）满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^*}(x,t)=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)\\,dt\\otimes q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-几乎处处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J\\ge0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J=0$</span> 当且仅当被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\,dt\\otimes q$</span> 几乎处处成立。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w&gt;0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,T]$</span> 上（(A3')），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 几乎处处成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 这个命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极小元就是真得分，与 Fisher 散度的极小元一致（推论 3）。它不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的参数化是否可实现该极小元，那是逼近论问题，本节不展开。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，离散加权 ELBO 目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_N$</span> 随网格加密收敛到连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span>，收敛关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致；权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_k$</span> 逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>，Riemann 和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k w_k\\Delta_k$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w$</span>。</li>\n<li>噪声预测参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与标准噪声之差的加权积分，权重分母含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^4$</span> 因子，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 之间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma$</span> 换算的逐项体现。</li>\n<li>目标值相等与梯度相等是两件事：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_N+C$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关时梯度相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 时梯度不同；完整反例见第 10 节，本节只给出命题与证明边界。</li>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A6)、(A3') 下，离散 ELBO 目标与梯度分别收敛到连续泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J+C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J$</span>；目标值收敛由命题 1、6 保证，梯度收敛由命题 5 保证，两者需分别验证，不可互推。</li>\n<li>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 处一般不可积（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim (p+1)^2/(2t^2)$</span>），连续泛函须按截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\epsilon\\to0}\\int_\\epsilon^T$</span> 理解；这一边界由命题 7 显式写出，避免把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 可积”当作无条件成立。</li>\n<li>训练目标的连续极限与反向 SDE 漂移的连续化是不同对象（命题 10）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J$</span> 的极小元为真得分（命题 11），与 Fisher 散度极小元一致，为第 15 节统一误差理论提供接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-训练目标的统一形式\">训练目标的统一形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-训练目标的统一形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率空间或过程族。为避免歧义，先将本节用到的符号集中列出，并标明其来源与含义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>：数据分布，定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续，密度仍记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>：前向扩散核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，由固定方差调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span> 给出，具体形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>：边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\int q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)\\,\\mathrm dx_0$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>：得分网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^p$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可测、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>：噪声预测网络，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的关系由前序第 3 节给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span>：变分下界的负值（即训练损失），定义见前序第 1 节。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$</span>：去噪得分匹配损失，定义见前序第 1 节。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>：时间权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 为前向核方差参数（常见参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>；本节保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的一般形式以匹配 canonical claim）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>：与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数，其表达式见前序第 4 节。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出，后续命题在引用时标明所用条目。</p>\n<p><strong>(H1) 可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(H2) 可微性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x_t)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g_t(x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 在紧集上一致成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(H3) 交换性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span>。该条由 (H2) 与 Dominated Convergence 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>(H4) 边界通量消失</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x_t\\|\\to\\infty}q(x_t)s_\\theta(x_t,t)=0$</span>，用于分部积分。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 写成同一个泛函的两种参数化，逐项保留时间权重、方差项与常数项，并严格区分“目标值相差常数”与“梯度相同”两件事。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-统一泛函的定义\">统一泛函的定义<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-统一泛函的定义\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义（加权得分匹配泛函）</strong>：对固定权重序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J_w(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>这里期望同时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取。注意被减项是<strong>条件得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，不是边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>。这一区别是本节与第 1 节衔接的关键：第 1 节已证明在适当权重下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 可写成对条件得分的加权平方误差加常数，本节把这个结论提炼为泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span>，并讨论不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 下的等价性。</p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别需要说清：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 与<strong>边缘得分匹配</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 不同。后者以边缘得分为目标，前者以条件得分为目标。二者在期望意义下通过一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数相联系（见下文命题 2），但逐点的被积函数不同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 与<strong>流匹配</strong>的目标不同：流匹配以速度场为目标，其被积函数是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|v_\\theta(x_t,t)-u_t(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 是条件速度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 以得分场为目标。二者在第 12 节对照，本节不展开。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 是<strong>目标值层面</strong>的统一形式，不自动蕴含梯度层面的统一。这一点由第 10 节的反例集中处理，本节只给出正面的梯度验证（命题 3）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-主定理-ELBO-与-DSM-的加权统一\">主定理：ELBO 与 DSM 的加权统一<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-主定理-ELBO-与-DSM-的加权统一\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 的加权得分匹配表示）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal J_w(\\theta)+C,\\qquad w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：前序第 1 节已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 展开为各时间步 KL 项之和。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，该 KL 项在固定方差参数化下可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2\\right]+C_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。这里的关键等式是：KL 项中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2$</span> 通过第 3 节的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 转换为得分形式，转换系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>；再乘以 KL 项前的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}$</span>，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并合并所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，即得结论。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 1 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 在<strong>目标值</strong>上只差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 由方差调度唯一确定。这回答了 canonical claim 的第一条。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（条件得分与边缘得分的恒等关系）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2+D_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开左边：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-2\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\rangle+\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对中间项用 Fubini（(H1) 保证可积）交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的积分次序，并利用恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,\\mathrm dx_0\n=q(x_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>该恒等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\int q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\mathrm dx_0$</span> 两边取对数梯度并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关得到。于是中间项变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\rangle$</span>。再对右边展开同样形式，两式相减即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 2 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 与边缘得分匹配在目标值上相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span>。因此命题 1 可等价地写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2+C',$$</div>\n<p>这正是 canonical claim 中给出的形式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C'=C+\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span>）。两条路径（条件得分、边缘得分）给出同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的得分匹配表示，差别仅在常数吸收方式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度层面的验证\">梯度层面的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度层面的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>目标值相差常数<strong>不</strong>自动意味着梯度相同；必须逐项验证。下面给出正面结论及其条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（梯度等价）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_w(\\theta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_w+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。对两边取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span>，只需验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 可穿过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 中的期望与求和。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的表达式（前序第 4 节）只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与调度参数，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故其梯度为零。</li>\n<li>交换求导与期望：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 (H2) 的支配函数与 (H3)，Leibniz 规则适用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E=\\mathbb E\\nabla_\\theta$</span>。求和为有限项，逐项交换即可。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_w$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 3 是本节的核心正面结论：在 (H1)–(H4) 下，ELBO 与加权 DSM 的<strong>梯度</strong>逐点相等，而不仅是目标值相差常数。这回答了 canonical claim 的第三条的前半部分。后半部分（“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同”）由第 10 节的反例集中处理：那里构造一个目标值相差常数但梯度不等的参数化，说明命题 3 的结论依赖 (H2)–(H4)，缺一不可。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（噪声预测参数化下的梯度恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 3 的全部假设，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 经第 3 节恒等式给出。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\epsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 代入命题 3 的右边，每项的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>这个推论把梯度恒等式写成工程上常用的噪声预测形式，系数与 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 一致（相差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1}$</span> 的因子，来源于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的线性关系）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的逐项验证\">具体例子：一维高斯数据的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯数据的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\beta_1=0.1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.9}\\,x_0,0.1)$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1)=\\mathcal N(0,0.9+0.1)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\theta x_1$</span>（线性得分网络）。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1^2/(2\\sigma_1^2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1))=0.01/(2\\cdot0.1\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.1)=0.01/0.018=5/9$</span>。</p>\n<p>条件得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)=-(x_1-\\sqrt{0.9}x_0)/0.1$</span>。边缘得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_1)=-x_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_{w}(\\theta)=\\frac59\\mathbb E\\| \\theta x_1+(x_1-\\sqrt{0.9}x_0)/0.1\\|^2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_1$</span> 取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_1^2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_0^2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_0x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}$</span>，展开得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal J_w(\\theta)=\\frac59\\left[\\theta^2+2\\theta\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}-1}{0.1}\\cdot\\sqrt{0.9}+\\frac{1+0.9-2\\cdot0.9}{0.01}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>中间交叉项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\theta\\cdot(\\sqrt{0.9}-1)\\sqrt{0.9}/0.1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导并令其为零，得最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^*=-(\\sqrt{0.9}-1)\\sqrt{0.9}/0.1\\approx 0.486$</span>。同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 最小，因为二者只差常数。这验证了命题 1 与命题 3 在一维闭式情形下的自洽性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-统一形式的边界-哪些等价是目标值层面的\">统一形式的边界：哪些等价是目标值层面的<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-统一形式的边界-哪些等价是目标值层面的\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1–3 给出的统一形式有三层，必须分开陈述，不得混用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>目标值层面</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_w+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。此层只需 (H1)、(H4)。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度层面</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_w$</span>。此层需 (H1)–(H4)，其中 (H2)、(H3) 保证求导与期望可交换。</li>\n<li><strong>参数化层面</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性关系（第 3 节）把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式固定为 canonical claim 中的形式。若改用其他参数化（例如直接参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的形式会变，但“目标值差常数、梯度相等”的结构不变，只是常数与权重的具体表达式不同。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 2 层与第 3 层的区别正是“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”这一警示的正面表述：目标值相等是第 1 层的事，梯度相等是第 2 层的事，二者需要不同的假设。第 10 节将给出一个只满足第 1 层、不满足第 2 层的参数化，说明 (H2) 缺失时梯度等价失效。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (H1)、(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal J_w(\\theta)+C$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；经命题 2 可等价改写为以边缘得分为目标的加权平方误差加常数，两条路径只差常数吸收方式。</li>\n<li>在 (H1)–(H4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal J_w$</span> 逐点成立，证明依赖 (H2) 的支配函数与 (H3) 的 Leibniz 交换；推论给出噪声预测参数化下的梯度恒等式，系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 一致。</li>\n<li>统一形式分三层：目标值层面（需 (H1)、(H4)）、梯度层面（需 (H1)–(H4)）、参数化层面（需第 3 节线性关系）。目标值相差常数不蕴含梯度相等，第 10 节的反例将说明缺失 (H2) 时梯度等价失效；本节的一维高斯例子与代码验证了前两层在满足假设时的自洽性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重序列的变分来源\">权重序列的变分来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重序列的变分来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 当作给定序列处理，并验证了在常见参数化下它与 ELBO 的 KL 系数一致。本节需要补足的是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 并非人为选定的超参数，而是由前向核的方差调度唯一确定的量；改变参数化会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式，但不会改变“目标值差常数、梯度相等”的结构。这一点必须在符号层面固定下来，否则统一形式会被误读为“任意权重都给出同一个 ELBO”。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（调度诱导的权重）</strong>：设前向核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，并设变分后验在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时取同一族的高斯形式，其方差参数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。则调度诱导的权重定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 是单步方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span> 是累积信号系数。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}$</span> 只依赖调度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，也不依赖数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>。这与命题 1 中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是同一个对象，本定义只是把它从“命题中的记号”提升为“由调度决定的函数”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（权重的唯一性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4)，且前向核与变分后验均为上述高斯族。<strong>结论</strong>：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C$</span> 的形式且要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}$</span> 是唯一可能的权重。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 1 已把每个时间步的 KL 项写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2+C_t$</span>。第 3 节的恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\|^2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，代入后得分形式前的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}$</span>。若要求该系数等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 被唯一确定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}$</span>。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，则可以把任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖的项吸收进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，权重不再唯一；这正是命题要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的原因。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：统一形式中的权重不是自由参数，而是调度与参数化的函数。工程上常见的“对时间步加权”若偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}$</span>，得到的就不再是 ELBO 的目标值，而是另一个泛函；它与 ELBO 的梯度是否相等需要另行验证，不能由命题 3 直接推出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-方差项在统一形式中的位置\">方差项在统一形式中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-方差项在统一形式中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 含因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，这一因子常被误认为可以并入常数。本节需要说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 出现在权重里而非常数里，是因为它乘在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 相关的平方误差上，而不是加在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的项上。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（方差项的不可吸收性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，命题 4 的设定。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 不能从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 中移出并并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，除非同时改变被积函数的形式；具体地，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>（即去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\tilde w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 之差依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\sum_t\\tilde w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\sum_t(\\tilde w_t-w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}})\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span>。系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_t-w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\left(1-\\dfrac1{\\sigma_t^2}\\right)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ne1$</span> 时该系数非零，且被乘的期望含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故差值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，不能并入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 5 排除了一个常见错误：把方差参数当作常数吸收掉。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 的常见参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 确实存在且不可省略。这与 canonical claim 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式逐字一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的结构与可加性\">常数项的结构与可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的结构与可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，未给出其结构。本节补足常数项的分解，以便在数值验证中区分“目标值差”与“梯度差”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（常数项分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)、(H4)。<strong>结论</strong>：命题 1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C_{\\mathrm{ent}}+C_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{ent}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 只依赖边缘分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{cond}}=-\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span> 只依赖前向核与数据分布，二者均与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 与边缘得分匹配之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span>。把命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_w+C$</span> 与命题 2 的恒等式联立，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2+(C-\\sum_t w_tD_t)$</span>。另一方面，前序第 4 节已把 ELBO 的常数项写成边缘得分平方期望的加权和加一个与前向核有关的项。比较两式即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C_{\\mathrm{ent}}+C_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{cond}}=-\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{ent}}$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{\\mathrm{cond}}$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，均不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 6 的作用是：在数值验证中，<code>diffs</code> 的样本估计应稳定在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 附近，其波动来自蒙特卡洛误差而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖。若 <code>diffs</code> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 系统漂移，则说明代码中的权重或参数化与命题 1 的设定不一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-参数化改变下的结构不变性\">参数化改变下的结构不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-参数化改变下的结构不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的三层区分中，第三层说“改变参数化会改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式，但不改变结构”。本节给出一个具体对照：直接参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测时，权重表达式如何变化，而“目标值差常数、梯度相等”如何保持。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测参数化）</strong>：设网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，并通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_\\theta=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon_\\theta)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与噪声预测联系。得分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化下的权重）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，命题 4 的设定。<strong>结论</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t \\omega_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\hat x_\\theta(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2+C'',$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C''$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测与得分的线性关系，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}\\|\\hat x_\\theta-x_0\\|^2$</span>（利用条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\dfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span> 的恒等变形）。代入命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span>，得分形式前的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 乘以该系数即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_t$</span>。常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C''$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与线性变换的常数部分合并得到，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 7 说明：权重表达式随参数化改变（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\omega_t$</span>），但“目标值差常数”的结构保持。梯度等价同样保持，因为线性变换不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 的作用对象，只改变系数。这与前一小节第三层的陈述一致：结构不变，表达式变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与连续时间极限的衔接\">与连续时间极限的衔接<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与连续时间极限的衔接\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序第 7 节已建立连续时间极限，本节需要说明统一形式在该极限下如何退化，以免读者误以为离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在连续时间中消失。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（连续时间下的权重密度）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1)–(H4)，调度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=O(\\Delta t)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=O(1/\\Delta t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。<strong>结论</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 \\rho(t)\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\,\\mathrm dt$</span>，其中权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)=\\dfrac{\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\bar\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的导数），收敛由 Dominated Convergence 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=O(\\Delta t)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\alpha_t\\to\\dot{\\bar\\alpha}_t^2/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的逐点极限可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的可微性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span> 的展开得到。被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 由 (H1) 可积，且权重系数在紧区间上一致有界，故 Riemann 和的极限与积分交换由 Dominated Convergence 适用。证毕。</p>\n<p>命题 8 的意义是：离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在连续时间极限下变为权重密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(t)$</span>，而非消失。这与前序第 7 节的结论一致，也说明统一形式在离散与连续两种语言下是同一个泛函。第 12 节与 flow matching 的对照将用到这一密度形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-统一形式的适用边界\">统一形式的适用边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-统一形式的适用边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节至此已给出目标值、梯度、参数化、连续时间四个层面的统一。需要明确的是，这些统一不覆盖以下情形，以免被误用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>非高斯前向核</strong>：命题 1 的推导依赖高斯核的线性结构与第 3 节的恒等式。若前向核非高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式不再由命题 4 唯一确定，统一形式需重新推导。</li>\n<li><strong>变分后验非高斯</strong>：命题 4 要求变分后验与前向核同族。若变分后验取其他形式，KL 项不能写成得分平方误差加常数，命题 1 失效。</li>\n<li><strong>权重偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{sch}}$</span></strong>：若工程上使用自定义时间权重，得到的泛函与 ELBO 的目标值不再相差常数，命题 3 的梯度等价不适用。此时需单独验证梯度是否相等，第 10 节的反例即针对此类偏离构造。</li>\n<li><strong>缺失 (H2) 的奇异参数化</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不可微或支配函数不存在，命题 3 的 Leibniz 交换失效，梯度等价可能不成立。第 10 节将给出具体构造。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这四条边界与本节开头的假设纪律一一对应：每条命题的假设缺哪条，就在对应边界处失效。第 10 节的反例集中处理第 3、4 条，本节不展开半成品论证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式\">一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可直接用于数值验证的恒等式，把命题 1、命题 2、命题 6 串起来，供第 9 节的数值验证节引用。</p>\n<p><strong>推论（目标值差的恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：命题 1、命题 2、命题 6 的全部假设。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta')=\\mathcal J_w(\\theta)-\\mathcal J_w(\\theta')=\\sum_t w_t\\left[\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2-\\mathbb E\\|s_{\\theta'}-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal J_w+C$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故两式相减时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 消去。右边按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 的定义展开即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>该推论的价值在于：它把“目标值差常数”转化为“任意两点目标值之差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal J_w$</span> 之差”，从而在数值上可以用两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的差值检验统一形式，而不必估计常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 本身。第 9 节的数值验证将用这一恒等式作为检验量，避免直接估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 带来的蒙特卡洛偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-数值验证\">数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，不引入新的概率对象，仅引入数值验证所需的离散化记号。设数据分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，前向过程为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon,\\qquad \\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度。记条件得分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n以及参数化得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。本章 canonical claim 给出的 ELBO 等价形式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_{t} w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2+C,\n\\qquad\nw_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n本节要验证的是：在给定离散时间网格、给定参数化与给定数值积分方案下，上述恒等式的<strong>逐项</strong>数值一致性，包括权重项、方差项与常数项，并区分“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”两种不同的数值断言。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto \\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 关于联合测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 可测，且二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的二阶矩有限：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty,\\qquad\n\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n该条件在数值验证中由有限维高斯参数化与有限样本 Monte Carlo 估计自动满足（样本数有限、参数有限）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 时间权重的非负性与有限性。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>。该条件保证加权和在数值上不发散，且权重可逐项比较。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 数值积分的可交换性。</strong> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个独立同分布样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(x_0^{(i)},\\epsilon^{(i)})\\}_{i=1}^N$</span> 构造 Monte Carlo 估计\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t^{(i)},t)+\\frac{\\epsilon^{(i)}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n由大数定律（独立同分布、二阶矩有限，即 (A1)），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N\\to\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-C$</span> 几乎必然；有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下逐项比较时，误差项由 Chebyshev 不等式控制，其阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，本节只做逐项恒等式的数值核对，不做统计推断。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 参数化的显式形式。</strong> 采用噪声预测参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，并令\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n该式是前序“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节已证的恒等式，本节直接引用，不再重证。</p>\n<p>在上述假设下，本节给出三个可数值核对的命题：权重恒等式、逐项分解恒等式、以及梯度与目标值的区分命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重恒等式的数值核对\">权重恒等式的数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重恒等式的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（权重恒等式）。</strong> 在 (A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，canonical claim 中的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\n=\\frac{1-\\alpha_t}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n且当采用常见参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设。</strong> (A2)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2=(1-\\alpha_t)^2$</span> 并约去一个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha_t=\\beta_t$</span>，得第一式。第二式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 时约去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。两式均为有限正数，逐项可计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值核对。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=(0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，按上式逐项计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，并与 canonical claim 的原式逐项比较，二者应在浮点误差内相等。该核对在代码节以 <code>assert</code> 形式给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-逐项分解恒等式\">逐项分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-逐项分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（逐项分解）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t=\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-C=\\sum_t w_t D_t,$$</div>\n且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 可分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t=\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2\n-2\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\langle s_\\theta(x_t,t),\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\rangle\n+\\mathbb E\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n右端第三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，是逐时间步的常数项；第二项是交叉项；第一项是参数化得分的二阶矩。</p>\n<p><strong>假设。</strong> (A1) 保证三项期望均有限；(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 的替换合法。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 展开平方范数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\right\\|^2\n=\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-2\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t,x_0)$</span> 取期望，由 (A1) 三项均可积，故期望可逐项分配（有限和，无需交换极限）。求和并乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（常数项的显式形式）。</strong> 在命题 2 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 仅出现在前两项，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2$$</div>\n在“目标值相等”意义下可并入常数，但在“梯度相等”意义下必须单独核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span> 恒成立，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_t$</span> 的前两项非零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 中第一、二项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，其梯度为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta D_t\n=2\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\right\\rangle\n-2\\,\\mathbb E\\left\\langle \\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\right\\rangle,$$</div>\n一般不为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该推论是本节“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”的精确表述：常数项对目标值的贡献是平移，对梯度的贡献为零；但交叉项与二阶矩项的梯度并不因常数项的并入而消失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的逐项数值核对\">具体例子：一维高斯下的逐项数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的逐项数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，前向过程参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 给定，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,1-\\bar\\alpha_t),$$</div>\n条件得分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n设参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta x_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\theta x_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 可闭式计算。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2=\\frac{\\theta^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E x_t^2\n=\\frac{\\theta^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=\\frac{\\theta^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle\n=-\\frac{\\theta}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\left[x_t\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right].$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\epsilon]=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle\n=-\\frac{\\theta}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=-\\frac{\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n第三项\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\epsilon^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t=\\frac{\\theta^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{2\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 时取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q$</span> 的精确匹配。数值上，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本估计三项，应与上述闭式解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span> 内一致。该例同时说明：常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化，若在数值对照中忽略它，逐项比较会出现系统性偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-目标值相等与梯度相等的数值区分\">目标值相等与梯度相等的数值区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-目标值相等与梯度相等的数值区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（目标值与梯度的分离）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\big|_{\\theta^\\star}=0,\n\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\left(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-C\\right)\\big|_{\\theta^\\star}=0.$$</div>\n但反之不成立：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta^\\star)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)\\ne0$</span>。完整构造见本章第 10 节（反例节），本节只给出数值验证的判据。</p>\n<p><strong>假设。</strong> (A1)–(A4)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 的存在性由参数化类包含真实得分保证（本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 依赖，故需按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 分别参数化；若共享参数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 只在单时间步上精确）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star}=\\nabla\\log q$</span> 几乎必然，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta D_t|_{\\theta^\\star}=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t\\ge0$</span> 且取零）。常数项梯度为零，故两式成立。反向断言不在本节证明，按纪律移交第 10 节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>数值判据。</strong> 在代码节中，对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta^\\star)$</span> 的差，若差在浮点容差内为零，<strong>不得</strong>据此断言梯度相等；必须另行计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 并与零比较。该区分是本节数值验证的核心纪律。</p>\n<p>上述代码逐项核对命题 1、命题 2 与一维闭式解，并以显式断言区分“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”：<code>L_theta</code> 与 <code>L_star</code> 的差非零，说明目标值判据不能替代梯度判据；梯度相等需在第 10 节的反例构造后另行验证。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 (A1)–(A4) 下，权重恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))=\\beta_t/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>）逐项成立，数值上可在浮点容差内核对。</li>\n<li>逐项分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-C=\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 的二阶矩项、交叉项与常数项均可独立数值估计；一维高斯例子给出闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t=(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，可作为代码断言的基准。</li>\n<li>常数项对目标值是平移、对梯度贡献为零，但交叉项与二阶矩项的梯度非零；因此“目标值相等”的数值核对不蕴含“梯度相等”，后者须按命题 3 的判据单独验证，完整反例移交本章第 10 节。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-有限样本下的逐项误差控制\">有限样本下的逐项误差控制<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-有限样本下的逐项误差控制\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节的数值核对依赖 Monte Carlo 估计，必须显式给出有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 下逐项误差的界，否则“数值一致”只是经验断言而非可检验命题。本小节在 (A1)–(A4) 之外追加一条假设并给出误差阶。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 四阶矩有限。</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t,x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^4&lt;\\infty.$$</div>\n在一维高斯例子中该条件显然成立：被积量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的线性函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 为标准高斯，四阶矩有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（逐项误差界）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A5) 下，记单样本残差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_t^{(i)}=\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t^{(i)},t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t^{(i)}\\mid x_0^{(i)})\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}=\\frac1N\\sum_{i=1}^N r_t^{(i)}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\left(\\widehat D_t^{(N)}-D_t\\right)^2=\\frac{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)}{N},$$</div>\n且由 Chebyshev 不等式，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P\\left(\\left|\\widehat D_t^{(N)}-D_t\\right|\\ge\\delta\\right)\\le\\frac{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)}{N\\delta^2}.$$</div>\n因此逐项核对的容差应取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)/N}\\cdot\\kappa$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 为置信倍数；在代码节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rtol}=10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2\\times10^5$</span> 时，该容差对一维例子是充分的。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 样本独立同分布，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 的无偏估计，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)/N$</span>。Chebyshev 不等式直接给出尾概率界。四阶矩条件 (A5) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)&lt;\\infty$</span>，否则方差界无意义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的要点是：逐项核对不是“看起来接近”，而是有显式误差阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时容差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1/2}$</span> 收缩。若在代码中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^5$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^3$</span>，则容差应放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{100}=10$</span> 倍，否则断言会因统计涨落而失败——这不是公式错误，而是误差界未被尊重。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重项的敏感性分析\">权重项的敏感性分析<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重项的敏感性分析\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 中权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 同时含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 四个量，数值核对时必须区分“公式抄写错误”与“参数化约定差异”。本小节给出一个可检验的恒等式，把权重对参数的依赖显式化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（权重的对数导数）。</strong> 在 (A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\log w_t}{\\partial\\log\\beta_t}\n=1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\partial\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\bar\\alpha_t/\\partial\\beta_t=-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\alpha_t$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\log w_t}{\\partial\\log\\beta_t}\n=1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n该式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 时发散，说明小噪声极限下权重对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的敏感度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，而大噪声极限下权重对参数误差极度敏感。数值上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 的相对误差，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时的相对误差可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}\\cdot|\\partial\\log w_t/\\partial\\log\\beta_t|$</span>，后者可能远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log w_t=\\log\\beta_t-\\log2-\\log\\alpha_t-\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 逐项求导，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log\\alpha_t/\\partial\\log\\beta_t=-\\beta_t/\\alpha_t$</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\partial\\log\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t/(\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>，相加即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值用途是：在代码节核对权重时，应同时打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\log w_t/\\partial\\log\\beta_t$</span>，以判断断言容差是否与参数敏感度匹配。若敏感度远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rtol}=10^{-2}$</span> 的断言可能过松或过紧，须按敏感度调整。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-常数项的两种角色\">常数项的两种角色<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-常数项的两种角色\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节已指出常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 对目标值是平移、对梯度贡献为零。本小节把这一区分写成两个可分别数值核对的恒等式，避免把“目标值相等”误读为“梯度相等”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（常数项的分解）。</strong> 在命题 2 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$C=\\sum_t w_t\\,C_t,\\qquad C_t=\\mathbb E\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n则对任意参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta D_t,\n\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta C=0.$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故在数值上可用不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的样本单独估计，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 的估计相互独立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t D_t+C$</span>，逐项求梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 故梯度为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 的被积量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故其 Monte Carlo 估计与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的取值无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值含义是：若在代码中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 并入目标值再比较两个不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的目标值，差值中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 自动抵消，故“目标值差”只反映 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t(D_t(\\theta)-D_t(\\theta'))$</span>；但若比较梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的梯度恒为零，不能解释任何梯度差异。因此“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”是两个独立的数值断言，必须分别用不同的估计量核对：前者用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N$</span>，后者用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span> 的有限差分或解析梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度核对的有限差分方案\">梯度核对的有限差分方案<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度核对的有限差分方案\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 要求区分目标值与梯度，但代码节目前只核对了目标值。本小节补足梯度核对的数值方案，使“梯度相等”成为可检验断言而非口头声明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（有限差分梯度估计的误差阶）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A5) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为标量参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta)$</span> 二次连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{|\\theta-\\theta_0|\\le h}|D_t'''(\\theta)|\\le M_t$</span>。则中心差分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$G_t^{(h)}(\\theta_0)=\\frac{D_t(\\theta_0+h)-D_t(\\theta_0-h)}{2h}$$</div>\n满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|G_t^{(h)}(\\theta_0)-D_t'(\\theta_0)\\right|\\le\\frac{M_t h^2}{6}.$$</div>\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本估计，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat G_t^{(h)}$</span> 的统计误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((Nh)^{-1/2})$</span>，总误差为截断误差与统计误差之和，最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\sim N^{-1/6}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 Taylor 展开，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t(\\theta_0\\pm h)=D_t(\\theta_0)\\pm hD_t'(\\theta_0)+\\frac{h^2}{2}D_t''(\\theta_0)\\pm\\frac{h^3}{6}D_t'''(\\xi_\\pm),$$</div>\n相减得中心差分与真梯度之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(h^2/6)(D_t'''(\\xi_+)-D_t'''(\\xi_-))/2$</span>，取上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t h^2/6$</span>。统计误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t$</span> 的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/N)$</span> 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2h)^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/(Nh^2))$</span>，其平方根为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((Nh)^{-1/2})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>在一维高斯例子中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta)=(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，其三阶导数为零，故截断误差为零，有限差分精确等于解析梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。数值上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=10^{-3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2\\times10^5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat G_t^{(h)}$</span> 应与解析梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O((Nh)^{-1/2})\\approx 7\\times10^{-2}$</span> 内一致。该核对在代码节以 <code>assert</code> 形式给出，与目标值核对并列，从而把“梯度相等”从声明变为可检验命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-时间权重逐项验证的可加性\">时间权重逐项验证的可加性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-时间权重逐项验证的可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 的求和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t D_t$</span> 在数值上要求逐项可加，即不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的估计量互不干扰。本小节说明这一可加性为何成立，以及它在代码中的实现方式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（逐项可加性）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 独立抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\left(\\sum_t w_t\\widehat D_t^{(N)}-\\sum_t w_tD_t\\right)^2\n=\\sum_t w_t^2\\frac{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)}{N}.$$</div>\n即各时间步的估计误差方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^2$</span> 加权相加，无交叉项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的样本独立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_{t'}^{(N)}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ne t'$</span>）独立，协方差为零。方差的可加性给出上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值含义是：若在代码中对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 复用同一批样本（而非独立抽取），则交叉项不为零，上述方差公式失效，逐项断言的容差不再有理论依据。因此代码节必须为每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 独立抽取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span>，或在同一批样本上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 分别计算但显式声明样本复用带来的相关性——前者是本节采用的做法。</p>\n<p>综上，本小节把数值验证从“逐项核对公式”补足为“逐项核对公式 + 显式误差界 + 梯度独立核对 + 可加性验证”四件事，使本节承诺的“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”成为有误差阶支撑的可检验命题，而非经验观察。完整反例仍按纪律移交本章第 10 节，本节只负责把可数值核对的恒等式与误差界写全。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-加权求和的方差-偏差分解\">加权求和的方差-偏差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-加权求和的方差-偏差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 8 给出了逐项可加性的方差部分，但数值核对中更常用的是总误差的偏差-方差分解。本小节把这一分解显式写出，使代码节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N$</span> 的断言有完整的误差预算。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（总误差的偏差-方差分解）。</strong> 在 (A1)–(A5) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N=\\sum_t w_t\\widehat D_t^{(N)},\\qquad\n\\mathcal L^\\ast=\\sum_t w_tD_t,$$</div>\n其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span> 由独立的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 个样本构造。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L^\\ast$</span> 的无偏估计，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{MSE}(\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N)\n=\\operatorname{Var}(\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N)\n=\\sum_t w_t^2\\frac{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)}{N}.$$</div>\n偏差项为零，故总误差完全由方差项控制；若样本复用（同一批样本跨 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算），则偏差仍为零但方差中出现协方差项，命题 8 的等式失效。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由期望的线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\widehat D_t^{(N)}=D_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N=\\mathcal L^\\ast$</span>，偏差为零。方差由命题 8 给出。样本复用时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\widehat D_t^{(N)},\\widehat D_{t'}^{(N)})\\ne0$</span>，方差展开多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sum_{t&lt;t'}w_tw_{t'}\\operatorname{Cov}(\\cdot,\\cdot)$</span> 项，等式不再成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值用途是：代码节对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N$</span> 的容差应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\sqrt{\\operatorname{MSE}}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa$</span> 为置信倍数。若把容差写成与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 无关的常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 增大时断言过松；若写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1}$</span>，则断言过紧。正确阶是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N^{-1/2}$</span>，与命题 4 的逐项界一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重敏感度与断言容差的匹配\">权重敏感度与断言容差的匹配<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重敏感度与断言容差的匹配\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的对数导数，但未说明它如何影响代码中的断言容差。本小节把敏感度与容差的关系写成可检验的不等式，避免“公式对但断言因参数扰动而失败”的误判。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（权重扰动的相对误差界）。</strong> 在 (A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 有相对扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1+\\delta_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta_t|\\ll1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的相对扰动满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\frac{\\tilde w_t-w_t}{w_t}\\right|\n\\le\\left|1-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\right||\\delta_t|+O(\\delta_t^2).$$</div>\n右端系数即命题 5 的对数导数绝对值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 时该系数发散，故大噪声步的权重断言容差必须按该系数放大，否则参数扰动会被误判为公式错误。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w_t/w_t=\\exp(\\log\\tilde w_t-\\log w_t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 处一阶 Taylor 展开，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\tilde w_t-\\log w_t=(\\partial\\log w_t/\\partial\\log\\beta_t)\\log(1+\\delta_t)$</span>。取绝对值并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(1+\\delta_t)|\\le|\\delta_t|+O(\\delta_t^2)$</span>，得所述界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值上，代码节应在打印 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的同时打印该系数，若系数大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{rtol}=10^{-2}$</span> 的断言对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 扰动已不稳健，须把容差改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}\\cdot\\text{系数}$</span> 或改用解析式直接比较而不经浮点扰动。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一维例子的梯度核对与目标值核对的独立性\">一维例子的梯度核对与目标值核对的独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一维例子的梯度核对与目标值核对的独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7 给出了有限差分方案，但未说明它与目标值核对在数值上为何必须分开执行。本小节用一个显式恒等式说明二者不可互相替代。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（目标值差与梯度差的独立性）。</strong> 在一维高斯例子中，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\eta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\ne0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_t(\\theta_0)-D_t(\\theta^\\star)=\\frac{\\eta^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}&gt;0,\n\\qquad\nD_t'(\\theta_0)=\\frac{2\\eta}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ne0.$$</div>\n二者同号但量纲不同：目标值差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的二阶量，梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的一阶量。因此“目标值差很小”不能推出“梯度很小”：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=10^{-2}$</span> 时，目标值差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，而梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\times10^{-2}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，后者相对前者大两个数量级。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta)=(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta_0)=\\eta^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t(\\theta^\\star)=0$</span>，相减得第一式；求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t'(\\theta)=2(\\theta+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_0$</span> 处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\eta/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题的数值含义是：代码节若只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N(\\theta_0)-\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N(\\theta^\\star)|&lt;\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2$</span> 量级选取；若同时断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\widehat G_t^{(h)}(\\theta_0)|&lt;\\varepsilon'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'$</span> 必须按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 量级选取。二者容差不同阶，混用会导致其中一个断言必然失败或过松。这正是“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”在数值容差层面的具体表现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-代码节的断言结构\">代码节的断言结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-代码节的断言结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合命题 4、7、8、9、10、11，代码节的断言应分四组，每组对应一个命题，且容差按各自的误差阶选取：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>权重恒等式组</strong>（命题 1、5、10）：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的两种写法，容差取浮点精度；打印敏感度系数，若大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 则另设参数扰动断言。</li>\n<li><strong>逐项分解组</strong>（命题 2、4）：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat D_t^{(N)}$</span> 与闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_t$</span>，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)/N}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2\\times10^5$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度独立组</strong>（命题 3、7、11）：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat G_t^{(h)}$</span> 与解析梯度，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_th^2/6+\\kappa\\sqrt{\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)/(Nh^2)}$</span>；一维例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span>，容差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7\\times10^{-2}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>可加性组</strong>（命题 8、9）：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\widehat{\\mathcal L}_N$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_tD_t$</span>，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa\\sqrt{\\sum_t w_t^2\\operatorname{Var}(r_t)/N}$</span>；若样本复用则须显式声明协方差项，否则该组断言无理论依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>四组断言的容差阶分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O((Nh)^{-1/2})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(N^{-1/2})$</span>，不可互相替代。代码节按此结构组织，即把本节所有可数值核对的恒等式与误差界落实为可运行、带 <code>assert</code>、打印形状与预期结果的检验，而非仅核对目标值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-反例-目标值相等但梯度不等\">反例：目标值相等但梯度不等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-目标值相等但梯度不等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号，并只引入下列新记号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为干净样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 有紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span> 且密度关于 Lebesgue 测度存在。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}\\subset(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（前序节的标准参数化）。</li>\n<li>前向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\mu_t(x_0),v_t I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)=\\int q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)\\,dx_0$</span> 为边缘密度，并假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 成立（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 紧支撑与高斯核的正性可得）。</li>\n<li>记条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\dfrac{x_t-\\mu_t(x_0)}{v_t}$</span>。</li>\n<li>ELBO 目标（前序节已建立的形式）：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T} w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2+C,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。\n- 记逐时间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\ell_t(\\theta)+C$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，逐条显式列出并在反例中逐条拆解。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)\\mapsto\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可积，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 参数正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^p$</span> 中开集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 连续可微，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>-可积的支配函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x_0,x_t)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g_t(x_0,x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 一致成立。此条用于 Leibniz 积分求导。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 时间权重非退化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 参数化非冗余</strong>：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto (s_\\theta(\\cdot,1),\\dots,s_\\theta(\\cdot,T))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q_t)$</span> 意义下是单射（即不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 给出不同的得分函数族）。若参数化冗余，梯度可能沿零方向退化，此时“梯度不等”需在商空间意义下陈述。</p>\n<p>以下反例在 (A1)–(A3) 下构造；(A4) 在反例 2 中被拆掉。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-1-目标值相等但梯度不等的显式构造\">反例 1：目标值相等但梯度不等的显式构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-1-目标值相等但梯度不等的显式构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（目标值相等而梯度不等）</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>、参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与两个参数点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2\\in\\Theta$</span>，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2),\\qquad \\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_{0}$</span> 退化为点质量（此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal N(0,v_t)$</span>，条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-x_t/v_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal N(0,v_t)$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t}{v_t}.$$</div>\n<p>定义参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta\\,\\phi_t(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为固定函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。取</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\phi_1(x)=x,\\qquad \\phi_2(x)=x^2-1.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1=\\mathcal N(0,v_1)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x^2]=v_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x^4]=3v_1^2$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2=\\mathcal N(0,v_2)$</span> 下同理。</p>\n<p>逐项计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_1(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q_1}\\left\\|\\theta x+\\frac{x}{v_1}\\right\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\left[\\left(\\theta+\\frac{1}{v_1}\\right)^2x^2\\right]\n=\\left(\\theta+\\frac{1}{v_1}\\right)^2v_1.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_2(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q_2}\\left\\|\\theta(x^2-1)+\\frac{x}{v_2}\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_2(\\theta)=\\theta^2\\mathbb E[(x^2-1)^2]+\\frac{2\\theta}{v_2}\\mathbb E[x(x^2-1)]+\\frac{1}{v_2^2}\\mathbb E[x^2].$$</div>\n<p>由高斯矩：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(x^2-1)^2]=\\mathbb E[x^4]-2\\mathbb E[x^2]+1=3v_2^2-2v_2+1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x(x^2-1)]=\\mathbb E[x^3]-\\mathbb E[x]=0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x^2]=v_2$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_2(\\theta)=\\theta^2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)+\\frac{1}{v_2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=w_1\\left(\\theta+\\frac{1}{v_1}\\right)^2v_1+w_2\\left[\\theta^2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)+\\frac{1}{v_2}\\right]+C.$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的二次函数，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\theta^2+B\\theta+D$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1),\\quad B=2w_1,\\quad D=w_1\\frac{1}{v_1}+w_2\\frac{1}{v_2}+C.$$</div>\n<p>其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2A\\theta+B$</span>，是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的仿射函数。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=-\\dfrac{B}{2A}+r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2=-\\dfrac{B}{2A}-r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)=A\\left[\\left(-\\frac{B}{2A}+r\\right)^2-\\left(-\\frac{B}{2A}-r\\right)^2\\right]=A\\cdot\\frac{2Br}{A}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}=2Br\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}.$$</div>\n<p>直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1^2-\\theta_2^2=\\left(-\\frac{B}{2A}+r\\right)^2-\\left(-\\frac{B}{2A}-r\\right)^2=-\\frac{2Br}{A}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B(\\theta_1-\\theta_2)=B\\cdot 2r$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)=A\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{2Br}{A}\\right)+B\\cdot 2r=0.$$</div>\n<p>目标值相等。但梯度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=2A\\left(-\\frac{B}{2A}+r\\right)+B=2Ar,\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)=-2Ar,$$</div>\n<p>二者不等（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span>）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：目标值相等仅说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 位于同一等值面；梯度是等值面的法向，等值面上不同点的法向一般不同。本例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是严格凸二次函数，等值面为两点对称分布于极小点两侧，梯度互为相反数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-2-拆掉-A4-后-梯度不等-失效\">反例 2：拆掉 (A4) 后“梯度不等”失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-2-拆掉-A4-后-梯度不等-失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（参数冗余导致梯度退化）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=s_{\\theta'}(x,t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 成立但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\neq\\theta'$</span>（参数化非单射），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta')=0$</span> 可能同时成立，此时“梯度不等”不成立，需在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta/\\!\\sim$</span> 上陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3) 成立，(A4) 不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,1)=(\\theta_1+\\theta_2)x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)\\in\\mathbb R^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1+\\theta_2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast=(-1/v_1,-1/v_1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\ast}(x,1)=-x/v_1=\\nabla\\log q(x\\mid x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta^\\ast)=C$</span> 为全局最小。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1+\\theta_2=-2/v_1$</span>，均有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=C$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=(-1/v_1+r,-1/v_1-r)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2=(-1/v_1-r,-1/v_1+r)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>。二者目标值相等且均为最小值，梯度均为零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2w_1v_1(\\theta_1+\\theta_2+2/v_1)\\,(1,1)^{\\top}=0.$$</div>\n<p>故“梯度不等”不成立。正确表述需在商空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta/\\!\\sim$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\sim\\theta'$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=s_{\\theta'}$</span>）上陈述，或补 (A4)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-3-拆掉-A2-后-Leibniz-求导失效\">反例 3：拆掉 (A2) 后 Leibniz 求导失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-3-拆掉-A2-后-Leibniz-求导失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（支配条件缺失导致梯度不可交换）</strong>：若 (A2) 中支配函数不存在，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)\\neq\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\cdot\\|^2]$</span>，目标值相等不能推出梯度关系。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3) 成立，(A2) 不成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta\\,\\psi(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi(x)=x^{-1/2}\\mathbf 1_{x&gt;0}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\notin L^2(q)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta=\\psi$</span> 无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-可积支配函数。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta)=\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，目标值恒等（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>），但形式梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\cdot\\|^2]$</span> 不存在。这说明：目标值相等（同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\infty$</span>）不蕴含梯度相等，且 (A2) 缺失时梯度甚至无定义。正确表述需补 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi\\in L^2(q)$</span> 与支配条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-定量估计-等值面附近的梯度差\">定量估计：等值面附近的梯度差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-定量估计-等值面附近的梯度差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（梯度差的定量下界）</strong>：在命题 1 的设定下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1\\neq\\theta_2$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)\\right\\|=2A\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2A\\theta+B$</span> 直接得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此估计表明：梯度差与参数距离成正比，比例常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 由时间权重与高斯矩决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to 0$</span>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 很大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可能退化，梯度差趋于零，此时“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”的区分在数值上变得微弱——这是边界情形，需在加权 ELBO 节中另行处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-正确表述所需补充的条件\">正确表述所需补充的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-正确表述所需补充的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由命题 1–4，正确表述“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 梯度相等”需要以下补充条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>严格凸性 + 唯一极小点</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上严格凸且极小点唯一，则等值面为同心球面，同一等值面上不同点的梯度方向不同但范数相同；梯度相等仅在同一点成立。故“目标值相等”仍不推出“梯度相等”，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=\\theta_2$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>等值面退化为点</strong>：仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 为常数函数时，梯度恒为零，此时目标值相等与梯度相等同时成立。这对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 已精确匹配条件得分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），是平凡情形。</li>\n<li><strong>商空间陈述</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta/\\!\\sim$</span> 上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 诱导的目标在商空间上严格凸，则等值面仍非退化，结论不变。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>因此，本章 canonical claim “目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\neq$</span> 梯度相同（需逐项验证）”在本节得到严格支持：逐项验证指对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 的梯度，而非仅比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\ell_t(\\theta)+C$</span> 的数值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-数值验证代码\">数值验证代码<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-数值验证代码\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span> 下复现命题 1 的构造，验证目标值相等而梯度不等，并检查命题 4 的定量估计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\n# 参数\nv1, v2 = 0.3, 0.7          # 1 - alpha_bar_t\nw1, w2 = 0.5, 0.8          # 时间权重（任意正数即可）\nC = 1.0\n\n# 目标函数系数（命题 1）\nA = w1 * v1 + w2 * (3 * v2**2 - 2 * v2 + 1)\nB = 2 * w1\nD = w1 / v1 + w2 / v2 + C\n\ndef L(theta):\n    return A * theta**2 + B * theta + D\n\ndef gradL(theta):\n    return 2 * A * theta + B\n\n# 取对称点\ntheta_star = -B / (2 * A)\nr = 0.4\ntheta1 = theta_star + r\ntheta2 = theta_star - r\n\n# 验证目标值相等\nassert np.isclose(L(theta1), L(theta2)), &quot;目标值应相等&quot;\n# 验证梯度不等\nassert not np.isclose(gradL(theta1), gradL(theta2)), &quot;梯度应不等&quot;\n# 验证定量估计\nassert np.isclose(abs(gradL(theta1) - gradL(theta2)), 2 * A * abs(theta1 - theta2))\n\nprint(&quot;A, B, D =&quot;, A, B, D)\nprint(&quot;theta1, theta2 =&quot;, theta1, theta2)\nprint(&quot;L(theta1), L(theta2) =&quot;, L(theta1), L(theta2))\nprint(&quot;gradL(theta1), gradL(theta2) =&quot;, gradL(theta1), gradL(theta2))\nprint(&quot;|grad diff| =&quot;, abs(gradL(theta1) - gradL(theta2)))\nprint(&quot;2A|theta diff| =&quot;, 2 * A * abs(theta1 - theta2))\nprint(&quot;形状检查: theta1 标量 =&quot;, np.shape(theta1))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>L(theta1) == L(theta2)</code>，<code>gradL(theta1) != gradL(theta2)</code>，且 <code>|grad diff| == 2A|theta diff|</code>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-4-逐时间项梯度不等而加权和梯度相等\">反例 4：逐时间项梯度不等而加权和梯度相等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-4-逐时间项梯度不等而加权和梯度相等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前三个反例说明“总目标值相等”不蕴含“总梯度相等”。本节还需拆解更细的命题：即便总梯度相等，逐时间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 的梯度仍可能不等。这正是 canonical claim 中“需逐项验证”的精确含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（逐项梯度不等而加权和梯度相等）</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>、参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与参数点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span>，使得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2),\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_1)\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_2),$$</div>\n<p>但</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_1\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)+w_2\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_1)\n=w_1\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)+w_2\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_2).$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta\\,\\phi_t(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x)=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_2(x)=x^2-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：沿用命题 1 的记号。逐时间项的梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta)=2v_1\\left(\\theta+\\frac{1}{v_1}\\right),\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta)=2\\theta(3v_2^2-2v_2+1).$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\theta_1+\\frac{1}{v_1}=\\frac{1}{v_1}-\\theta_2\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad \\theta_1+\\theta_2=-\\frac{2}{v_1}.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)=2v_1(\\theta_1+1/v_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)=2v_1(\\theta_2+1/v_1)=2v_1(-\\theta_1-2/v_1+1/v_1)=-2v_1(\\theta_1+1/v_1)$</span>，二者互为相反数，不等（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=-1/v_1$</span>）。同理，若再要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=-\\theta_2$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=-\\theta_2=-1/v_1$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_1)=-\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_2)$</span>，二者不等（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>现取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=r-1/v_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2=-r-1/v_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1+\\theta_2=-2/v_1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1\\neq\\theta_2$</span>。逐项梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)=2v_1 r,\\qquad \\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)=-2v_1 r,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_1)=2(r-1/v_1)(3v_2^2-2v_2+1),\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_2)=-2(r+1/v_1)(3v_2^2-2v_2+1).$$</div>\n<p>二者均不等。加权和梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_1\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)+w_2\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_1)\n=2w_1v_1 r+2w_2(r-1/v_1)(3v_2^2-2v_2+1),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_1\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)+w_2\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2(\\theta_2)\n=-2w_1v_1 r-2w_2(r+1/v_1)(3v_2^2-2v_2+1).$$</div>\n<p>令二者相等，得到关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 的方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$4w_1v_1 r+2w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)\\left[(r-1/v_1)+(r+1/v_1)\\right]=0,$$</div>\n<p>即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$4w_1v_1 r+4w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)r=0\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nr\\left[w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)\\right]=0.$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)&gt;0$</span>，故仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0$</span> 时加权和梯度相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=\\theta_2$</span>，退化。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span> 时加权和梯度不等——这与命题 5 的陈述相反。</p>\n<p><strong>修正陈述</strong>：命题 5 的原始陈述不成立；正确陈述应为“逐项梯度不等，加权和梯度也不等，但加权和梯度之差与逐项梯度之差的比例由权重决定”。这说明逐项验证不可省略：若仅检查加权和，会遗漏逐项梯度方向的信息；若仅检查逐项，会误判加权和。正确的逐项验证需同时检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：命题 5 的原始形式被否定，这本身是一个边界情形：它表明“逐项梯度不等”与“加权和梯度不等”是两个独立命题，前者不蕴含后者，后者也不蕴含前者。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span> 的对称构造下，逐项梯度差与加权和梯度差通过权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 线性组合，组合系数非零时二者同号不等，组合系数为零时二者同时退化。这为加权 ELBO 节的权重设计提供了约束：权重不能使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-5-非高斯数据分布下的条件得分依赖\">反例 5：非高斯数据分布下的条件得分依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-5-非高斯数据分布下的条件得分依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前四个反例均取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>，使条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 范数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 非退化，条件得分依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 的结构改变，目标值相等与梯度不等的构造需重新验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（非退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下目标值相等仍不蕴含梯度相等）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1\\neq\\theta_2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1=1-\\bar\\alpha_1\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：条件得分</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_1-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0}{v_1}.$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_1\\mid x_0)$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{v_1}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 独立。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\bar\\alpha_1+v_1)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。逐项目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_1(\\theta)=\\mathbb E\\left\\|\\theta x_1+\\frac{x_1-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0}{v_1}\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>展开并利用独立性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1^2]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1 x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0^2]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1\\epsilon]=0$</span>。计算交叉项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\left[\\theta x_1\\cdot\\frac{x_1-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0}{v_1}\\right]\n=\\frac{\\theta}{v_1}\\left(\\mathbb E[x_1^2]-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}\\,\\mathbb E[x_1x_0]\\right)\n=\\frac{\\theta}{v_1}\\left(1-\\bar\\alpha_1\\right)=\\theta.$$</div>\n<p>常数项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\left\\|\\frac{x_1-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0}{v_1}\\right\\|^2\n=\\frac{1}{v_1^2}\\mathbb E\\left[v_1\\epsilon^2\\right]=\\frac{1}{v_1}.$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_1(\\theta)=\\theta^2+2\\theta+\\frac{1}{v_1}=(\\theta+1)^2+\\frac{1}{v_1}-1.$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的严格凸二次函数，极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast=-1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=-1+r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2=-1-r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta_1)=\\ell_1(\\theta_2)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)=2r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)=-2r$</span>，不等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：非退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下条件得分含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\theta x_1\\cdot\\nabla\\log q]$</span> 不再为零，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的线性项。这改变了二次函数的系数，但不改变“等值面对称、梯度反号”的结构。因此命题 1 的结论在非退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 下仍成立，只是系数需重新计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-6-时间权重退化导致梯度差消失\">反例 6：时间权重退化导致梯度差消失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-6-时间权重退化导致梯度差消失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4 指出梯度差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)$</span> 成正比。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\to 0$</span>，梯度差趋于零，此时“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”的区分在数值上退化。这是边界情形，需定量刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（权重退化下的梯度差上界）</strong>：在命题 1 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\le\\epsilon$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)\\right\\|\\le 2\\epsilon\\left[v_1+(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)\\right]\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4，梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=2A\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)\\le\\epsilon[v_1+(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此上界表明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 一致趋于零时，梯度差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 速率退化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 小于数值精度，则“梯度不等”在浮点意义下不可检测，此时“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”的区分需在符号计算或高精度算术下进行。这是加权 ELBO 节需处理的数值稳定性问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-7-连续时间极限下逐项验证的失效\">反例 7：连续时间极限下逐项验证的失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-7-连续时间极限下逐项验证的失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立连续时间极限：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 收敛为连续时间得分匹配目标。在极限下，逐时间项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 的梯度验证需替换为对时间变量的变分导数，逐项验证的离散形式失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（连续极限下逐项梯度验证的替换）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t\\beta_t\\to 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 连续可微。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\int_0^1 w(t)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)\\,dt,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为连续时间权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 为连续时间逐点目标。逐项验证需替换为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的逐点验证：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>，而非对离散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：由前序节的连续时间极限定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 下收敛为积分形式。梯度收敛需 (A2) 的一致支配条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上一致成立，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_0,x_t)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。在此条件下，由 Dominated Convergence 逐项取极限得积分形式。逐项验证的离散求和被积分替换，但“逐点检查”的精神保留：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 需单独验证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：连续极限不改变“目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等”的结论，但改变了验证的操作形式。离散逐项验证需替换为连续逐点验证，且需补 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上的一致支配条件。这是与统一误差理论接口节需衔接的技术点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-8-得分匹配目标与-ELBO-目标的梯度差常数\">反例 8：得分匹配目标与 ELBO 目标的梯度差常数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-8-得分匹配目标与-ELBO-目标的梯度差常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章 canonical claim 的第二部分是“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\neq$</span> 梯度相同”。前七个反例均针对 ELBO 目标本身。现需说明：ELBO 目标与得分匹配目标的差为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，但两目标的梯度关系需逐项验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（ELBO 与 DSM 的梯度关系）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>（无常数项），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+C$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)$$</div>\n<p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(\\theta)$</span>（如变分界紧性节中的情形），则梯度不等，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C(\\theta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+C$</span> 直接求导。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C=0$</span>，梯度相等；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}+\\nabla_\\theta C$</span>，梯度差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关是前序节常数项节已建立的条件。若该条件不成立（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖的变分参数），则 ELBO 与 DSM 的梯度不等，需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的梯度。这解释了 canonical claim 中“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\neq$</span> 梯度相同”的精确含义：差为常数时梯度相同，差非常数时梯度不同，需逐项检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-9-加权-ELBO-下逐项验证的必要性\">反例 9：加权 ELBO 下逐项验证的必要性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-9-加权-ELBO-下逐项验证的必要性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>加权 ELBO 节将引入非均匀权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。在非均匀权重下，逐项梯度验证的必要性更加突出：不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的梯度贡献被不同权重放大或缩小，总梯度相等可能掩盖逐项梯度的大幅不等。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（非均匀权重下逐项梯度差的放大）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\gg w_2$</span>，则在命题 1 的构造下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 使总目标值相等、总梯度相等，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)$</span> 之差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 放大。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta)=2v_1(\\theta+1/v_1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=r-1/v_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_2=-r-1/v_1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1(\\theta_2)=4v_1 r$</span>。加权后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 倍放大。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\gg w_2$</span>，总梯度主要由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项贡献，逐项梯度差在总梯度中占主导。若总梯度相等，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项的梯度差必须被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 项的梯度差抵消，这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_2$</span> 的差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_1$</span> 的差等大反号，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2$</span> 需与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 同量级——与非均匀假设矛盾。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1\\gg w_2$</span> 下，总梯度相等不成立，逐项梯度差被放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：非均匀权重下，总梯度相等与逐项梯度相等的关系更紧密：权重大的项主导总梯度，逐项梯度差难以被其他项抵消。这为加权 ELBO 节的权重设计提供约束：权重需使各项梯度贡献可比，否则逐项验证的必要性被权重结构掩盖。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-10-梯度相等的充分条件\">反例 10：梯度相等的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-10-梯度相等的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前九个反例均否定“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 梯度相等”。现给出梯度相等的充分条件，以界定反例的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（梯度相等的充分条件）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上为常数函数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，目标值相等与梯度相等同时成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：常数函数的梯度恒为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题平凡，但界定了反例的边界：反例 1–9 均要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 非常数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 未精确匹配条件得分。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 已精确匹配（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>），则目标为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，梯度恒零，反例不成立。这是平凡情形，不构成对 canonical claim 的反驳。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12（严格凸 + 唯一极小点下梯度相等的唯一性）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上严格凸且极小点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast$</span> 唯一，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1=\\theta_2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：严格凸函数的梯度映射是单射。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_1)=\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1\\neq\\theta_2$</span>，则由严格凸性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(\\theta_1)&gt;\\mathcal L(\\theta_2)+\\langle\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_2),\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\rangle$</span> 与反向不等式同时成立，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题表明：在严格凸 + 唯一极小点下，梯度相等等价于参数相等，目标值相等仍不蕴含梯度相等（等值面非退化）。反例 1 的二次目标满足严格凸，但极小点唯一，等值面为两点对称，梯度反号，与命题 12 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-11-非凸目标下的多重等值面\">反例 11：非凸目标下的多重等值面<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-11-非凸目标下的多重等值面\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 非凸，等值面可能更复杂，目标值相等与梯度不等的构造更丰富。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13（非凸目标下的等值面与梯度）</strong>：存在非凸 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 使等值面含多个连通分支，不同分支上的点目标值相等但梯度方向不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x)=\\theta x+\\theta^2 x^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta)$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^4$</span> 项，非凸。等值面 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\theta:\\ell_1(\\theta)=c\\}$</span> 对适当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 含两个连通分支，分支上梯度方向不同。具体计算需展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta)$</span> 的四次多项式并求根，此处从略，完整构造见反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：非凸性使等值面拓扑复杂化，但“目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等”的结论不变。非凸目标的梯度验证需逐点进行，不能依赖凸性简化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-12-高维参数空间下的梯度差方向\">反例 12：高维参数空间下的梯度差方向<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-12-高维参数空间下的梯度差方向\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序反例均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 的标量参数下构造。高维参数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;1$</span> 下，梯度差为向量，其方向与范数需分别验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14（高维参数下梯度差的方向与范数）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta_1\\phi_t(x)+\\theta_2\\psi_t(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=(\\theta_1,\\theta_2)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 为二维向量，目标值相等不蕴含梯度向量相等，也不蕴含梯度范数相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_1(x)=x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\psi_1(x)=x^2-1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 的二次型。等值面为椭圆，椭圆上不同点的梯度向量方向不同，范数也可能不同。具体构造需计算二次型的矩阵并取椭圆上两点，此处从略，完整构造见反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：高维参数下，梯度差的验证需分别检查方向与范数。目标值相等仅约束梯度在等值面法向的投影，切向分量不受约束。这是逐项验证在高维下的精确含义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-13-时间权重与梯度差的交互\">反例 13：时间权重与梯度差的交互<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-13-时间权重与梯度差的交互\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 不仅缩放梯度差，还改变等值面的几何形状。不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 组合下，同一参数点的梯度差方向可能改变。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15（权重改变梯度差方向）</strong>：在命题 1 的构造下，改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2$</span> 的比例可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta_2)$</span> 的符号反转。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 4，梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=2A(\\theta_1-\\theta_2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=w_1v_1+w_2(3v_2^2-2v_2+1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3v_2^2-2v_2+1&lt;0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2\\in(1/3,1)$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 可随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1,w_2$</span> 比例改变符号。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_1=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3v_2^2-2v_2+1=3(0.49)-1.4+1=1.47-1.4+1=1.07&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span> 恒成立。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3(0.25)-1+1=0.75&gt;0$</span>，仍正。需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3v_2^2-2v_2+1&lt;0$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2\\in(1/3,1)$</span> 且判别式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4-12=-8&lt;0$</span>，二次式恒正——故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立，符号不反转。命题 15 的原始陈述不成立；正确陈述为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span> 恒成立，梯度差符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1-\\theta_2$</span> 决定，权重仅缩放不反转。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：命题 15 的原始形式被否定，这本身是边界情形：<span class=\"math-inline\">$3v_2^2-2v_2+1$</span> 的判别式为负，恒正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span> 对所有合法 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_2$</span> 成立。权重改变梯度差的范数但不改变方向。这为加权 ELBO 节的权重设计提供约束：权重不能使梯度差方向反转，只能缩放。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-14-数值精度下的梯度差检测\">反例 14：数值精度下的梯度差检测<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-14-数值精度下的梯度差检测\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 7 指出权重退化时梯度差以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span> 退化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 小于浮点精度，梯度差不可检测。现定量刻画检测阈值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16（浮点精度下的梯度差检测阈值）</strong>：设浮点精度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2^{-52}$</span>，目标值量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>。若梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot M$</span>，则浮点比较不可区分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：浮点比较的相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。若梯度差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot M$</span>，则两梯度在浮点表示下可能相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题表明：反例 1 的构造需选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 足够大，使梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2Ar$</span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot M$</span>。数值验证代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\approx 0.5\\cdot 0.3+0.8\\cdot 1.07=0.15+0.856=1.006$</span>，梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx 0.8$</span>，远大于浮点精度，可检测。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-15-逐项验证的算法复杂度\">反例 15：逐项验证的算法复杂度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-15-逐项验证的算法复杂度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐项验证需对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>，复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\cdot p)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很大（如连续时间极限），逐项验证不可行，需用随机采样近似。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 17（逐项验证的采样近似）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{t_i\\}_{i=1}^m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 的均匀采样，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{m}\\sum_i\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_{t_i}(\\theta)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}\\sum_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 的无偏估计，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/m)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：均匀采样的期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{T}\\sum_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>，方差由采样独立性得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/m)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题表明：逐项验证在大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下需采样近似，但采样引入方差，可能掩盖小梯度差。反例 1 的构造在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 下可精确逐项验证，无需采样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-16-与-Fisher-散度的梯度关系\">反例 16：与 Fisher 散度的梯度关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-16-与-Fisher-散度的梯度关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 ELBO 与 Fisher 散度的联系。Fisher 散度的梯度与 ELBO 的梯度关系需逐项验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18（Fisher 散度梯度与 ELBO 梯度的差）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)$</span> 为 Fisher 信息矩阵，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\theta$</span> 的关系需逐项验证，不能仅由目标值相等推出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：Fisher 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_F(q\\|p_\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2}\\theta^{\\top}\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\theta+\\frac{1}{2}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal I(\\theta)\\theta\\theta^{\\top}$</span>。ELBO 梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>。二者相等需逐项匹配，目标值相等不蕴含梯度匹配。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：Fisher 散度的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)$</span> 的导数项，ELBO 梯度不含，二者一般不等。逐项验证需检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I(\\theta)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 依赖性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-17-连续时间极限下的梯度差退化\">反例 17：连续时间极限下的梯度差退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-17-连续时间极限下的梯度差退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>连续时间极限下，逐项梯度差被积分替换，梯度差的退化速率由时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 19（连续极限下梯度差的退化速率）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=O(t(1-t))$</span>（两端退化），则连续极限下梯度差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0,1$</span> 处退化，中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处非退化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：由命题 8，连续极限下梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1 w(t)\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)dt$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=O(t(1-t))$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to 0,1$</span> 时权重趋于零，梯度贡献退化；中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 权重非零，梯度贡献非退化。逐项验证需在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上逐点进行，两端退化处需特殊处理。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：连续极限下逐项验证的退化结构由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 决定，两端退化是常见参数化（如 VP-SDE）的特征。这为加权 ELBO 节的连续时间权重设计提供约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-18-目标值相等但梯度不等的通用构造\">反例 18：目标值相等但梯度不等的通用构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-18-目标值相等但梯度不等的通用构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序反例均为具体构造。现给出通用构造框架，适用于任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 20（通用构造框架）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 上非常数且存在等值面含至少两点，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1\\neq\\theta_2$</span> 使目标值相等但梯度不等，当且仅当等值面在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 处的法向不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_1,\\theta_2$</span> 在同一等值面。梯度为等值面法向。法向不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Leftrightarrow$</span> 梯度不等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题将反例构造归结为等值面几何：等值面非退化且法向变化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 反例存在。命题 1 的二次目标等值面为椭圆，法向随点变化，反例存在。命题 11 的常数目标等值面为全空间，法向恒零，反例不存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-19-逐项验证的充分条件\">反例 19：逐项验证的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-19-逐项验证的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>逐项验证需检查每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为常数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 已精确匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时刻条件得分），则该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项梯度为零，逐项验证退化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 21（逐项验证退化的充分条件）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)=\\nabla\\log q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>-几乎处处），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)=0$</span>，该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项逐项验证退化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 恒为零，梯度恒为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题表明：逐项验证需排除已精确匹配的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项，仅对未匹配项验证。反例 1 的构造中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 未匹配任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，逐项验证非退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-反例-20-与统一误差理论的接口\">反例 20：与统一误差理论的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-反例-20-与统一误差理论的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>统一误差理论节将建立 ELBO、DSM、Fisher 散度的统一误差界。本节反例为该理论提供边界情形：目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，误差界需逐项建立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 22（统一误差界的逐项必要性）</strong>：若统一误差界仅由总目标值差给出，则梯度误差界不成立；需逐项误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta_2)\\|\\le L_t\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span> 才能推出总梯度误差界。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：总目标值差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\epsilon$</span> 仅约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\ell_t$</span> 的差，不约束逐项梯度差。逐项 Lipschitz 条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta_1)-\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta_2)\\|\\le L_t\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span>，加权求和得总梯度误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sum_t w_tL_t\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：统一误差理论需逐项 Lipschitz 条件，不能仅由总目标值差推出。本节反例为该理论提供反例边界：目标值相等但梯度不等，逐项误差界不可省略。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>目标值相等仅意味着参数位于同一等值面；梯度是等值面的法向，等值面上不同点的法向一般不同。命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span> 下给出显式二次目标，对称点目标值相等而梯度互为相反数。</li>\n<li>拆掉 (A2) 会使 Leibniz 求导失效，梯度甚至无定义；拆掉 (A4) 会使参数冗余导致梯度退化，“梯度不等”需在商空间陈述。正确表述需补严格凸性 + 唯一极小点、等值面退化或商空间陈述之一。</li>\n<li>命题 4 给出定量估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_1)-\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_2)\\|=2A\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span>，比例常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 由时间权重与高斯矩决定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to 0$</span> 时梯度差退化，这是加权 ELBO 节需处理的边界情形。</li>\n<li>目标值相等仅意味着参数位于同一等值面；梯度是等值面的法向，等值面上不同点的法向一般不同。命题 1 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_0$</span> 下给出显式二次目标，对称点目标值相等而梯度互为相反数；命题 6 将结论推广到非退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>；命题 20 给出通用构造框架：等值面非退化且法向变化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 反例存在。</li>\n<li>拆掉 (A2) 会使 Leibniz 求导失效，梯度甚至无定义；拆掉 (A4) 会使参数冗余导致梯度退化，“梯度不等”需在商空间陈述。正确表述需补严格凸性 + 唯一极小点、等值面退化或商空间陈述之一。命题 5、15 的原始陈述被否定，表明“逐项梯度不等”与“加权和梯度不等”是两个独立命题，需分别验证。</li>\n<li>命题 4 给出定量估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_1)-\\nabla\\mathcal L(\\theta_2)\\|=2A\\|\\theta_1-\\theta_2\\|$</span>，比例常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 由时间权重与高斯矩决定；命题 7 给出权重退化下的梯度差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon)$</span>；命题 16 给出浮点精度下的检测阈值。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to 0$</span> 时梯度差退化，这是加权 ELBO 节需处理的边界情形；连续时间极限下逐项验证需替换为逐点验证（命题 8、19），并与统一误差理论节的逐项 Lipschitz 条件衔接（命题 22）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-加权-ELBO\">加权 ELBO<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-加权-ELBO\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>（或按具体参数化取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>）；得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>；去噪分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。前序节已建立恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad \\epsilon=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节引入的<strong>新符号</strong>仅有：加权系数族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}_{t=1}^T\\subset(0,\\infty)$</span>；加权 ELBO 泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)$</span>；加权 DSM 泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}(\\theta)$</span>；以及逐时间步的“权重残差” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(\\theta)$</span>。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 均为确定性正常数，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与样本。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>（可积性与可微性）对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可积；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^p$</span> 上局部 Lipschitz，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t\\in L^1(q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0))$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\|\\le g_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span> 一致成立。此假设保证 Leibniz 法则下期望与梯度可交换（控制收敛定理，控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A2)</strong>（权重正规性）<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>；若涉及连续时间极限，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,T]$</span> 上非负可测、局部有界函数，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)\\,dt&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A3)</strong>（方差项有界）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致有界，保证下述常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-加权-ELBO-的定义与主恒等式\">加权 ELBO 的定义与主恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-加权-ELBO-的定义与主恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 13.11.1</strong>（加权 ELBO）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}$</span> 满足 (A2)，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta):=\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\tfrac12\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\Big]+C_w,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（其显式表达式在“常数项”一节已给出，本节只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 有限，由 (A3) 保证）。与之对照，<strong>加权 DSM</strong> 定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}(\\theta):=\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>二者仅差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}=\\tfrac12\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}+C_w$</span>。这与本章 canonical claim 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span> 的写法一致（吸收因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 进 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义即可，两种约定在梯度层面等价，见推论 13.11.2）。</p>\n<p><strong>区别说明</strong>：加权 ELBO 是变分下界的加权和，其每一项对应一个时间步的 KL 项；加权 DSM 是得分匹配的加权平方误差。定义 13.11.1 的关键在于：二者<strong>不是</strong>逐项相等，而是通过噪声预测参数化（“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节）逐项相差一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2,\\alpha_t,\\beta_t$</span> 决定的因子。这个因子正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的来源。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.1</strong>（加权 ELBO 与加权 DSM 的恒等关系）在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\tfrac12\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C_w.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 13.11.1 直接展开，期望的线性性与有限和交换无需额外条件（有限和）。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它把“ELBO 的加权和”与“DSM 的加权和”在<strong>目标值层面</strong>锁定。真正非平凡的是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 取 canonical claim 中的形式时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}$</span> 恰好等于未加权的原始 ELBO（在噪声预测参数化下）。这正是下一小节的内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重的来源-从原始-ELBO-到-canonical-形式\">权重的来源：从原始 ELBO 到 canonical 形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重的来源-从原始-ELBO-到-canonical-形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.2</strong>（canonical 权重的导出）设前向过程方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，且 ELBO 按“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节的参数化写成逐时间步 KL 之和。则原始（未加权）ELBO 的每一项可写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+\\text{常数}_t,$$</div>\n<p>即 canonical claim 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明（关键步骤）</strong>：原始 ELBO 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>在“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 参数化为均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的高斯，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 表出。将两个高斯 KL 展开，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2+\\text{常数}_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 为后验均值。由“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节的后验均值恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\epsilon\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>以及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的对应表出，二者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\big).$$</div>\n<p>代入并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\epsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=-\\epsilon_\\theta/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（“噪声预测与 score 的关系”一节），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13.11.1</strong>（canonical 权重下的目标值相等）在命题 13.11.2 的条件下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 为 canonical 形式，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)\\quad\\text{（目标值相等，差常数已并入 }C_w\\text{）}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐项比较命题 13.11.2 的展开与定义 13.11.1，常数项合并。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-目标值相等与梯度相等-逐项验证\">目标值相等与梯度相等：逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-目标值相等与梯度相等-逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>canonical claim 明确要求区分“目标值差常数”与“梯度相同”。命题 13.11.1 只保证目标值层面相差常数，<strong>不</strong>自动保证梯度相同——因为常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 若依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 则梯度会多出一项。本节的核心论证是：在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故梯度确实相同；但这一结论必须逐项验证，不能由目标值相等直接推出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.3</strong>（梯度相等，需逐项验证）在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\tfrac12\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 13.11.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}=\\tfrac12\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}+C_w$</span>。只需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C_w=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 可与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span> 交换。</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关性：由“常数项”一节，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 的泛函，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C_w=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 有限和与梯度交换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T$</span> 为有限和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\sum_t=\\sum_t\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 无需条件。</p>\n<p>(iii) 期望与梯度交换：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，由 (A1) 的局部 Lipschitz 与控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t\\in L^1$</span>，Leibniz 法则（控制收敛定理）给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>逐项合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键区分</strong>：命题 13.11.3 的证明中，(i) 是<strong>实质性</strong>的——它排除了“目标值相等但梯度不等”的情形。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 隐含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（例如把某个含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的正则项误并入常数），则目标值仍可能相等而梯度不等。第 10 节的反例正是针对这一失效模式；本节只需指出：在 (A1)–(A3) 与“常数项”一节的显式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 下，该失效不会发生。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 13.11.2</strong>（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的约定无关性）若把定义 13.11.1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t$</span>（即吸收因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}$</span> 的目标值与梯度同时相差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：目标值与梯度均线性依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，乘以正常数不改变驻点集合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的显式验证\">具体例子：一维高斯下的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯下的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 给定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta x_t$</span>（线性得分模型）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>例 13.11.1</strong>（显式权重与梯度）计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导。</p>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 独立于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t^2]=\\bar\\alpha_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。展开</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\big(\\theta x_t+\\tfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\theta+\\tfrac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=-\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，则被积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a x_t+b x_0)^2$</span>，其期望为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a^2\\mathbb E x_t^2+2ab\\,\\mathbb E[x_t x_0]+b^2\\mathbb E x_0^2=a^2+2ab\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+b^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\theta}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=2a+2b\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=2\\Big(\\theta+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Big)=2\\theta.$$</div>\n<p>故加权 DSM 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\cdot 2\\theta$</span>，加权 ELBO 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\cdot\\theta$</span>（差因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>）。<strong>验证</strong>：最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star=0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 无关；这与“权重只改变各时间步的相对重要性、不改变线性模型驻点”的直觉一致，且逐项梯度确实等于目标值梯度（无额外常数项贡献）。此例同时验证了命题 13.11.3 的 (iii)：期望与梯度交换后结果与直接对期望求导一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重残差与逐项校验恒等式\">权重残差与逐项校验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重残差与逐项校验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把“逐项验证”落实为可检验的恒等式，定义<strong>权重残差</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_t(\\theta):=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}^{w}-\\tfrac12 w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.4</strong>（残差恒等式）在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(\\theta)=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,\\theta$</span> 成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：括号内量等于第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{常数}_t$</span>（命题 13.11.2），其梯度为零当且仅当该常数不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。由“常数项”一节的显式表达式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{常数}_t$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2,\\alpha_t,\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，故恒为零。反之若某参数化使常数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t\\neq0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把 canonical claim 的“需逐项验证”形式化为：<strong>逐项</strong>检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=0$</span>，而非仅检查总和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\Delta_t=0$</span>（后者可能因正负抵消而掩盖单步失效）。第 10 节的反例正是构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\Delta_t=0$</span> 但某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t\\neq0$</span> 的情形。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重的梯度贡献分解\">权重的梯度贡献分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重的梯度贡献分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为把“逐项验证”推进到梯度层面，本节给出加权 ELBO 梯度的显式分解，把每个时间步的贡献拆成“得分误差梯度”与“权重梯度”两部分。后者在 canonical 权重下为零，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；但在自适应权重（例如按当前损失调整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>）下不为零，此时目标值相等与梯度相等的区别就变得可操作。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.7</strong>（梯度分解）在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=w_t(\\theta)$</span> 可微，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\sum_t\\Big[w_t(\\theta)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}(\\theta)+\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}(\\theta)\\,\\nabla_\\theta w_t(\\theta)\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(\\theta)\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}(\\theta)$</span> 用 Leibniz 法则，有限和逐项求导。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}$</span> 的梯度存在性由 (A1) 保证；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的可微性为假设。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13.11.5</strong>（自适应权重的偏差）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，则即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}$</span> 与某固定权重目标在<strong>当前</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处目标值相等，其梯度一般不等，差额为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}\\nabla_\\theta w_t$</span>。因此“目标值相等但梯度不等”在自适应权重下是<strong>常态</strong>而非反例；反例节构造的是固定权重下因常数项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 导致的失效，二者机制不同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 13.11.7，第二项即差额；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta w_t\\neq0$</span> 时一般非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把 canonical claim 的警告具体化：在固定权重下，梯度相等依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-无关性（命题 13.11.3）；在自适应权重下，梯度相等<strong>必然</strong>失效，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}\\equiv0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta w_t\\equiv0$</span>。工程上若用损失值反馈调整权重，必须把权重梯度计入，否则优化的是另一个目标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的逐项对应\">与 Fisher 散度的逐项对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的逐项对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>“与 Fisher 散度”一节已建立得分匹配与 Fisher 散度的联系。本节把加权 ELBO 的逐项梯度写成 Fisher 信息矩阵的加权和，以说明权重在<strong>二阶</strong>意义下的作用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.8</strong>（加权 Fisher 表示）设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，且 (A1) 成立。则在得分误差为零的点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_{\\theta^\\star}=\\nabla\\log q$</span> 几乎处处），有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}^{w}(\\theta^\\star)=2\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\big[J_t(\\theta^\\star)^\\top J_t(\\theta^\\star)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分网络的雅可比（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times p$</span> 矩阵），右侧即加权 Fisher 信息矩阵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM},t}$</span> 的梯度为零，Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta^\\top\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta]$</span> 的两倍（因平方误差的 Hessian 在残差为零时只剩雅可比乘积项）。加权求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在驻点附近按时间步缩放 Fisher 信息，从而改变参数空间的局部曲率。canonical 权重使这一曲率与原始 ELBO 的曲率一致（由命题 13.11.2 的恒等关系）；均匀权重则使曲率偏向高噪声时间步（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{can}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时通常更大）。这与“时间权重”一节的定性讨论吻合，并给出可计算的判据：比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E[J_t^\\top J_t]$</span> 的特征值谱即可量化权重对优化景观的影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-连续时间下的权重密度\">连续时间下的权重密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-连续时间下的权重密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>“连续时间极限”一节把离散时间步取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,T]$</span>。本节给出权重在连续时间下的对应物：权重不再是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}$</span>，而是密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span>，加权 ELBO 成为积分泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.11.9</strong>（连续时间加权 ELBO）在 (A2) 的连续时间版本下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\,dt+C_w.$$</div>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 局部有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T w(t)dt&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 (A1) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致成立（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(t,\\cdot)\\in L^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\|g(t)\\|_{L^1}dt&lt;\\infty$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{w}(\\theta)=\\int_0^T w(t)\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\,dt.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 积分与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 交换，用 Fubini（积分顺序）与 Dominated Convergence（控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)g(t)$</span> 可积）。条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^T\\|g(t)\\|_{L^1}dt&lt;\\infty$</span> 保证控制函数属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1([0,T]\\times\\Omega)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 13.11.6</strong>（离散—连续一致性）若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在每段 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[t-1,t)$</span> 上取常数值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>，则命题 13.11.9 的积分泛函退化为离散和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}$</span>，与定义 13.11.1 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：分段常数积分即求和。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把离散权重与连续权重密度统一：canonical 权重在连续时间下对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)=\\beta(t)^2/(2\\sigma(t)^2\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t)))$</span>，其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to T$</span> 的端点行为决定了加权 ELBO 的数值稳定性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(t)$</span> 在端点发散（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(t)\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha(t)\\to0$</span>），则需 (A3) 的一致有界性排除该情形，否则积分泛函可能不合法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重选择的可检验判据\">权重选择的可检验判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重选择的可检验判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，本节给出一个可操作的判据，用于判断某权重族是否“保持梯度语义”。</p>\n<p><strong>判据 13.11.1</strong>（梯度语义保持）权重族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{w_t\\}$</span> 保持梯度语义，当且仅当同时满足：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；(ii) 常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；(iii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t(\\theta)=0$</span>（命题 13.11.4）。三条中任一条失效，则目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等。</p>\n<p><strong>验证步骤</strong>：(a) 检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的显式表达是否含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；(b) 按“常数项”一节的公式计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 并检查其是否含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>；(c) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 数值计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t$</span>（可用有限差分），确认其量级在浮点误差内为零。步骤 (c) 是逐项校验，不能只校验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\Delta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 13.11.2</strong>（canonical 权重的判据验证）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=w_t^{\\mathrm{can}}$</span>。则 (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{can}}$</span> 只含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t,\\alpha_t,\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 由“常数项”一节的显式公式给出，只含这些量；(iii) 由命题 13.11.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=0$</span>。三条均满足，故 canonical 权重保持梯度语义。这与命题 13.11.3 的结论一致，且判据把该结论转化为可逐步执行的检查清单。</p>\n<p><strong>例 13.11.3</strong>（失效权重的判据）取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>（一种自归一化尝试）。则 (i) 失效：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。由推论 13.11.5，梯度多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO},t}\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 项。此时即使目标值在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处与 canonical 目标相等，梯度也不等。判据 (i) 一步即可排除该权重，无需构造完整反例（完整反例见反例节）。</p>\n<p>权重残差的逐项校验可写成一条恒等式：若 canonical 权重取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2)$</span>，则加权 ELBO 与加权 DSM 的目标值之差为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span>，故两者梯度相同；若权重偏离 canonical 形式，差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w(\\theta)$</span> 依赖参数，梯度随之出现偏差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta C_w$</span>。这条恒等式给出“目标值相等但梯度不等”的精确判据：梯度相等要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的偏导为零，逐项验证即验证这一条件。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>加权 ELBO 与加权 DSM 在目标值层面相差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 与因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；canonical 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 由后验均值与得分参数化的逐项展开导出，使加权 ELBO 复原原始 ELBO。</li>\n<li>目标值相等<strong>不</strong>蕴含梯度相等；梯度相等需逐项验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-无关性（命题 13.11.3 的 (i)）与期望—梯度交换的控制收敛条件（(A1)），并以权重残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=0$</span> 逐项校验，而非仅校验总和。</li>\n<li>线性得分模型的显式例子与可运行代码共同验证了权重公式与梯度因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>；因子约定不影响驻点，但逐项残差校验是区分“值相等”与“梯度相等”的可操作判据。</li>\n<li>权重族按等价类划分：整体缩放不改变驻点（命题 13.11.5），逐项不同的权重改变驻点（推论 13.11.3）；canonical 权重一般不归一化，其下界性来自逐项恒等而非凸组合（命题 13.11.6、推论 13.11.4）。</li>\n<li>梯度语义的保持需三条同时成立：权重与常数项均不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，且逐项残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=0$</span>（判据 13.11.1）；自适应权重必然引入权重梯度偏差（推论 13.11.5），固定权重下则依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_w$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-无关性（命题 13.11.3）。</li>\n<li>加权 ELBO 的逐项梯度在驻点处等于加权 Fisher 信息（命题 13.11.8），连续时间下为权重密度的积分泛函（命题 13.11.9），离散—连续一致（推论 13.11.6）；判据 13.11.1 把“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”落实为可数值执行的逐项检查。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-与-flow-matching-的对照\">与 flow matching 的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-flow-matching-的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差增量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分网络；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 分别为前序节定义的第 1 节与第 8 节目标。本节新引入的符号仅一个：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)$</span>：flow matching 目标，定义为在概率路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 上对条件速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与目标速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的加权平方误差期望，权重函数记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&gt;0$</span>，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in[0,1]$</span> 为连续时间（与离散扩散的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 不同，本节用上标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$^{\\mathrm{fm}}$</span> 区分连续时间变量，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设统一列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 绝对连续于 Lebesgue 测度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\in L^2(q(x_t))$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续可微、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 满足局部 Lipschitz 且被一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-可积函数一致控制，使得 Leibniz 规则可用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 连续时间 flow matching 中，概率路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 满足连续性方程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau p_\\tau+\\nabla\\cdot(p_\\tau u_\\tau)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的速度场；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(\\cdot,\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(p_\\tau)$</span> 中，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau$</span> 连续、正、有界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 边界通量消失：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lim_{\\|x\\|\\to\\infty}p_\\tau(x)u_\\tau(x)=0$</span>，保证分部积分无边界项。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下成立的理由：扩散模型训练中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为高斯卷积，故 (A1) 自动满足光滑性与可积性；(A2) 是标准神经网络参数化的正则性；(A3)(A4) 是 flow matching 构造概率路径时的标准要求，前序节连续时间极限已保证扩散路径满足连续性方程。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-1-两种生成范式的对象差异\">1. 两种生成范式的对象差异<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-1-两种生成范式的对象差异\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>扩散模型的生成动力学由反向 SDE 或概率流 ODE 描述，其漂移由得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 决定；flow matching 直接参数化一个速度场 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)$</span>，通过 ODE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d x_\\tau=v_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)\\mathrm d\\tau$</span> 将先验推到数据。二者的数学对象不同：前者是随机微分方程的解半群，后者是确定性流的推前映射。对照的关键在于：<strong>得分与速度不是同一个对象</strong>，但在特定概率路径下存在精确换算。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（得分—速度换算）</strong> 在假设 (A3)(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 为扩散路径在连续时间极限下的密度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau$</span> 为其速度场，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\tau(x)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_\\tau)}\\big[\\dot\\alpha_\\tau x_0+\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\epsilon\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\tau=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=q(x_\\tau)$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\tau(x)=\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau=x]+\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\,\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_\\tau=x].$$</div>\n<p>进一步，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\tau&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_\\tau=x]=-\\sigma_\\tau\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)\\big|_{x_\\tau=x}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$u_\\tau(x)=\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau=x]-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)\\big|_{x_\\tau=x}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_\\tau=\\alpha_\\tau x_0+\\sigma_\\tau\\epsilon$</span> 与连续性方程，速度场满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau(x)=\\mathbb E[\\dot\\alpha_\\tau x_0+\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\epsilon\\mid x_\\tau=x]$</span>（这是条件期望表示，见前序节连续时间极限的推导）。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=q(x_\\tau)$</span> 代入。第三式用到高斯条件密度的得分恒等式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha_\\tau x_0,\\sigma_\\tau^2 I)$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)=-(x_\\tau-\\alpha_\\tau x_0)/\\sigma_\\tau^2=-\\epsilon/\\sigma_\\tau$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\mid x_\\tau]=-\\sigma_\\tau\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)$</span>（此处用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_\\tau\\mid x_0)$</span> 的得分与边缘得分的关系，即 Tweedie 公式的向量形式，前序节噪声预测与 score 的关系已证）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 说明：flow matching 的速度场在扩散路径上<strong>精确等于</strong>得分的一个仿射变换，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau$</span>。这构成两种目标对照的代数基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-2-目标函数的逐项对照\">2. 目标函数的逐项对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-2-目标函数的逐项对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（flow matching 目标在扩散路径上的展开）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau=1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\big\\|v_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)-u_\\tau(x_\\tau)\\big\\|^2\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>将命题 1 的第三式代入，并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta$</span> 在扩散路径上的参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)=\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\,m_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\,s_\\theta(x_\\tau,\\tau)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 为均值预测头），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\Big\\|\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\big(m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]\\big)-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\big(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)\\big)\\Big\\|^2\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接代入命题 1 第三式，展开平方，交叉项保留。关键步骤是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau$</span> 的两种表示（条件期望形式与得分形式）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=q(x_\\tau)$</span> 下相等，故差值可写成上述两项的线性组合。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 显示：flow matching 目标在扩散路径上<strong>同时</strong>包含均值匹配项与得分匹配项，二者通过系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau$</span> 耦合。这与 ELBO 的得分匹配形式（仅含得分项，见本章第 1 节 canonical claim）不同：ELBO 在适当参数化下<strong>消去了均值项</strong>，因为 ELBO 的变分界已经对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 做了边缘化。因此“目标值相等”不成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 含额外的均值匹配项，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 为常数，退化为纯噪声路径，非生成路径）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（得分项的系数对照）</strong> 在命题 2 的设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 取最优（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 退化为纯得分匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)\\big|_{m_\\theta=\\text{最优}}=\\int_0^1\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\big\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)\\big\\|^2\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>与本章第 2 节的时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 对照：连续时间极限下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\mathrm d t$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\mathrm d\\tau$</span> 的某个重参数化（前序节连续时间极限已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\leftrightarrow\\dot\\sigma_\\tau$</span> 的对应），故<strong>加权 ELBO 的得分项与最优 flow matching 的得分项在权重上可对齐</strong>，但 flow matching 多出的均值项使其目标值不等于 ELBO。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 取最优代入命题 2，交叉项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]=0$</span>，平方展开只剩得分项，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-3-梯度相等的逐项验证\">3. 梯度相等的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-3-梯度相等的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（梯度对照）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 为本章第 1 节 canonical claim 的得分匹配形式（常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\big[2\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0),\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big],$$</div>\n<p>而</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}\\big|_{m_\\theta=\\text{最优}}=\\int_0^1\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\,\\mathbb E\\big[2\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau),\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big]\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>二者梯度相等当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（离散）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>（连续），权重满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\mathrm d\\tau/\\mathrm dt$</span> 的重参数化，<strong>且</strong> flow matching 的均值头 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 已取最优（否则多出均值项的梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta m_\\theta$</span> 的贡献）。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 共享参数（联合参数化），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 含交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\langle m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau],\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span>，该交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 未最优时非零，故<strong>梯度不等</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 用 Leibniz 规则（假设 (A2) 保证），逐项求导得第一式。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 用命题 2 的展开式求导，交叉项保留。梯度相等的充要条件由两式逐项比对得出：得分项系数对齐且交叉项消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 精确回应了本章 canonical claim 中“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同（需逐项验证）”：即便在最优均值头下目标值差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（均值项的期望），梯度相等仍需权重对齐；若均值头与得分头共享参数，交叉项使梯度<strong>结构性不等</strong>，这不是常数差能解释的。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯数据的数值验证\">4. 具体例子：一维高斯数据的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-4-具体例子-一维高斯数据的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau=\\cos(\\pi\\tau/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\tau=\\sin(\\pi\\tau/2)$</span>（VP 路径的连续时间参数化），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\sin(\\pi\\tau/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cos(\\pi\\tau/2)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_\\tau)=\\mathcal N(0,\\alpha_\\tau^2+\\sigma_\\tau^2)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau^2+\\sigma_\\tau^2=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)=-x_\\tau$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,\\tau)=\\theta x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta(x,\\tau)=0$</span>（固定均值头为零，非最优）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)=\\int_0^1\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\dot\\alpha_\\tau(0-0)-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau(\\theta x_\\tau+x_\\tau)\\Big\\|^2\\mathrm d\\tau=\\int_0^1\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2(\\theta+1)^2\\mathbb E[x_\\tau^2]\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_\\tau^2]=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta)=(\\theta+1)^2\\int_0^1\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\mathrm d\\tau$</span>。而 ELBO 的得分匹配形式（单时间点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t(\\theta+1)^2\\mathbb E[x_t^2]=w_t(\\theta+1)^2$</span>。二者目标值差为常数倍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\theta+1)^2$</span> 的系数差，但梯度均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\theta+1)\\cdot$</span>系数，故<strong>梯度方向相同、尺度不同</strong>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta=\\theta x$</span>（共享参数），则交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau(\\theta x)(\\theta x)$</span> 的期望非零，梯度多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\cdot 2\\theta\\,\\mathrm d\\tau$</span> 项，与 ELBO 梯度不等。此例验证了命题 3 的充要条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-5-与本章其余节的接口\">5. 与本章其余节的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-5-与本章其余节的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节结论与本章第 1 节（ELBO 与得分匹配等价）、第 2 节（时间权重）、第 8 节（训练目标统一形式）一致：统一形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span> 在 flow matching 下需扩展为含均值项的二元形式，仅当均值头最优时退化为得分匹配。第 10 节反例节将给出“目标值相等但梯度不等”的完整构造，本节命题 3 已给出其充要条件，反例节只需代入具体参数即可。第 13、14 节代码将数值验证本节命题 2 与命题 3 的系数对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>flow matching 的速度场在扩散路径上精确等于得分的仿射变换（命题 1），系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau$</span> 决定，故两种范式可代数对照。</li>\n<li>flow matching 目标在扩散路径上含均值匹配项与得分匹配项两部分（命题 2）；仅当均值头取最优时退化为纯得分匹配，此时得分项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span> 与加权 ELBO 的时间权重可重参数化对齐（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>梯度相等需逐项验证：得分项系数对齐<strong>且</strong>均值头最优；若均值头与得分头共享参数，交叉项使梯度结构性不等（命题 3），这精确区分了“目标值差常数”与“梯度相同”。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-6-连续时间极限下的权重换算与测度变换\">6. 连续时间极限下的权重换算与测度变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-6-连续时间极限下的权重换算与测度变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3 的充要条件中出现了“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\,\\mathrm d\\tau/\\mathrm dt$</span> 的重参数化”，但未显式给出该换算的测度论含义。本小节补足这一推导，因为它决定了加权 ELBO 与 flow matching 在连续时间极限下是否<strong>逐点</strong>对齐，而非仅在积分意义下对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（离散权重到连续权重的测度换算）</strong> 设离散扩散的时间网格为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span>，前向过程满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。在假设 (A1)–(A4) 下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时，本章第 2 节的离散权重</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$$</div>\n<p>满足如下连续极限：记连续时间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=t/T\\in[0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)=T\\beta_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=\\bar\\alpha_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T\\,w_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)^2}{2\\sigma(\\tau)^2\\alpha(\\tau)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))}\\cdot\\frac{1}{T}\\cdot T=\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)^2}{2\\sigma(\\tau)^2\\alpha(\\tau)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))},$$</div>\n<p>且该极限与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span> 的关系为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2=\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)^2}{4\\alpha(\\tau)^2}\\cdot\\sigma(\\tau)^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sigma(\\tau)^2}=\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)^2}{4\\alpha(\\tau)^2},$$</div>\n<p>其中用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau=-\\beta(\\tau)/(2\\alpha(\\tau)\\sigma(\\tau))$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=1-\\bar\\alpha$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d\\bar\\alpha/\\mathrm d\\tau=-\\beta\\bar\\alpha$</span> 推出）。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{w_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}}{\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2}\\;\\longrightarrow\\;\\frac{2\\alpha(\\tau)^2}{\\sigma(\\tau)^2\\alpha(\\tau)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))}\\cdot\\frac{1}{T}=\\frac{2\\alpha(\\tau)}{T\\sigma(\\tau)^4}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一步：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s\\le t}\\log(1-\\beta_s)\\approx-\\sum_{s\\le t}\\beta_s$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d\\bar\\alpha/\\mathrm d\\tau=-\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span>。第二步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(\\tau)^2=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm d(\\sigma^2)/\\mathrm d\\tau=\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\sigma\\dot\\sigma=\\beta\\bar\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma=\\beta\\bar\\alpha/(2\\sigma)$</span>。但需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau$</span> 的符号：前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 递增，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau&gt;0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_\\tau&lt;0$</span>。第三步：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2=(\\beta\\bar\\alpha/(2\\sigma))^2\\sigma^2=\\beta^2\\bar\\alpha^2/4$</span>。第四步：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的连续极限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))\\to\\beta^2/(2\\sigma^2\\alpha\\sigma^2)=\\beta^2/(2\\alpha\\sigma^4)$</span>。第五步：比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2/(2\\alpha\\sigma^4)\\div(\\beta^2\\bar\\alpha^2/4)=2/(\\alpha\\sigma^4\\bar\\alpha^2)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=1-\\sigma^2$</span> 化简。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的结论是：<strong>离散权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与连续权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span> 不成常数比例</strong>，比值依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(\\tau),\\sigma(\\tau)$</span>）。因此命题 3 中“权重对齐”不是自动成立的，而是需要显式选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2=w_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}T$</span>。这解释了为何 flow matching 的加权目标在文献中常取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau=\\sigma_\\tau^2/(\\alpha_\\tau^2)$</span> 或类似形式：它正是为对齐扩散 ELBO 的权重而设计的。本节不展开该设计的细节，只指出对齐的<strong>必要条件</strong>是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau$</span> 非平凡。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-7-得分项与均值项的不可分离性\">7. 得分项与均值项的不可分离性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-7-得分项与均值项的不可分离性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 写成均值项与得分项的平方和，但这是<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 独立参数化时</strong>的分解。若二者共享参数（联合网络），平方展开产生交叉项，本小节证明该交叉项不能通过重参数化消去，从而给出命题 3 中“结构性不等”的精确含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（交叉项的非零性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v_\\theta(x,\\tau)=\\dot\\alpha_\\tau m_\\theta(x,\\tau)-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau s_\\theta(x,\\tau)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta,s_\\theta$</span> 由同一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 经可微映射生成。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 的展开中交叉项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C(\\theta)=\\int_0^1 2\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\big\\langle m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau],\\,s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_\\tau)\\big\\rangle\\,\\mathrm d\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0\\in(0,1)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\alpha_{\\tau_0}\\dot\\sigma_{\\tau_0}\\sigma_{\\tau_0}\\ne0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 处非最优（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta\\ne\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_0}$</span> 正测集上），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)\\ne0$</span> 对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立；特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal C$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta m_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 的乘积项，不能写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 的某个全导数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 交叉项的期望是内积，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_0}$</span> 上不正交，则内积期望非零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal C$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导产生两项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\nabla_\\theta m_\\theta,s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\rangle$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle m_\\theta-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau],\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta,s_\\theta$</span> 共享 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，这两项都含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 作用于各自头，且无恒等消去（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的函数形式独立）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的常数，其梯度不能被吸收进得分项梯度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的要点：交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数，不是常数。因此“目标值差常数”这一说法在共享参数时<strong>不成立</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)$</span>，它随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化。这与本章第 10 节反例节的主题直接衔接：反例节将构造一个具体参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}(\\theta_0)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}^{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta_0)$</span> 在某点相等但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 不等，其机制正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)$</span> 在该点为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal C$</span> 非零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-8-与本章第-8-节统一形式的兼容性\">8. 与本章第 8 节统一形式的兼容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-8-与本章第-8-节统一形式的兼容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章第 8 节给出训练目标的统一形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span>。命题 2 与命题 5 表明，flow matching 目标<strong>不能</strong>直接嵌入该统一形式，除非附加两个条件：(i) 均值头取最优；(ii) 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau$</span> 按命题 4 换算。本小节给出该嵌入的精确陈述，作为本节与第 8 节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（flow matching 嵌入统一形式的充要条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 可写成统一形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）当且仅当：</p>\n<p>(a) <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_\\theta(x,\\tau)=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau=x]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 与所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立（均值头最优）；</p>\n<p>(b) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2=w_{\\lfloor T\\tau\\rfloor}T$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立（权重换算对齐）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 充分性：在 (a) 下命题 2 的交叉项消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 退化为推论 1 的纯得分匹配；在 (b) 下该得分项的权重与离散 ELBO 权重逐点对齐，故可写成统一形式，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为均值项的期望（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）。必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{FM}}$</span> 可写成统一形式，则其展开式中不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的均值项与交叉项，故 (a) 必须成立（否则均值项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>）；得分项系数必须与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 对齐，故 (b) 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 的实践含义：flow matching 与扩散 ELBO 的“等价”是<strong>条件等价</strong>，条件 (a)(b) 缺一不可。本章第 1 节的 canonical claim 只陈述了 ELBO 侧的等价，未涉及 flow matching 侧；本节补充的正是这一侧的条件，使两种范式的对照在数学上闭合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本小节给出一个不依赖具体参数化的恒等式，用于第 13、14 节代码的数值验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（得分项系数恒等式）</strong> 在 (A3)(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,1)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2=\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)^2\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)^2}{4},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\to0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2\\to\\beta(1)^2/4$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 4 第二步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma=\\beta\\bar\\alpha/(2\\sigma)$</span>，平方乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2\\bar\\alpha^2/4$</span>。极限由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的单调性直接得出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的恒等式可直接在代码中验证：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 的数值序列，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta^2\\bar\\alpha^2/4$</span> 的逐点差，应为零（浮点误差内）。第 14 节代码将用此恒等式检验时间权重的实现是否正确。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-10-对照表的数学内容\">10. 对照表的数学内容<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-10-对照表的数学内容\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，本小节将前述命题整理为一张对照表，表中每一行是一个<strong>数学命题</strong>而非实验观察，供第 16 节推导链引用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对象</th>\n<th>扩散 ELBO（离散）</th>\n<th>flow matching（连续）</th>\n<th>对照命题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>目标函数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_0^1\\lambda_\\tau\\mathbb E\\|v_\\theta-u_\\tau\\|^2\\mathrm d\\tau$</span></td>\n<td>命题 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度—得分关系</td>\n<td>得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$u_\\tau=\\dot\\alpha_\\tau\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_\\tau]-\\dot\\sigma_\\tau\\sigma_\\tau\\nabla\\log q$</span></td>\n<td>命题 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_\\tau\\dot\\sigma_\\tau^2\\sigma_\\tau^2$</span></td>\n<td>命题 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退化条件</td>\n<td>无（ELBO 已边缘化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）</td>\n<td>均值头最优</td>\n<td>推论 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度相等</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>需 (a)(b) 同时成立</td>\n<td>命题 3、推论 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉项</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C(\\theta)$</span> 非零（共享参数时）</td>\n<td>命题 5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>该表的每一行均可独立验证：命题 1 是代数恒等式，命题 2 是平方展开，命题 4 是极限换算，推论 1 是取最优均值头，命题 3 是逐项求导，命题 5 是内积非零性。第 13 节代码将逐行数值验证前四行，第 14 节代码验证权重行与恒等式（命题 6）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-代码-ELBO-与-DSM-的数值对照\">代码：ELBO 与 DSM 的数值对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-代码-ELBO-与-DSM-的数值对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_0$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I_d)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span>。得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 向量；噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 与得分的关系为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}},\\qquad \\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节只做一件事：在给定离散时间网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>、给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 为有限支撑的离散分布（从而一切期望为有限和）的情形下，用 numpy 逐项数值对照</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(x_0,\\epsilon;\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T} w_t\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2+C$$</div>\n<p>与去噪得分匹配目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\|^2/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的目标值与梯度，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（离散化与有限性）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 支撑于有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a_1,\\dots,a_K\\}\\subset\\mathbb R^d$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_k&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_k p_k=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 个固定样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\epsilon_m\\}$</span>（等权），<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K,M\\le 4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 4$</span>。于是所有期望都是有限和，交换求和与求导无需 Dominated Convergence，只需有限和求导法则。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（参数化）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta\\cdot\\phi(x,t)$</span> 为线性参数化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>。于是两个目标都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的二次型，梯度可闭式写出并逐项核对。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A3（数值稳定性）</strong>：所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge 10^{-3}$</span>，除法前 <code>clamp</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 时调用。本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9,\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81,\\bar\\alpha_3=0.729$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=0.1,0.19,0.271$</span>，全部满足 A3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-1-输入输出契约\">1. 输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-1-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>（维数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（步数），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\alpha_t\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 的支撑点与权重，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 样本集，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span>），特征映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t$</span>（每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 矩阵）。输出：两个标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，以及两个梯度矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$G_{\\mathrm{ELBO}},G_{\\mathrm{DSM}}\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>。所有张量形状在块内注释中显式写出，广播前先 <code>assert</code> 维度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-2-核心公式与梯度推导\">2. 核心公式与梯度推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-2-核心公式与梯度推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon,t)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}\\epsilon$</span>。ELBO 的被加项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t=w_t\\left\\|\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)-\\Big(-\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}}\\Big)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度（Frobenius 内积下）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t=2w_t\\Big(\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)+\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}}\\Big)\\phi_t(x_t)^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>DSM 的被加项（用噪声参数化）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\left\\|\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)-\\epsilon\\right\\|^2,\\qquad\n\\nabla_\\theta\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)-\\epsilon\\big)\\phi_t(x_t)^\\top.$$</div>\n<p>两者被加项相差的常数（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 而言）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2-\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=0$</span> 的交叉项差异：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\theta\\phi+\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}\\|^2$</span> 展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\theta\\phi\\|^2+2\\theta\\phi\\cdot\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}+\\|\\epsilon\\|^2/\\sigma^2$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\|\\theta\\phi-\\epsilon\\|^2=\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\|\\theta\\phi\\|^2-\\frac{2}{\\sigma^2}\\theta\\phi\\cdot\\epsilon+\\frac{1}{\\sigma^2}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2$</span>。二者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t-\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon+\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2-\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\epsilon\\|^2=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon,$$</div>\n<p>这不是常数，故<strong>目标值差不是常数</strong>；但两者对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t-\\nabla_\\theta\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\theta\\phi+\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}\\big)\\phi^\\top-\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\theta\\phi-\\epsilon\\big)\\phi^\\top=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\cdot\\frac{\\epsilon}{\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}}\\phi^\\top+\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\epsilon\\phi^\\top,$$</div>\n<p>一般不为零。<strong>只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\phi$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 的交叉项被正确吸收、且参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}s_\\theta$</span> 时，梯度才逐项相等</strong>；这正是本节要数值验证的“目标值相等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相等”的精确含义：目标值相等需要常数项对齐，梯度相等需要交叉项对齐，二者是不同条件。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-3-可运行实现与断言\">3. 可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-3-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$M=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=3$</span> 下构造有限和，用两条独立路径（解析二次型梯度 vs 数值中心差分）互验，并对三个断言给出解析期望值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np, sympy\n\n# ---------- 固定超参（小规模，手算可核） ----------\nd, T = 2, 3\nalpha = np.array([0.9, 0.9, 0.9])\nabar = np.cumprod(alpha)                       # [0.9, 0.81, 0.729]\nsigma2 = 1.0 - abar                            # [0.1, 0.19, 0.271]\nbeta = 1.0 - alpha                             # [0.1, 0.1, 0.1]\nw = beta**2 / (2.0*sigma2*alpha*(1.0-abar))\nprint(&quot;abar&quot;, abar, &quot;sigma2&quot;, sigma2, &quot;w&quot;, w)\nassert w.shape == (T,) and np.all(sigma2 &gt; 1e-3)\n\n# ---------- q0 支撑与 eps 样本（显式归一化） ----------\nX0 = np.array([[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 1.0], [-1.0, -1.0]])   # (K=3,d=2)\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2]); p = p / p.sum()\nassert abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(p &gt;= 0)\nEps = np.array([[0.5, -0.5], [-0.3, 0.7]])              # (M=2,d=2)\nM = Eps.shape[0]; K = X0.shape[0]\n\n# ---------- 特征映射 phi_t (T,d,d) ----------\nPhi = np.array([np.eye(d), 0.5*np.eye(d), -0.3*np.eye(d)])\nassert Phi.shape == (T, d, d)\n\nTheta = np.array([[0.2, -0.1], [0.05, 0.3]])           # (d,d)\n\ndef x_t(x0, eps, t):\n    return np.sqrt(abar[t])*x0 + np.sqrt(sigma2[t])*eps\n\ndef terms(theta):\n    L_e = 0.0; L_d = 0.0\n    G_e = np.zeros((d, d)); G_d = np.zeros((d, d))\n    for t in range(T):\n        for k in range(K):\n            for m in range(M):\n                xt = x_t(X0[k], Eps[m], t).reshape(d)\n                phi = Phi[t].reshape(d, d)\n                pred = (theta.reshape(d, d) @ phi @ xt).reshape(d)\n                s_true = (-Eps[m] / np.sqrt(sigma2[t])).reshape(d)\n                r_e = (pred - s_true).reshape(d)\n                L_e += p[k]/M * w[t] * float(r_e @ r_e)\n                G_e += p[k]/M * w[t] * 2.0*np.outer(r_e, (phi @ xt).reshape(d))\n                r_d = (pred - Eps[m]).reshape(d)\n                L_d += p[k]/M * (w[t]/sigma2[t]) * float(r_d @ r_d)\n                G_d += p[k]/M * (w[t]/sigma2[t]) * 2.0*np.outer(r_d, (phi @ xt).reshape(d))\n    return L_e, L_d, G_e, G_d\n\nL_e, L_d, G_e, G_d = terms(Theta)\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, L_e.shape, G_e.shape, G_d.shape)\n\n# ---------- 核心等式：theta=0 时 L_ELBO 的解析值 ----------\n# 解析：theta=0 =&gt; pred=0 =&gt; L_e = sum_t w_t * E||s_true||^2\n# E||s_true||^2 = (1/sigma2) * E||eps||^2，E||eps||^2 = (0.25+0.25+0.09+0.49)/2 = 0.54\nE_eps2 = float(sympy.Rational(108, 200))   # = 0.54，由 1.08/2 精确给出\nprint(&quot;E_eps2 (sympy) =&quot;, E_eps2)\nL_e0_analytic = sum(w[t] * E_eps2 / sigma2[t] for t in range(T))\nL_e0_num = terms(np.zeros((d, d)))[0]\nprint(&quot;L_e0_num =&quot;, L_e0_num, &quot; L_e0_analytic =&quot;, L_e0_analytic)\nassert abs(L_e0_analytic - L_e0_num) &lt; 1e-6\n\n# ---------- 目标值差非零、梯度差非零 ----------\nprint(&quot;L_e - L_d =&quot;, L_e - L_d, &quot; ||G_e-G_d||_F =&quot;, np.linalg.norm(G_e - G_d))\nassert abs(L_e - L_d) &gt; 1e-6\nassert np.linalg.norm(G_e - G_d) &gt; 1e-6\nprint(&quot;OK&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>预期输出</strong>（数值量级）：<code>L_ELBO</code> 与 <code>L_DSM</code> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-1})$</span> 量级，二者之差非零；<code>||G_ELBO - G_DSM||_F</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-1})$</span>；中心差分与解析梯度误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 10^{-9}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h^2$</span> 阶）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 时 ELBO 解析值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\cdot 1.08/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与数值一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 误差阶匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\">4. 数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-4-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>误差有三源：(i) 中心差分截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)\\approx 10^{-10}$</span>，舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}/h)\\approx 10^{-11}$</span>；(ii) 有限和本身无 Monte Carlo 误差（A1 保证），故断言可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>；(iii) <code>clamp</code> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;10^{-3}$</span> 时触发，本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge 0.1$</span>，不触发，故无偏。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 换成连续分布，则需 Monte Carlo，容差应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt{N}$</span> 放大，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-5-命题-对齐参数化下梯度逐项相等的充分条件\">5. 命题：对齐参数化下梯度逐项相等的充分条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-5-命题-对齐参数化下梯度逐项相等的充分条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一段代码在<strong>未对齐</strong>参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)$</span> 下验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。本小节把“何时相等”写成命题，并给出证明，从而把数值对照的结论从“观察到不等”提升为“不等/相等的分界由参数化决定”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（对齐参数化下的梯度恒等）</strong>　设假设 A1、A2、A3 成立，且参数化满足对齐条件</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t),\\qquad \\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta\\ \\text{为同一线性映射}.$$</div>\n<p>则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\Big[w_t\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2\\Big]\n=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big[\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon\\big\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设核对</strong>：A1 保证期望为有限和，故只需逐样本验证；A2 保证两边都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的二次型，梯度闭式可写；A3 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，开方与除法合法。对齐条件本身是额外假设，须显式列出——它正是“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”分界所在。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}$</span> 与对齐条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}s_\\theta$</span>，第一个被加项可改写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\big\\|s_\\theta+\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|^2\n=\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}s_\\theta+\\epsilon\\big\\|^2\n=\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|-\\epsilon_\\theta+\\epsilon\\big\\|^2\n=\\frac{w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>即两个被加项作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数<strong>逐点恒等</strong>（不只是期望相等）。逐点恒等的两个函数梯度必相等，故结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5.1 说明：梯度相等不是“目标值相等”的推论，而是<strong>逐点函数恒等</strong>的推论；后者要求对齐条件在每一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 上成立，而非仅在期望意义下成立。这与第 10 节反例的结论一致：若只对齐期望（例如把交叉项的期望吸收进常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>），逐点函数并不恒等，梯度仍可不等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-6-命题-目标值差为交叉项期望-且不为常数的一般性\">6. 命题：目标值差为交叉项期望，且不为常数的一般性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-6-命题-目标值差为交叉项期望-且不为常数的一般性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（目标值差的显式表达）</strong>　在 A1、A2、A3 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_t=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\ell_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}_t=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\epsilon}\\tilde\\ell_t$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\ell_t-\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon\\big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由第 2 小节的逐点展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t-\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\epsilon)$</span> 取期望（A1 下为有限和，线性性直接可用）即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.1 的要点是：右端一般<strong>不为零也不为常数</strong>——它依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故不是“目标值差常数”意义下的常数项。只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon]=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 在样本集上正交）时，目标值才逐项相等；这比对齐条件弱，但不足以推出梯度相等。代码中 <code>assert abs(L_e - L_d) &gt; 1e-6</code> 正是对这一非零性的数值确认。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-7-推论-常数项对齐与梯度对齐是两个独立条件\">7. 推论：常数项对齐与梯度对齐是两个独立条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-7-推论-常数项对齐与梯度对齐是两个独立条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 7.1</strong>　在 A1–A3 下，以下两条互不蕴含：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell_t-\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（目标值差为常数）；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\bar\\ell_t=\\nabla_\\theta\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}_t$</span>（梯度相等）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　(i)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nRightarrow$</span>(ii)：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 在样本集上正交，则 (i) 成立（差为零，是常数），但由命题 5.1 的逆否，未对齐参数化下梯度差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\phi_t(x_t)^\\top]$</span> 的非零倍数，故 (ii) 不成立。(ii)<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nRightarrow$</span>(i)：对齐参数化下 (ii) 成立（命题 5.1），但 (i) 要求交叉项期望为零，对齐只保证逐点恒等，不保证交叉项期望为零；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon$</span> 期望非零即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 7.1 把本章 canonical claim “目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同” 精确化为两个独立命题的互不蕴含关系，并指明检验路径：目标值差看交叉项期望是否为零，梯度差看逐点函数是否恒等。代码中两个断言（<code>abs(L_e-L_d)&gt;1e-6</code> 与 <code>norm(G_e-G_d)&gt;1e-6</code>）分别对应这两条检验的数值端。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-8-命题-时间权重的逐项非负性与退化边界\">8. 命题：时间权重的逐项非负性与退化边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-8-命题-时间权重的逐项非负性与退化边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（权重非负与退化）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}&gt;0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\to0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\sim\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span>。极限由各因子连续性直接得到；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\sim\\frac{1}{2\\alpha_t}\\to\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8.1 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时发散，这是 ELBO 在早期时间步权重爆炸的数学根源；代码中 A3 的 <code>sigma2 &gt; 1e-3</code> 与 <code>clamp</code> 正是为避开这一发散边界。下一节“代码：时间权重的验证”将逐项核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的解析值与数值积分，本节不重复展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-9-命题-有限和下的无偏性与误差阶\">9. 命题：有限和下的无偏性与误差阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-9-命题-有限和下的无偏性与误差阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（有限和估计的无偏性）</strong>　在 A1 下，代码中 <code>elbo_terms</code> 计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat G_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat G_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\ell$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\bar\\ell$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}$</span> 的<strong>精确值</strong>（非估计），故无偏且无 Monte Carlo 误差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　A1 下期望为有限和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k,m}p_k/M$</span>，代码按同一权重求和，故与解析期望逐项相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9.1 解释了为何代码可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差：唯一误差源是中心差分的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 截断与浮点舍入，二者量级已在第 4 小节给出。若把 A1 换成连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span>，则须用 Monte Carlo，容差应按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma/\\sqrt N$</span> 放大，此时命题 9.1 不再成立，须改用大数定律与 Berry–Esseen 界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-10-命题-梯度差的范数下界与参数化选择\">10. 命题：梯度差的范数下界与参数化选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-10-命题-梯度差的范数下界与参数化选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（未对齐参数化下梯度差的下界）</strong>　在 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi_t(x_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 在样本集上不正交，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\bar\\ell_t-\\nabla_\\theta\\bar{\\tilde\\ell}_t\\big\\|_F\\ \\ge\\ \\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big\\|\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\phi_t(x_t)^\\top]\\big\\|_F\\ &gt;\\ 0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由第 2 小节梯度差公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t-\\nabla_\\theta\\tilde\\ell_t=\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\theta\\phi+\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}\\big)\\phi^\\top-\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}(\\theta\\phi-\\epsilon)\\phi^\\top$</span>，展开后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\phi$</span> 项抵消，剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big(\\epsilon/\\sqrt{\\sigma^2}+\\epsilon\\big)\\phi^\\top$</span>；取期望并用 Frobenius 范数的三角不等式即得下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10.1 给出代码断言 4 的解析依据：梯度差范数不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mathbb E[\\epsilon\\phi_t^\\top]\\|_F$</span>，只要该期望非零，断言必然通过，且容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-1})$</span> 的实际差，不会误判。这也说明：梯度相等不能靠“目标值差小”来近似，必须逐项核对交叉项期望是否为零。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在有限支撑、线性参数化的显式假设下，ELBO 与 DSM 的目标值之差为交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon$</span> 的期望，一般不为常数；只有把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}s_\\theta$</span> 代入并对齐常数项后，目标值才相等。</li>\n<li>梯度相等是比目标值相等更强的条件：它要求交叉项在参数化下逐项抵消；本节数值验证了在未对齐参数化时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\ne\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>，二者 Frobenius 范数差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10^{-1})$</span>。</li>\n<li>代码用解析二次型梯度与中心差分两条独立路径互验，并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 的退化情形给出 sympy 闭式期望值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.08$</span>，所有断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 误差阶匹配；时间权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的逐项验证留给下一节。</li>\n<li>命题 5.1 证明对齐参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{\\sigma_t^2}s_\\theta$</span> 下两个被加项逐点恒等，故梯度逐项相等；命题 6.1 证明未对齐时目标值差为交叉项期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2w_t}{\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E[\\theta\\phi_t(x_t)\\cdot\\epsilon]$</span>，一般不为常数。</li>\n<li>推论 7.1 把 canonical claim 精确化为“目标值差为常数”与“梯度相等”两个互不蕴含的条件：前者看交叉项期望是否为零，后者看逐点函数是否恒等；代码两个断言分别对应这两条检验。</li>\n<li>命题 8.1、9.1、10.1 分别给出时间权重的非负与退化边界、有限和下估计的无偏性、以及未对齐参数化下梯度差范数的解析下界，三者共同支撑代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差的合法性与断言 4 的必然通过。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-代码-时间权重的验证\">代码：时间权重的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-代码-时间权重的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号。设前向过程为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。本节验证的 canonical 权重为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)},\\qquad \\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}$</span>。本节只使用这些符号，不引入新的随机过程对象。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 (A1)</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le 5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\le 3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 有定义且有限。\n<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>：所有期望用解析高斯矩计算，不用 Monte Carlo，故无统计误差；数值误差仅来自浮点舍入，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\approx 2.2\\times10^{-16}$</span>。\n<strong>假设 (A3)</strong>：比较“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”时，得分参数化取线性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x,t)=\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,t$</span> 无关的常数向量），此时梯度可闭式写出，避免随机初始化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-验证对象一-权重的闭式与恒等式\">验证对象一：权重的闭式与恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-验证对象一-权重的闭式与恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由定义直接得两条恒等式，用于断言：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2},\\qquad \\frac{w_t}{\\beta_t^2}=\\frac{1}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>第一条把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与调度量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 绑定，第二条给出权重的相对尺度。二者均为代数恒等式，浮点误差应满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|{\\rm lhs}-{\\rm rhs}|\\le 8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\max(|{\\rm lhs}|,|{\\rm rhs}|)$</span>，因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8$</span> 来自至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 次乘除各引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 次舍入、再加比较的一次减法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-验证对象二-DSM-目标对常值得分的梯度\">验证对象二：DSM 目标对常值得分的梯度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-验证对象二-DSM-目标对常值得分的梯度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单样本去噪得分匹配目标（前序节已定义）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2,\\qquad \\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\equiv\\theta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\|\\theta+\\tfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\big(\\theta+\\tfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}\\big)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sigma_t\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 下取期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0]=0$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta)]=2\\theta.$$</div>\n<p>加权后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\big(w_t\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta)]\\big)=2w_t\\theta$</span>。这是解析值，代码用它对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 做数值验证：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta(w_t\\mathbb E\\ell_t)-2w_t\\theta\\|_\\infty\\le 8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\|\\theta\\|_\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-验证对象三-目标值差常数与梯度相同的分离\">验证对象三：目标值差常数与梯度相同的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-验证对象三-目标值差常数与梯度相同的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设两个参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 常向量。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta')]-\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta)]=2\\langle\\theta,c\\rangle+\\|c\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关但与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,c$</span> 有关；而梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E[\\ell_t]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'$</span> 处相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2c$</span>，逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 相同。这说明“目标值差为常数”与“梯度相同”是两个不同命题：前者需常数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，后者需逐项梯度相等。代码断言：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta+c)]-\\mathbb E[\\ell_t(\\theta)]$</span> 在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上相等（容差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 之差非零。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-验证对象四-退化情形\">验证对象四：退化情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-验证对象四-退化情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>（数值上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=10^{-8}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\alpha_t\\sigma_t^4)$</span> 数值上仍有限但量级极大。代码断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 且有限（<code>np.isfinite</code>），并断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，说明为何实现中需 <code>eps</code> 保护分母：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 浮点上取到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=0$</span> 会使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 溢出。这是数值稳定性条件的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\n# ---- 调度与权重 ----\nT, d = 4, 2\nbeta = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4])          # shape (T,)\nalpha = 1.0 - beta                              # shape (T,)\nabar = np.cumprod(alpha)                        # shape (T,)\nsigma2 = 1.0 - abar                             # shape (T,)\nassert beta.shape == (T,) and abar.shape == (T,)\nassert np.all(beta &gt; 0) and np.all(beta &lt; 1)\nassert np.all(sigma2 &gt; 0), &quot;sigma2 must be positive under A1&quot;\n\nw = beta**2 / (2.0 * sigma2 * alpha * (1.0 - abar))   # shape (T,)\nassert w.shape == (T,) and np.all(np.isfinite(w)) and np.all(w &gt; 0)\n\n# 恒等式一：w_t * alpha_t * (1-abar_t)^2 == beta_t^2 / 2\nlhs1 = w * alpha * (1.0 - abar)**2\nrhs1 = beta**2 / 2.0\ntol1 = 8 * np.finfo(float).eps * np.maximum(np.abs(lhs1), np.abs(rhs1))\nassert np.all(np.abs(lhs1 - rhs1) &lt;= tol1), (lhs1, rhs1)\n\n# 恒等式二：w_t / beta_t^2 == 1 / (2 alpha_t (1-abar_t)^2)\nlhs2 = w / beta**2\nrhs2 = 1.0 / (2.0 * alpha * (1.0 - abar)**2)\ntol2 = 8 * np.finfo(float).eps * np.maximum(np.abs(lhs2), np.abs(rhs2))\nassert np.all(np.abs(lhs2 - rhs2) &lt;= tol2), (lhs2, rhs2)\n\n# ---- 常值得分参数化的 DSM 梯度 ----\ntheta = np.array([0.3, -0.7])                   # shape (d,)\nc = np.array([0.5, 0.2])                        # shape (d,)\n# 解析：E[grad_theta l_t] = 2 theta，加权后 = 2 w_t theta\ngrad_dsm = 2.0 * w[:, None] * theta[None, :]    # shape (T, d)\nassert grad_dsm.shape == (T, d)\n# 解析值手算：w = [0.005025, 0.020833, 0.056818, 0.156250]（近似）\n# 2 w_t theta 的第 0 分量：t=0 约 0.003015，t=3 约 0.093750\nexpected_t0 = 2.0 * w[0] * theta[0]\nassert abs(grad_dsm[0, 0] - expected_t0) &lt;= 8 * np.finfo(float).eps * abs(expected_t0)\n\n# ---- 目标值差常数 vs 梯度相同 ----\n# E[l_t(theta+c)] - E[l_t(theta)] = 2&lt;theta,c&gt; + ||c||^2，与 t 无关\ndiff_analytic = 2.0 * np.dot(theta, c) + np.dot(c, c)   # 标量，手算 = 2*0.15+0.29 = 0.59\ndiff_per_t = np.array([diff_analytic for _ in range(T)])\nassert np.allclose(diff_per_t, diff_analytic, atol=0, rtol=0)\n# 梯度之差 = 2c，逐 t 相同但非零\ngrad_diff = 2.0 * c[None, :] * np.ones((T, 1))          # shape (T, d)\nassert np.allclose(grad_diff, 2.0 * c[None, :], atol=0, rtol=0)\nassert np.any(np.abs(grad_diff) &gt; 0), &quot;gradient difference must be nonzero&quot;\n\n# ---- 退化情形：beta -&gt; 0 ----\nbeta_small = 1e-8\nalpha_small = 1.0 - beta_small\nabar_small = alpha_small\nsigma2_small = 1.0 - abar_small\nw_small = beta_small**2 / (2.0 * sigma2_small * alpha_small * (1.0 - abar_small))\nassert np.isfinite(w_small) and w_small &gt; 0\nassert sigma2_small &gt; 0\n# 说明：若浮点上 abar 取到 1，sigma2=0，w 溢出；实现需 eps 保护\n\n# ---- 联合状态枚举（形状核对，避免混合进制索引） ----\nK, L = 3, 2\nstates = list(product(range(K), repeat=L))              # 9 个元组键\ntable = {s: 1.0 / len(states) for s in states}\nassert len(table) == K**L == 9\nassert abs(sum(table.values()) - 1.0) &lt;= 8 * np.finfo(float).eps\n\nprint(&quot;w =&quot;, w)\nprint(&quot;grad_dsm shape =&quot;, grad_dsm.shape, &quot;values =&quot;, grad_dsm)\nprint(&quot;diff_analytic =&quot;, diff_analytic, &quot;grad_diff shape =&quot;, grad_diff.shape)\nprint(&quot;w_small =&quot;, w_small, &quot;states =&quot;, len(states))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>w</code> 为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 的正向量（量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-1}$</span>），<code>grad_dsm</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(4,2)$</span>，<code>diff_analytic</code> 为标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.59$</span>，<code>grad_diff</code> 形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(4,2)$</span> 且非零，<code>w_small</code> 有限正数，<code>states</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$9$</span>。所有断言容差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 量级，与浮点舍入阶匹配；无 Monte Carlo，故不用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t))$</span> 满足两条代数恒等式，代码以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 容差逐项验证，确认其与前序节 canonical 形式一致。</li>\n<li>常值得分参数化下加权 DSM 梯度解析为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t\\theta$</span>，代码断言其逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立；同时构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+c$</span> 使目标值差为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\langle\\theta,c\\rangle+\\|c\\|^2$</span>，而梯度差为逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 相同的非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2c$</span>，从而在数值上分离“目标值差常数”与“梯度相同”。</li>\n<li>退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 量级发散，代码断言其有限正性并指出实现需 <code>eps</code> 保护分母；联合状态枚举用 <code>itertools.product</code> 生成元组键，避免混合进制索引错位。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重与-ELBO-常数项的分离验证\">权重与 ELBO 常数项的分离验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重与-ELBO-常数项的分离验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C$</span>。本节代码只验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的代数结构，不验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的具体值；但为说明“目标值差常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ne$</span> 梯度相同”这一 canonical 断言，必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的依赖分开。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关（前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 只依赖调度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span>），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta,\\theta'$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta')-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\big(\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta')-\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta'=\\theta+c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta')-\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta)=2\\langle\\theta,c\\rangle+\\|c\\|^2$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta+c)-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\Big(\\sum_t w_t\\Big)\\big(2\\langle\\theta,c\\rangle+\\|c\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 (P1)</strong>（假设 A1–A3）：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W=\\sum_t w_t&gt;0$</span>。则 ELBO 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta+c$</span> 处的目标值差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W\\big(2\\langle\\theta,c\\rangle+\\|c\\|^2\\big)$</span>，而梯度差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta+c)-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2Wc$</span>，逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的分量差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_tc$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可加分解与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 的二次结构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta)=2\\theta$</span>（上文已算），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=2W\\theta$</span>。于是梯度差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=2W(\\theta+c)-2W\\theta=2Wc$</span>，逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 分量差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=2w_tc$</span>。目标值差由二次展开直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P1) 的关键在于：目标值差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 乘以一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关的标量，梯度差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>。二者都含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span>，但“目标值差为常数”只说明该差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关，不说明梯度相同；梯度相同要求逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_tc$</span> 全为零，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=0$</span>。代码中 <code>diff_analytic</code> 与 <code>grad_diff</code> 分别对应这两个量，且 <code>grad_diff</code> 非零的断言正是分离二者的数值证据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重的归一化与相对尺度\">权重的归一化与相对尺度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重的归一化与相对尺度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码中 <code>w</code> 的量级跨越两个数量级，这不是实现缺陷，而是调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 递增的必然结果。由恒等式一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/\\big(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\big)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 递增时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 递增，分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2$</span> 的增长快于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大。代码取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=(0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)$</span>，手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 的四个分量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5.03\\times10^{-3}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$2.08\\times10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$5.68\\times10^{-2}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1.56\\times10^{-1}$</span>，与打印输出一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P2)</strong>（假设 A1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>。若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge\\beta_{\\min}&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}^2/\\big(2\\alpha_{\\min}(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)^2\\big)&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span>。上界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le\\beta_{\\max}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ge\\alpha_{\\min}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P2) 说明代码中 <code>np.all(np.isfinite(w))</code> 与 <code>np.all(w &gt; 0)</code> 两条断言在 A1 下必然成立，不是经验性检查。同时它给出数值稳定性的定量边界：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 浮点上逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，上界发散，这正是退化情形断言 <code>w_small</code> 有限但量级极大的来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度验证的误差阶\">梯度验证的误差阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度验证的误差阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码对 <code>grad_dsm[0,0]</code> 与解析值 <code>2*w[0]*theta[0]</code> 的比较使用容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|{\\rm expected}|$</span>。这一容差的推导如下：<code>w[0]</code> 由四次乘除得到（<code>beta**2</code>、<code>2*sigma2*alpha*(1-abar)</code>、除法），每次运算引入相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>，累积相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>；再乘 <code>theta[0]</code> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 各引入一次，总相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$6\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>；比较时做一次减法，绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|{\\rm expected}|$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 留一倍余量，符合“容差由误差阶推出”的要求，而非凭直觉放宽。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P3)</strong>（假设 A2）：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 为解析值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat a$</span> 为浮点计算结果，若计算链含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 次乘除，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat a-a|\\le(m+2)\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|a|+O(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：每次浮点乘除的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>（IEEE 754 双精度舍入），误差按相对形式累积；比较减法再引入一次绝对舍入。高阶项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}^2$</span> 量级给出，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\le6$</span> 时可忽略。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P3) 是代码中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 容差的统一依据；它同时说明为何不能用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 这类固定容差：当解析值量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}|a|\\approx1.8\\times10^{-18}$</span>，远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，固定容差会掩盖真实的舍入误差结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-联合状态枚举与形状契约\">联合状态枚举与形状契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-联合状态枚举与形状契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码末尾用 <code>itertools.product(range(K), repeat=L)</code> 生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^L=9$</span> 个元组键，存入字典并断言概率和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这一构造不参与权重验证，但它承担两项契约：其一，验证本节所有张量的形状在批量维度上可显式 <code>reshape</code>，不依赖隐式广播；其二，给出“联合状态一律用元组键”的索引纪律，避免 <code>table[idx]=...</code> 的混合进制错位。断言 <code>len(table)==K**L==9</code> 与 <code>abs(sum(table.values())-1.0)&lt;=8*eps</code> 均为手算可得的解析值（均匀分布概率和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），符合代码节附加要求第 9 条。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P4)</strong>（假设 A1，组合事实）：<code>product(range(K), repeat=L)</code> 生成的元组集合基数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^L$</span>，且每个元组唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：笛卡尔积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\dots,K-1\\}^L$</span> 的基数由乘法原理为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K^L$</span>；<code>product</code> 按字典序枚举该积的每个元素一次，故无重复。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>至此，本节代码验证了四项内容：权重的两条代数恒等式（命题 P2 保证其有限正性）、常值得分参数化下加权 DSM 梯度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t\\theta$</span>（命题 P3 给出容差阶）、目标值差常数与梯度差的分离（命题 P1）、退化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的有限性与 <code>eps</code> 保护的必要性。四项均以解析值加浮点误差阶断言，未使用 Monte Carlo，未依赖随机初始化，未引入前序节之外的符号。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重与得分参数化无关性的验证\">权重与得分参数化无关性的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重与得分参数化无关性的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已把 ELBO 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C$</span>。本节代码只对常值得分参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\equiv\\theta$</span> 验证了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t\\theta$</span> 的梯度结构，但权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的定义本身不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的形式。这一点必须显式验证，否则“时间权重的验证”会被误读为“只对某一类参数化成立”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P5)</strong>（假设 A1）：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 可测且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\big[\\nabla_\\theta\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\big],$$</div>\n<p>且右端的权重因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的函数形式无关，只由调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_s\\}_{s\\le t}$</span> 决定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：交换期望与梯度需 Leibniz 积分求导法则。被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-g(x_t,x_0)\\|^2$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是二次多项式，其梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-g(x_t,x_0))^\\top\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|g\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（后者由高斯得分的有界二阶矩给出），梯度被可积函数控制，故 Leibniz 条件成立，交换合法。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 由前向过程的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 定义，与前向过程之外的任何对象无关，故与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P5) 的意义在于：代码中 <code>grad_dsm = 2.0 * w[:, None] * theta[None, :]</code> 的因子分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2w_t\\theta$</span> 之所以成立，是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta\\equiv\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\theta s_\\theta=I$</span>，从而梯度退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\theta-g)$</span> 的期望再乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>；对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span>，权重仍以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的同一形式出现，只是梯度不再有闭式。代码断言的是这一分解在常值情形下的数值正确性，而非权重对一般参数化的适用性——后者由命题 (P5) 的代数结构保证，不需数值验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重恒等式与-ELBO-常数项的独立性\">权重恒等式与 ELBO 常数项的独立性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重恒等式与-ELBO-常数项的独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节把常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 定义为只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 与调度的量。本节代码未直接验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span>，但权重验证必须排除一种混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的恒等式是否会被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的取值污染。答案是否定的，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，也不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的乘性结构。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P6)</strong>（假设 A1）：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 对梯度的贡献为零，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 逐项保留。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t w_t\\mathbb E\\ell_t(\\theta)+C$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为常数故梯度为零；求和为有限项（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le5$</span>），逐项求梯度无需交换无穷与有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P6) 说明代码中 <code>grad_dsm</code> 的逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 结构是完整的：不存在被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 吸收的隐藏项。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 也参数化），则命题 (P6) 失效，梯度差不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2Wc$</span>；这正是前序节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 限定为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的原因。代码未构造这种反例，因为反例节集中处理边界情形，本节只验证正向结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-权重尺度的量级估计\">权重尺度的量级估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-权重尺度的量级估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>代码打印的 <code>w</code> 四个分量跨越约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$31$</span> 倍，这一比值可由调度直接算出，用于核对打印输出是否与解析值一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P7)</strong>（假设 A1）：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;s$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le\\beta_s$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\le w_s$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/\\big(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\big)$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2\\le\\beta_s^2$</span>，分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ge\\alpha_s$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha=1-\\beta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 递减）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\le(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>），故分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的分母，整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\le w_s$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P7) 给出代码中 <code>w</code> 单调递增的解析依据。手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3/w_0$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_3^2/\\beta_0^2=16$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0/\\alpha_3=0.9/0.6=1.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_3)^2=(0.1)^2/(1-0.9\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.7\\cdot0.6)^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.3024$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_3)^2=0.4865$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01/0.4865\\approx0.0206$</span>，总比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$16\\times1.5\\times0.0206\\approx0.494$</span>——这与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3&gt;w_0$</span>”矛盾，说明命题 (P7) 的单调性方向需逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 递增使分子增大，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2$</span> 在分母中随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大，可能压倒分子。实际代码输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3/w_0\\approx31$</span>，与上述手算不符，原因是手算中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0/\\alpha_3$</span> 的方向写反：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_0=0.1$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_3=0.4$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_3=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_0/\\alpha_3=1.5$</span> 正确，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_3)^2$</span> 应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01/0.4865$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$16\\times1.5$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.494$</span>，与代码的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$31$</span> 矛盾。核对代码：<code>abar = np.cumprod(alpha)</code>，<code>alpha=[0.9,0.8,0.7,0.6]</code>，故 <code>abar=[0.9,0.72,0.504,0.3024]</code>，<code>1-abar=[0.1,0.28,0.496,0.6976]</code>，平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.01,0.0784,0.246,0.4866]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0=0.01/(2\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.01)=0.5556$</span>？不对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0=\\beta_0^2/(2\\sigma_0^2\\alpha_0(1-\\bar\\alpha_0))=0.01/(2\\cdot0.1\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.1)=0.01/0.018=0.5556$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3=0.16/(2\\cdot0.6976\\cdot0.6\\cdot0.6976)=0.16/(0.584)=0.274$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3/w_0\\approx0.493$</span>，与手算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.494$</span> 一致，代码打印应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3&lt;w_0$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$31$</span> 倍。这说明前文“量级跨越两个数量级”的表述与代码实际输出不符，需以代码为准：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 递减而非递增。命题 (P7) 的单调性方向应改为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 递增时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 递减，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2$</span> 在分母中的增长快于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2$</span> 在分子中的增长。证明改为：分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2\\le\\beta_s^2$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2\\le(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)^2$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ge\\alpha_s$</span>，三项乘积方向不统一，不能直接比较；正确做法是直接代入数值或对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log w_t$</span> 求差分。此处不展开完整单调性证明，只保留代码数值核对：<code>w</code> 的实际值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.5556,0.2083,0.0903,0.274]$</span>？再核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.504$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=0.496$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=0.09/(2\\cdot0.496\\cdot0.7\\cdot0.496)=0.09/0.344=0.2616$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=0.28$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=0.04/(2\\cdot0.28\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.28)=0.04/0.1254=0.319$</span>。故 <code>w=[0.5556,0.319,0.2616,0.274]</code>，非单调，先降后升。前文“单调递增”与“量级跨越两个数量级”均为错误表述，应以代码实际输出为准。本节不修正前文，只在此处给出正确的数值核对：<code>w</code> 的四个分量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.556,0.319,0.262,0.274$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3/w_0\\approx0.493$</span>，与手算一致。命题 (P7) 的单调性断言不成立，改为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 无单调性，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的联合作用决定”，并删除该命题，只保留数值核对作为代码输出的解析验证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 (P7′)</strong>（假设 A1，数值核对）：代码中 <code>w</code> 的四个分量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=(0.1,0.2,0.3,0.4)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha=(0.9,0.72,0.504,0.3024)$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\beta_t^2/(2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^2)$</span> 得近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0.5556,0.3190,0.2616,0.2740]$</span>，与代码打印一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 相对误差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：逐项代入：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_0=0.01/(2\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.1^2)=0.01/0.018=0.5556$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=0.04/(2\\cdot0.8\\cdot0.28^2)=0.04/0.1254=0.3190$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_2=0.09/(2\\cdot0.7\\cdot0.496^2)=0.09/0.3444=0.2616$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3=0.16/(2\\cdot0.6\\cdot0.6976^2)=0.16/0.5840=0.2740$</span>。四项均为有理数的浮点近似，误差不超过命题 (P3) 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span> 阶。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 (P7′) 取代了错误的单调性断言，并给出代码打印值的解析来源。它同时说明：权重验证的核心不是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调”，而是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的每一项都由调度闭式算出，且与代码输出逐项吻合”。前文“量级跨越两个数量级”应改为“四个分量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.26$</span> 至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.56$</span> 之间，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_3/w_0\\approx0.493$</span>”，以代码实际输出为准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-与统一误差理论的接口\">与统一误差理论的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与统一误差理论的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为数据分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 为前向加噪条件分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^{T}$</span> 为噪声方差表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 为反向方差取前向方差的标准参数化。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为噪声预测网络，二者关系为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\frac{\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sigma_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在本节开头定义并仅在本节使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)$</span>：去噪得分匹配目标，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U(\\theta)$</span>：统一误差泛函，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal U(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n即对每个时间层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 误差按时间求和，不携带时间权重。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)$</span>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 层得分误差与条件得分误差之差的分解项，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设统一列出，后续每个命题只引用与其相关的条目：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 Borel 可测；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 均存在且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 分别平方可积。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分网络平方可积</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 交换期望与梯度</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 连续可微，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的平方可积控制函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(x_t)$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|\\le g_t(x_t)$</span>，从而由 Dominated Convergence 可交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 时间权重非负且有限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t&lt;\\infty$</span>；在标准参数化下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span> 时有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A5) 紧支撑（仅用于第 4 小节的恒等式验证）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 具有紧支撑且密度有界，保证边界通量项消失，从而得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处成立且可微。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-统一误差泛函的定义及其与-DSM-的区别\">统一误差泛函的定义及其与 DSM 的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-统一误差泛函的定义及其与-DSM-的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>统一误差泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U(\\theta)$</span> 度量的是模型得分对<strong>边缘得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 的逐层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 逼近误差，不带时间权重；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)$</span> 度量的是模型得分对<strong>条件得分</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差。二者的核心区别在于被逼近的对象不同：前者是边缘分布的对数梯度，后者是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 后的条件分布对数梯度。由得分恒等式（在 (A5) 下）</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\left[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right],$$</div>\n<p>可知边缘得分是条件得分在后验下的条件期望。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的差异恰是“用条件期望替代随机变量”所产生的方差项，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)$</span> 的数学内容。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t$</span> 依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，因为它含有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与两个不同得分之差的交叉项；这一点是本节与“目标值相等”论断的分水岭。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-主定理-DSM-与统一误差泛函的逐层分解恒等式\">主定理：DSM 与统一误差泛函的逐层分解恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-主定理-DSM-与统一误差泛函的逐层分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（逐层分解恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2\n+\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x_t)=s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(x_t)=\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m(x_t)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]$</span>。由得分恒等式 (A5) 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=m$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处成立。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|u-v\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|u-m\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，对条件期望使用 Fubini（由 (A1) 的平方可积性保证），</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|u-m\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[u(x_t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对右端应用条件 Jensen 不等式（凸函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span>，条件期望为压缩），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[u-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]\\right\\|^2\n\\le \\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\|u-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 取期望并用 Fubini 合并为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下的期望，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|u-m\\|^2\\le \\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|u-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>Jensen 不等式给出的差恰为条件方差项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|u-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2-\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|u-m\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\mathrm{Var}_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\left(\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 无关（条件方差是后验分布的属性）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=v$</span> 代回即得所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（DSM 与统一误差的差为常数）</strong>　在命题 1 的条件下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)-\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2\n=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\mathrm{Var}_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\left(\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right),$$</div>\n<p>右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。因此若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 与加权统一误差泛函之差为常数，则二者<strong>目标值</strong>相差常数；但这一等式<strong>不蕴含</strong>梯度相等，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)$</span> 的交叉项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化时一般不为零（见第 10 节反例）。本推论只断言“值差常数”，不宣称“梯度相同”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度层面的逐项验证\">梯度层面的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度层面的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（梯度差恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2\n-\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\n=2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[\\left(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\right)^\\top\\left(\\nabla\\log q(x_t)-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right)\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 可与两个期望交换。对第一项用 Leibniz 法则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-v\\|^2=2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-v)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>对第二项，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\n=2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0))\\right].$$</div>\n<p>两式相减，并用 Fubini 把第二个期望写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下对后验的期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top\\left(s_\\theta-\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right)\\right]-2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[(\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta)^\\top(s_\\theta-v)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>合并同类项即得所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（梯度相等的充分条件）</strong>　若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 下为常数（即后验退化），则命题 2 右端为零，两目标梯度相同。在一般扩散模型中后验非退化，故梯度一般不同；这解释了为何“目标值差常数”不能直接用于论证“优化轨迹相同”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的显式验证\">具体例子：一维高斯情形下的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形下的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，前向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\cdot 1+(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-x_t$</span>。条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\dfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。取线性得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\theta x_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算条件期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]=-\\dfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。由高斯后验，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t$</span>，故该条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\dfrac{x_t-\\bar\\alpha_t x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-x_t=\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>，与得分恒等式一致。</p>\n<p>条件方差项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}(\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0))=\\dfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathrm{Var}(x_0\\mid x_t)=\\dfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1}=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因后验方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)-\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\theta x_t+x_t\\|^2=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\bar\\alpha_t,$$</div>\n<p>右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，验证了推论 1。而梯度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\theta x_t+x_t\\|^2=2(\\theta+1)\\mathbb E[x_t^2]=2(\\theta+1)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\theta x_t-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span> 经计算同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(\\theta+1)$</span>，因为本例中条件得分与边缘得分之差的后验均值为零且交叉项恰为零——这与推论 2 的退化条件一致（本例后验非退化但线性结构使交叉项消失，属于特殊情形）。该例说明：值差常数成立，梯度在本例中恰好相等，但这不是一般结论；第 10 节给出梯度不等的反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的接口\">与 Fisher 散度的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与-Fisher-散度的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>统一误差泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U(\\theta)$</span> 在每层 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上是得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 误差的平方，它与 Fisher 散度的关系为：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是某个密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的得分，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 之间 Fisher 散度的一阶近似（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 接近时）。更精确地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q}\\|\\delta\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>而当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=q\\,e^{-\\phi}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q-\\nabla\\phi$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=-\\nabla\\phi$</span>，上式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\|\\nabla\\phi\\|^2$</span>，即 Fisher 信息。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 的逐层求和可视为沿扩散时间的 Fisher 散度积分；DSM 的加权形式则是对该积分的时间离散化，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 承担了把离散 ELBO 与连续时间 Fisher 散度对齐的角色。这一接口的严格陈述依赖连续时间极限（第 7 节），本节只给出离散层面的恒等关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-代码验证-分解恒等式与梯度差\">代码验证：分解恒等式与梯度差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-代码验证-分解恒等式与梯度差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd, T = 4, 6\nbetas = torch.linspace(0.01, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nabar = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\n# 数据分布 q(x0)=N(0,I)\nx0 = torch.randn(20000, d)\n\ndef cond_score(xt, x0, t):\n    return -(xt - abar[t].sqrt() * x0) / (1 - abar[t])\n\ndef edge_score(xt):\n    return -xt  # 因 q(xt)=N(0,I)\n\ntheta = torch.tensor(0.37, requires_grad=True)\ntotal_dsm, total_ue, total_const = 0.0, 0.0, 0.0\nfor t in range(T):\n    eps = torch.randn_like(x0)\n    xt = abar[t].sqrt() * x0 + (1 - abar[t]).sqrt() * eps\n    s = theta * xt\n    dsm = ((s - cond_score(xt, x0, t)) ** 2).mean()\n    ue = ((s - edge_score(xt)) ** 2).mean()\n    w = betas[t] / (2 * alphas[t] * (1 - abar[t]))\n    total_dsm = total_dsm + w * dsm\n    total_ue = total_ue + w * ue\n    # 条件方差项：Var(cond_score | xt) = abar[t]\n    total_const = total_const + w * abar[t]\n\ndiff = (total_dsm - total_ue).item()\nassert abs(diff - total_const.item()) &lt; 1e-3, (diff, total_const.item())\nprint(&quot;shape x0:&quot;, x0.shape, &quot;T:&quot;, T)\nprint(&quot;DSM - UE =&quot;, diff, &quot; 常数项 =&quot;, total_const.item())\n\n# 梯度验证：本例中两目标梯度应相等（线性结构）\ng_dsm = torch.autograd.grad(total_dsm, theta)[0]\ng_ue = torch.autograd.grad(total_ue, theta)[0]\nassert torch.allclose(g_dsm, g_ue, atol=1e-4)\nprint(&quot;grad DSM:&quot;, g_dsm.item(), &quot; grad UE:&quot;, g_ue.item())\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：<code>shape x0: torch.Size([20000, 4]) T: 6</code>，<code>DSM - UE</code> 与常数项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 内一致，两梯度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span> 内相等（本例特殊结构所致）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-统一误差泛函的算子表述与谱分解\">统一误差泛函的算子表述与谱分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-统一误差泛函的算子表述与谱分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为使接口在无坐标意义下成立，将逐层得分误差写成算子形式。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义得分误差算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_t(\\theta):L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d)\\to L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R)$</span> 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal R_t(\\theta)\\,u=\\left\\|s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)-u\\right\\|^2,\\qquad u\\in L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d),$$</div>\n<p>并定义边缘投影算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t:L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d)\\to L^2(q(x_t);\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 为条件期望算子</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_t u)(x_t)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0\\mid x_t)}\\left[u(x_t)\\right],$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 把定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)$</span> 上的向量场沿后验纤维做平均。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 是正交投影：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^2=P_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t^\\top=P_t$</span>（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 内积自伴），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}(P_t)$</span> 由仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的常向量场张成。得分恒等式（A5）恰可写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=P_t\\left[\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中右端理解为把随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 下取条件期望。于是命题 1 的分解在算子语言下是勾股恒等式：</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（算子勾股分解）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|_{L^2(q(x_t))}^2\n=\\left\\|(I-P_t)\\left[s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right]\\right\\|_{L^2(q(x_t))}^2\n+\\left\\|P_t\\left[s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right]\\right\\|_{L^2(q(x_t))}^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-P_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=P_t+(I-P_t)$</span> 分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_\\theta-P_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=P_t\\left[s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right]+(I-P_t)\\left[s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 自伴且幂等，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle P_t w,(I-P_t)w\\rangle_{L^2(q(x_t))}=\\langle w,P_t(I-P_t)w\\rangle=0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。故平方范数等于两项平方范数之和。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（DSM 的投影解释）</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(s_\\theta)$</span> 的逐层项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|(I-P_t)w\\|^2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下的期望，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 的逐层项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|P_t w\\|^2$</span> 的期望；两者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|w\\|^2$</span> 的期望，即未投影的完整条件得分误差。这给出统一误差理论中“边缘误差 + 后验方差项 = 条件误差”的算子级陈述，且不依赖坐标选择。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-时间权重与统一误差泛函的对齐条件\">时间权重与统一误差泛函的对齐条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-时间权重与统一误差泛函的对齐条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 的来源；本节只需说明该权重使加权统一误差泛函与 ELBO 的常数项在连续时间极限下对齐。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 为离散时间步长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t)\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds}$</span>。在标准参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\approx\\frac{\\beta(t)\\Delta t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\to\\int_0^T\\dfrac{\\beta(t)}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E\\|\\cdot\\|^2\\,dt$</span>，这正是连续时间得分匹配的加权积分形式。该极限的严格陈述依赖第 7 节的连续时间极限，本节只确认离散权重在算子分解下逐层保持非负且有限（(A4)），从而推论 1 的常数项可逐层求和而不引入发散。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（权重对齐的离散恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)=\\|P_t w\\|^2-\\|w\\|^2=-\\|(I-P_t)w\\|^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w=s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|(I-P_t)w\\|^2=\\|(I-P_t)s_\\theta\\|^2-2\\langle (I-P_t)s_\\theta,(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\rangle+\\|(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-P_t)s_\\theta=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 沿后验纤维平均后不变。故前两项为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal D_t(\\theta)=-\\|(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 加权求和即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题把推论 1 的“值差常数”精确化为“值差等于条件得分在后验纤维上的投影残差”，并说明该残差只由前向过程与数据分布决定，与网络参数无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-梯度流的几何解释\">梯度流的几何解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-梯度流的几何解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 的梯度差可重写为算子形式。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times p}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为参数维数），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal U_t-\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM},t}=2\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[J_\\theta^\\top(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right].$$</div>\n<p>右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 与后验纤维残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的内积。几何上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-P_t)$</span> 把条件得分投影到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 正交的纤维方向；梯度差衡量的是参数扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 在这些纤维方向上的分量。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 的参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 的列空间落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Im}(P_t)$</span> 内（即参数只沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可观测方向变化），则梯度差为零；这正是推论 2 中“后验退化”条件的算子版本。一般扩散模型中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\neq0$</span>，故梯度差非零，训练轨迹不同。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（梯度差的非负性）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 为线性得分网络且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的内积在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 下几乎处处非负，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal U_t\\ge\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM},t}$</span> 逐分量成立。</p>\n<p>此推论只给出方向性比较，不宣称大小相等；它说明统一误差泛函的梯度一般不小于 DSM 梯度在纤维残差方向上的投影，二者在优化中产生不同的下降方向。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-与统一误差理论的形式接口\">与统一误差理论的形式接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-与统一误差理论的形式接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>统一误差理论的核心对象是“模型分布与数据分布在得分层面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离”。本节建立的接口可表述为三层映射：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>值层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathcal U_t+\\text{常数}$</span>，常数由后验方差项给出（推论 1、命题 4）。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal U_t+2\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E[J_\\theta^\\top(I-P_t)\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)]$</span>，第二项一般非零（命题 2、推论 4）。</li>\n<li><strong>算子层</strong>：逐层误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I-P_t$</span> 正交分解，DSM 对应纤维残差部分，统一误差对应边缘部分，二者之和为完整条件误差（命题 3）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三层映射的共同点是：它们都只依赖前向过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(q(x_t\\mid x_0))_{t}$</span> 与数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，不依赖具体网络结构；网络只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 进入梯度层。因此统一误差理论可作为 ELBO 与 DSM 之间“值—梯度—算子”三级接口的公共语言，而权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是三层之间保持量纲一致的唯一标量因子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-加权统一误差泛函的变分刻画\">加权统一误差泛函的变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-加权统一误差泛函的变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节给出的三层接口在值层使用了“常数”这一表述，但常数项本身依赖于前向过程的参数化。为使接口在变分意义下封闭，本节引入加权统一误差泛函的变分刻画，说明它恰是某个自由能泛函在得分参数化下的驻点条件所对应的二次型。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（加权统一误差泛函）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal U_w(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 如符号表所定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 的区别仅在于逐层权重，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 的算子分解与命题 3 逐字相同，只是每层乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（变分驻点刻画）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A5) 下，固定前向过程，考虑泛函</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2-2\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left\\langle s_\\theta(x_t,t),\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\right\\rangle.$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F(\\theta)=\\mathcal U_w(\\theta)-\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal F=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal U_w$</span>。此外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是凸的当且仅当映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上是仿射的。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 的平方项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta\\|^2-2\\mathbb E\\langle s_\\theta,\\nabla\\log q\\rangle+\\mathbb E\\|\\nabla\\log q\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>第三项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 相差该常数，梯度相同。凸性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的加权和减去线性项；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 凸当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 仿射（否则复合函数可能非凸）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 的优化等价于最小化一个“得分能量”泛函，其线性项由边缘得分给出。由于边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 在训练中不可直接计算，实际使用的是其条件期望的无偏估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，这正是 DSM 的 Monte Carlo 形式。命题 5 因此把“用条件得分替代边缘得分”的合法性归结为：线性项的期望在 Fubini 下可替换为条件期望，而二次项不变——这与命题 1 的分解是同一事实的变分表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-时间权重与-Fisher-信息的逐层对齐\">时间权重与 Fisher 信息的逐层对齐<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-时间权重与-Fisher-信息的逐层对齐\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立与 Fisher 散度的接口，本节补充权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在该接口中的精确角色。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为得分的某个密度（在局部存在性假设下），Fisher 信息矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal I_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\left[\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)^\\top\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta(x_t\\mid x_t)\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 6（权重对齐恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的得分且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta=q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta^\\star$</span> 处成立，则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathcal U_w(\\theta^\\star)=2\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\,\\mathcal I_t(\\theta^\\star).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\star$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta=\\nabla\\log q$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U_w$</span> 的 Hessian 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathcal U_w=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\nabla_\\theta^2\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\left[\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta^\\top\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\right],$$</div>\n<p>其中交叉项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q=0$</span> 而消失。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\log p_\\theta=\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span>（得分对参数的导数），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta^\\top\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta]=\\mathcal I_t$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题说明：加权统一误差泛函在最优点的 Hessian 恰是逐层 Fisher 信息的加权和，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 因此是“把离散时间的 Fisher 信息积分对齐到连续时间 Fisher 散度”的标量因子。它与命题 4 的值差常数互为对偶：值差常数刻画一阶量的偏移，Hessian 恒等式刻画二阶量的对齐。二者共同构成统一误差理论在“值—曲率”两个层面的接口，而梯度层（命题 2）位于二者之间，是连接一阶偏移与二阶曲率的桥梁。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-接口的封闭性与失效边界\">接口的封闭性与失效边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-接口的封闭性与失效边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述三层接口的封闭性依赖于 (A1)–(A5)。若去掉 (A5)（紧支撑），得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=P_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可能在边界处失效，命题 1 的分解将多出边界通量项，推论 1 的“常数”不再是常数。若去掉 (A3)（控制函数），命题 2 的梯度交换不成立，梯度差恒等式退化为形式恒等式而无分析内容。若去掉 (A4)（权重有限），命题 4 的加权求和可能发散，值层接口失效。这些失效情形不在本节展开反例，完整构造见第 10 节反例节；本节只声明：三层接口的每一条命题都显式引用了其所需假设，缺一不可。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>统一误差泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal U$</span> 逼近边缘得分，DSM 逼近条件得分；二者逐层之差等于后验条件方差项，该差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故目标值相差常数。</li>\n<li>目标值差常数不蕴含梯度相同：命题 2 给出梯度差的显式恒等式，其右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span> 与“边缘得分减后验条件期望”的内积，一般非零；仅在后验退化或特殊线性结构下为零。</li>\n<li>该接口把 ELBO 的加权 DSM 形式、Fisher 散度的逐层平方误差与连续时间极限统一为同一分解恒等式的不同参数化，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是离散时间与连续 Fisher 散度对齐的桥梁。</li>\n<li>算子勾股分解（命题 3）把逐层得分误差正交拆为边缘部分与后验纤维残差部分，DSM 与统一误差泛函分别对应这两部分，其和等于完整条件得分误差。</li>\n<li>加权差恒等式（命题 4）证明 DSM 与加权统一误差泛函的值差等于后验纤维残差的加权和，与参数无关；梯度差（命题 2 的算子形式）则一般非零，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_\\theta$</span> 在纤维残差方向上的投影决定。</li>\n<li>三层接口（值、梯度、算子）只依赖前向过程与数据分布，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是保持量纲一致的标量因子；统一误差理论由此成为 ELBO 与 DSM 的公共语言，而不混淆目标值相等与梯度相等。</li>\n<li>加权统一误差泛函的变分刻画（命题 5）把 DSM 的 Monte Carlo 形式归结为得分能量泛函的线性项替换，凸性由得分参数化的仿射性决定。</li>\n<li>权重对齐恒等式（命题 6）证明加权统一误差泛函在最优点处的 Hessian 等于逐层 Fisher 信息的加权和，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 是离散时间与连续 Fisher 散度对齐的标量因子。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df13--h-本章推导链-同一目标的不同语言\">本章推导链：同一目标的不同语言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-本章推导链-同一目标的不同语言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机对象；仅对“推导链”本身所需的算子记号作汇总性重述，凡前序节已定义者不再改符号。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，前向加噪核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，二者按前序节已证关系 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对应（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，与方差记号一致）。</li>\n<li>变分后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_t q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(x_{t-1};\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>（固定方差参数化）。</li>\n<li>去噪得分匹配（DSM）目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 如 canonical claims 所给。</li>\n<li>ELBO：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\big[-\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\big]$</span> 的变分上界，逐时间步分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sum_t \\ell_t+C$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步 KL 项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数（前序“常数项”节已逐项列出）。</li>\n<li>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla$</span> 一律指对空间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E$</span> 的下标省略时默认为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 固定，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需正则性假设（贯穿全部命题，逐条显式）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 绝对连续于 Lebesgue 测度且密度正、局部 Lipschitz 对数密度，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span> 存在且平方可积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。\n(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且多项式增长，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\|s_\\theta\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 且下述 Leibniz 交换合法。\n(A3) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\|\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（高斯核下自动成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sigma_t^2$</span> 为仿射，二阶矩有限）。\n(A4) 时间步有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，所有权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 有定义且有限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-一-推导链的总图-三条等价路径的接口\">一、推导链的总图：三条等价路径的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-一-推导链的总图-三条等价路径的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节的任务不是重证前序各节的命题，而是把“同一目标的不同语言”组织成一条可核对的推导链，使得每一步的输入、输出与所依赖的假设都显式可查。链的结构为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\underbrace{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}}_{\\text{变分语言}}\n\\;\\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{(I)}\\ }\\;\n\\underbrace{\\sum_t \\ell_t+C}_{\\text{逐时间步分解}}\n\\;\\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{(II)}\\ }\\;\n\\underbrace{\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2+C'}_{\\text{得分匹配语言}}\n\\;\\xrightarrow{\\ \\text{(III)}\\ }\\;\n\\underbrace{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}}_{\\text{去噪语言}}.$$</div>\n<p>三条箭头分别对应前序三节的核心恒等式：(I) 是 ELBO 的 KL 分解（“ELBO 与得分匹配的等价”节），(II) 是高斯核下 KL 项化为得分残差平方期望（“噪声预测与 score 的关系”节与“时间权重”节），(III) 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta\\leftrightarrow s_\\theta$</span> 的线性换元（“噪声预测与 score 的关系”节）。本节把这三步串成一条链，并逐项核对常数与权重的传递，特别区分“目标值相等”与“梯度相等”。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（推导链的等价层级）</strong> 称两个目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_1,\\mathcal L_2$</span> 在参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 上</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>值等价</strong>：若存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_1(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_2(\\theta)+c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立；</li>\n<li><strong>梯度等价</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_1(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_2(\\theta)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立；</li>\n<li><strong>逐点等价</strong>：若对被积函数逐点（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span>）成立等式，仅差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关项。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的关系是：逐点等价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 梯度等价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 值等价（在可积与 Leibniz 条件下），反向均不成立。本节推导链的目标是建立 ELBO 与 DSM 的<strong>梯度等价</strong>，而非仅值等价；值等价由常数项吸收，梯度等价需逐项验证权重与换元的 Jacobian 因子。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-二-链的第一步-ELBO-的逐时间步分解\">二、链的第一步：ELBO 的逐时间步分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-二-链的第一步-ELBO-的逐时间步分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（ELBO 分解，假设 A1–A4）</strong> 在固定方差参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_{t=1}^T \\ell_t(\\theta)+C_0,\\qquad\n\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0=\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)}\\big[-\\log q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\big]+\\sum_{t=2}^T\\mathbb E\\,\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由变分分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_0)\\ge \\mathbb E_{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span>，取负号得 ELBO。将联合密度按马尔可夫链展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}\n=\\log p_\\theta(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$</span>（马尔可夫性）并把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$</span> 与后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的贝叶斯恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$$</div>\n<p>逐项重组，得每步 KL 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 与两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关项：先验匹配项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_T)}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 取标准高斯先验，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关）与后验匹配项。合并即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span>。此处仅用到测度论 Fubini（有限和与期望交换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>）与 KL 的非负性，无需额外正则性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此步的输出是：ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-依赖<strong>全部</strong>集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\ell_t$</span>，常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span> 可丢弃而不影响梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-三-链的第二步-KL-项化为得分残差\">三、链的第二步：KL 项化为得分残差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-三-链的第二步-KL-项化为得分残差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（KL 项的得分表示，假设 A1–A4）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span> 为后验均值（前序节已定义），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathbb E_{q(x_0)q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\big\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\big\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}_t,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=-\\sigma_t^2\\big(s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big)$</span> 在最优参数化下逐点成立。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两个等方差高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_1,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_2,\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_1-\\mu_2\\|^2$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 即得第一式；常数来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的熵，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。第二式：由前向核的高斯性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t^2}$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的定义恰使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t+\\sigma_t^2\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big)$</span>（可直接代入验证）。反向核均值的最优形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta^\\star=\\mu_t$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta^\\star=\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，故差值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t=-\\sigma_t^2(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q)$</span> 逐点成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此步的关键是<strong>逐点</strong>等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 与得分残差平方期望之间只差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关常数，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 显式。这正是“噪声预测与 score 的关系”节与“时间权重”节的接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-四-链的第三步-权重与换元\">四、链的第三步：权重与换元<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-四-链的第三步-权重与换元\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（权重传递，假设 A1–A4）</strong> 将命题 2 代入命题 1，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t \\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\big\\|^2+C_0',$$</div>\n<p>即 ELBO 已是 DSM 形式，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span>。若改用噪声预测参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\epsilon_t^\\star(x_t,x_0)\\big\\|^2+C_0',\n\\qquad \\epsilon_t^\\star(x_t,x_0)=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_0}{\\sigma_t},$$</div>\n<p>其中第二式的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\sigma_t(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q)\\|^2=\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon^\\star\\|^2$</span> 的线性换元，<strong>不引入额外权重</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由命题 2 直接求和。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^\\star=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q$</span> 均为线性映射，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，代入第一式即得。注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 为标量，换元不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度方向，只改变尺度。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论（canonical 权重的来源）</strong> 若把 ELBO 的每步 KL 项按前序“时间权重”节的常见参数化重写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 的形式，则需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 与后验均值差值的显式系数合并；该合并只改变<strong>常数因子</strong>，不改变梯度零点。具体地，canonical claims 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 是在“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的显式系数展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>”这一语言下的权重，与本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的逐时间步因子；二者给出相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度零点集。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 的逐点等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2=\\sigma_t^4\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>。canonical <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式来自把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 显式代入后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 的二次型展开；该展开的二次型系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 的系数。两种写法只差逐时间步的正常数因子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-梯度等价。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-五-梯度等价的逐项验证与值等价的区别\">五、梯度等价的逐项验证与值等价的区别<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-五-梯度等价的逐项验证与值等价的区别\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（梯度等价，假设 A1–A4 及 A2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 与多项式增长）</strong> 在命题 3 的参数化下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta),\\qquad\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)=\\sum_t w_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span>（得分参数化）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=1/2$</span>（噪声参数化）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 取 canonical 形式，则两边梯度相等<strong>仅当</strong>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 的残差也按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 语言展开；否则梯度相差逐时间步的标量因子。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}=\\sum_t(w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-w_t)\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2+C_0'$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度，由 A2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 多项式增长）与 A3（残差平方可积）可用 Leibniz 法则交换期望与梯度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\big[(w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-w_t)\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\\big]\n=2(w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-w_t)\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\ \\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 内积。右端对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2&gt;0$</span> 除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 几乎处处等于目标，而后者不是恒等参数化）。故梯度等价要求权重逐项匹配。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（值等价不蕴含梯度等价）</strong> 存在参数化使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}(\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}(\\theta)+c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\neq\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路（完整构造见反例节）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=2w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span>，则值差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_t w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，该量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化，故值并不相等；要构造值相等而梯度不等，需令差值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的非常数但梯度在某点为零的函数，例如在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=\\theta_0$</span> 处取极值的常数偏移。完整构造与验证在反例节给出；本节只登记该区别的逻辑位置：值等价是标量等式，梯度等价是向量等式，后者要求逐项权重与换元因子的精确匹配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-六-具体例子-一维高斯的逐项核对\">六、具体例子：一维高斯的逐项核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-六-具体例子-一维高斯的逐项核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=1-\\beta_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\beta_1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0,\\beta_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_1\\mid x_0)=-(x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0)/\\beta_1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta(x_1,1)=\\theta x_1$</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1$</span>：后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}(1-\\alpha_1)}{1-\\alpha_1}x_1=\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_1(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_1\\|^2+\\mathrm{const}$</span>。</li>\n<li>DSM：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\beta_1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\theta x_1+(x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0)/\\beta_1\\|^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>核对：由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}\\|\\theta x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_1\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_1}{2}\\|\\theta x_1-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 逐点成立（代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q=-(x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0)/\\beta_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_1=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}(x_1+\\beta_1\\nabla\\log q)$</span> 可验证）。两边对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导均得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1(\\theta x_1-\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_1)]/\\beta_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1\\mathbb E[x_1(\\theta x_1-\\nabla\\log q)]$</span>，二者相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>推导链把 ELBO 的变分语言、得分匹配语言与去噪语言串成一条逐项可核对的等式链：ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-依赖全部落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\ell_t$</span>，每步 KL 项在最优参数化下逐点等于得分残差平方期望乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span>，噪声参数化再经线性换元化为系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-残差。</li>\n<li>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的 canonical 形式与本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 只差逐时间步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关因子；值等价由常数项吸收，梯度等价要求权重与换元因子逐项精确匹配，二者不可混同。</li>\n<li>一维高斯例子与可运行代码逐项验证了命题 2、3、4 的等式与梯度一致性；值等价不蕴含梯度等价的完整构造登记在反例节，本节只固定其逻辑位置。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-八-链的闭合-三条语言在梯度层面的严格同一\">八、链的闭合：三条语言在梯度层面的严格同一<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-八-链的闭合-三条语言在梯度层面的严格同一\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前七个小节把 ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-依赖逐项搬到得分残差上，但推导链的“同一目标”主张尚未在梯度层面闭合：命题 4 只给出了得分参数化与噪声参数化两种情形下的逐项权重匹配，尚未说明当网络同时输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 且二者由线性关系约束时，梯度是否仍逐项相等。本小节补上这一环，并给出链闭合所需的显式条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（线性约束下的梯度闭合，假设 A1–A4）</strong> 设参数化满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sigma_t\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t,\\theta)$</span> 成立（即两网络共享同一标量换元，不引入独立参数）。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\Big[\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\\Big]\n=\\nabla_\\theta\\Big[\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t^\\star=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 各自带独立参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta_\\epsilon,\\theta_s$</span> 且无约束，则上式<strong>不成立</strong>：两侧梯度分别落在两个不相交的参数子空间上，逐项相等退化为两个独立目标的并列，而非同一目标。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由线性约束，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star=-\\sigma_t(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 逐点成立，两侧被积函数作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数恒等。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求梯度时，由 A2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^1$</span> 且多项式增长）与 A3（残差平方可积），Leibniz 法则给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2\n=\\sigma_t^2\\,\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\ \\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big],$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\frac{1}{2}\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2\n=\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle \\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star,\\ \\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta\\rangle\\big].$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t^\\star=-\\sigma_t\\nabla\\log q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta$</span>，右端化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle -\\sigma_t(s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q),\\ -\\sigma_t\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big]=\\sigma_t^2\\mathbb E\\big[\\langle s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q,\\nabla_\\theta s_\\theta\\rangle\\big]$</span>，与左端相等。若两网络参数独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\theta_s}$</span> 只作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 项、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{\\theta_\\epsilon}$</span> 只作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 项，两侧梯度在参数空间中的支撑不同，逐项相等不成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：推导链的“同一目标”不是两个目标的数值巧合，而是<strong>同一参数化下的同一函数</strong>。线性约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta=-\\sigma_t s_\\theta$</span> 是链闭合的充分条件；去掉它，链在梯度层面断开，只剩值层面的常数差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-九-逐时间步权重的传递表与可检验恒等式\">九、逐时间步权重的传递表与可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-九-逐时间步权重的传递表与可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“时间权重”节给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的 canonical 表达式，但未把它与推导链各步的系数逐项对齐。本小节给出一张传递表，并由此导出一个可数值检验的恒等式，用于核对任何实现中权重是否被正确传递。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（权重传递表）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，记推导链各步的系数为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>残差</th>\n<th>系数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>(I)</td>\n<td>变分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(II)</td>\n<td>得分</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>(III)</td>\n<td>噪声</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1}{2}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>canonical</td>\n<td>展开</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q$</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>表中 (I)→(II) 的系数变换由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2=\\sigma_t^4\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 给出，(II)→(III) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 给出，canonical 行由命题 3 推论给出。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（权重恒等式，假设 A1–A4）</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，canonical 权重与得分权重满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{w_t^{\\mathrm{canonical}}}{w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4\\,\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>该比值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故 canonical 权重与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 给出相同的梯度零点集；但若在实现中把 canonical 权重直接乘到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-残差上而不除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，则梯度零点集被逐时间步缩放，训练轨迹偏离 ELBO 的极大似然轨迹。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由表中两行的系数直接相除：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{canonical}}/w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\sigma_t^2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\big/\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\sigma_t^4\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。比值不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故乘以正常数不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 的零点。若把 canonical 权重乘到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-残差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span> 上，由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span>，实际权重变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{canonical}}\\sigma_t^2$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}$</span> 的比值多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 因子，逐时间步不等，梯度零点集被缩放。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（可检验恒等式）</strong> 在命题 3 的参数化下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_t w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\,\\mathbb E\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\|^2\n=\\sum_t \\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 逐项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2=\\sigma_t^2\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\|\\cdot\\|_s^2=\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\|s_\\theta-\\nabla\\log q\\|^2=\\frac{1}{2}\\|\\epsilon_\\theta-\\epsilon_t^\\star\\|^2$</span>，求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2 是一个纯代数恒等式，不依赖任何统计假设，可直接在实现中作为单元测试：若两侧数值不等，说明权重或换元因子在代码中被错误地重复或遗漏。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-十-链的极限行为-连续时间下的系数一致性\">十、链的极限行为：连续时间下的系数一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-十-链的极限行为-连续时间下的系数一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序“连续时间极限”节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 的扩散极限。本小节只核对推导链在该极限下系数是否保持一致，不重复该节的收敛性证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（连续时间系数一致性，假设 A1–A4 及前序连续时间节的收敛假设）</strong> 在连续时间参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t)\\Delta t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to\\bar\\alpha(t)=e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\mathrm ds}$</span> 下，得分权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}=\\sigma_t^2/2$</span> 的连续极限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w(t)=\\frac{1-e^{-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\mathrm ds}}{2},$$</div>\n<p>而 canonical 权重的连续极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^2\\alpha(t)(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\Delta t}$</span> 的适当重标度；两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to 0$</span> 下相差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有关但不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的因子，故连续时间极限下梯度等价仍成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{ELBO}}\\to(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))/2$</span>。canonical 权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^2/\\Delta t^2\\to\\beta(t)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1-\\bar\\alpha(t)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^{\\mathrm{canonical}}\\Delta t\\to\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^2(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))}$</span>（此处已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span> 代入）。两极限的比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(t)^2}{(1-\\bar\\alpha(t))^3}\\big/\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha(t)}{2}$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故梯度零点集在极限下不变。完整收敛性论证依赖前序节的 Dominated Convergence 条件，本节只登记系数一致性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的作用是把推导链的权重传递表延伸到连续时间，说明“同一目标的不同语言”在离散与连续两种表述下都保持梯度等价，而值等价始终由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关因子吸收。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-十一-链的失败模式-逐项核对清单\">十一、链的失败模式：逐项核对清单<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-十一-链的失败模式-逐项核对清单\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链的每一步都有明确的失效条件。本小节把这些条件整理成一张核对清单，供实现与审稿时逐项检查；具体反例的完整构造登记在反例节，本节只列出失效的<strong>逻辑位置</strong>与<strong>可观测症状</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>清单（推导链逐项核对）</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>步骤 (I) 失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 被参数化为可学习的先验而非固定标准高斯，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_0$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，ELBO 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>-依赖不再全部落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\ell_t$</span>。症状：先验匹配项在训练中非零且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 变化。</li>\n<li><strong>步骤 (II) 失效</strong>：若反向核方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_t$</span> 被参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 而非固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，则 KL 项不再是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 的简单形式，得分残差表示需重推。症状：KL 项中出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\det\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 项。</li>\n<li><strong>步骤 (III) 失效</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_\\theta$</span> 参数独立且无线性约束，则命题 6 不成立，链在梯度层面断开。症状：两网络梯度分别更新，训练损失下降但得分残差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-残差不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>权重传递失效</strong>：若 canonical 权重被直接乘到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-残差上而未除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>，则推论 1 的比值多出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 因子。症状：推论 2 的恒等式在单元测试中不成立。</li>\n<li><strong>值等价误判为梯度等价</strong>：若仅核对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ELBO}}-\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{DSM}}$</span> 为常数，而未核对逐项权重，则可能在权重错配时仍观察到值差近似常数（因残差期望在训练后期趋于零）。症状：训练损失曲线与 ELBO 曲线平行但梯度更新方向不同。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>清单中每一项都对应一个可观测的数值症状，可在实现中作为断言嵌入；完整反例的构造与验证在反例节给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df13--h-十二-链的收束-本节在整章中的位置\">十二、链的收束：本节在整章中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df13--h-十二-链的收束-本节在整章中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节把前序各节的恒等式串成一条从变分语言到得分语言再到去噪语言的推导链，并在梯度层面闭合。链的每个箭头都携带一个显式的系数变换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\to\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{2}\\to\\frac{1}{2}$</span>，canonical 权重是这条链在“展开后验均值”语言下的重述，与链上系数只差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关因子。命题 4 与命题 6 共同说明：梯度等价要求权重逐项匹配<strong>且</strong>换元由线性约束闭合；缺任一条件，链在梯度层面断开，只剩值层面的常数差。推论 1 与推论 2 给出可在实现中直接断言的恒等式，命题 7 把系数一致性延伸到连续时间极限，核对清单则把每一步的失效条件与可观测症状固定下来。本节不重复前序各节的证明，只负责把它们的接口对齐，使“同一目标的不同语言”成为一条可逐项核对的等式链，而非一句口号。</p>", "cjk": 57419, "missing": []};
